VALUES ('apple-macbook-air-15', 'Apple MacBook Air 15" — M3 Chip, 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-15.webp', 'The MacBook Air 15" with Apple M3 chip is the world''s best-selling 15-inch laptop for a reason. The expansive 15.3-inch Liquid Retina display with 500 nits brightness and P3 wide color brings creative projects to life with extraordinary accuracy. The M3 chip''s 8-core CPU and 10-core GPU deliver up to 18x faster performance than Intel-based MacBook Air models, while the fanless design ensures absolute silence. With up to 18 hours of battery life, MagSafe 3 charging, and a six-speaker sound system with Spatial Audio, this is the ultimate thin-and-light powerhouse for students, creatives, and mobile professionals. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-15.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

