VALUES ('apple-macbook-pro-14', 'Apple MacBook Pro 14" — M4 Pro Chip, 18GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 2950000, 2950000, 2419000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-14.webp', 'The MacBook Pro 14" with M4 Pro chip is a mobile workstation that redefines professional computing. The 14.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display with 1600 nits peak brightness, ProMotion adaptive refresh rate, and Extreme Dynamic Range delivers reference-grade color accuracy for cinema-quality video editing. The M4 Pro chip''s 14-core CPU and 20-core GPU handle 8K ProRes workflows, complex 3D rendering, and machine learning training with effortless grace. With up to 22 hours of battery life, an advanced thermal architecture, and a comprehensive array of Thunderbolt 5 ports, HDMI, and SDXC card slot, this is the laptop that replaces desktop workstations. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2419000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-14.webp', 2684000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

