VALUES ('apple-macbook-pro-16', 'Apple MacBook Pro 16" — M4 Max Chip, 36GB RAM, 1TB SSD', 'laptops', 4200000, 4200000, 3444000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-16.webp', 'The MacBook Pro 16" with M4 Max is the most powerful laptop Apple has ever created. The stunning 16.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display, M4 Max chip with 16-core CPU and 40-core GPU, and 36GB unified memory create a mobile studio capable of handling the most demanding 8K video production, visual effects compositing, and AI model development. With up to 22 hours of battery life, six Thunderbolt 5 ports, and a six-speaker high-fidelity sound system with force-canceling woofers, this machine is engineered for professionals who refuse to compromise. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3444000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-16.webp', 3822000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

