VALUES ('hp-elitebook-840-g10', 'HP EliteBook 840 G10 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 1250000, 1250000, 1024000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-elitebook-840-g10.webp', 'The HP EliteBook 840 G10 is the executive''s armor — a 14-inch business laptop engineered for enterprise security and uncompromising productivity. The 12th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB DDR5 RAM, and 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD ensure seamless multitasking across demanding business applications. The 14-inch FHD display with 100% sRGB, HP Sure View Reflect privacy screen option, and Bang & Olufsen audio create a premium workspace. With HP Wolf Security from the BIOS up, fingerprint reader, IR face recognition, and MIL-STD-810H durability testing, your data and device are protected against modern threats and physical abuse. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1024000, '/assets/products/hp-elitebook-840-g10.webp', 1137000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

