VALUES ('hp-pavilion-15', 'HP Pavilion 15 — Intel Core i7-1255U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 780000, 780000, 639000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-15.webp', 'The HP Pavilion 15 balances performance, style, and value for the modern professional and student. The 15.6-inch FHD micro-edge display with anti-glare coating maximizes screen real estate, while the Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB RAM, and 512GB SSD handle everything from spreadsheet analysis to light content creation. The full-size backlit keyboard with numeric keypad, B&O dual speakers, and HP Fast Charge technology (50% in 45 minutes) ensure all-day productivity. With a sleek aluminum chassis, fingerprint reader, and comprehensive port selection including USB-C and HDMI, this is versatility refined. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 639000, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-15.webp', 709000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

