VALUES ('hp-zbook-firefly-14-g10', 'HP ZBook Firefly 14 G10 — Intel Core i7, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD, NVIDIA T550', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-zbook-firefly-14-g10.webp', 'The HP ZBook Firefly 14 G10 brings workstation-class performance to a truly mobile form factor. Designed for architects, engineers, and creative professionals, this 14-inch mobile workstation features an Intel Core i7 processor, 32GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB SSD, and NVIDIA T550 professional graphics with ISV certifications for AutoCAD, SolidWorks, and Adobe Creative Suite. The 14-inch FHD display with 100% sRGB, HP DreamColor calibration option, and MIL-STD-810H durability ensure color-accurate work in any environment. With Thunderbolt 4, WiFi 6E, and all-day battery life, this is professional mobility without compromise. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/hp-zbook-firefly-14-g10.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

