VALUES ('dell-xps-13-plus', 'Dell XPS 13 Plus — Intel Core i7-1360P, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 3.5K OLED', 'laptops', 1650000, 1650000, 1353000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13-plus.webp', 'The Dell XPS 13 Plus is a design revolution disguised as a laptop. The stunning 13.4-inch 3.5K OLED InfinityEdge touch display with 400 nits and 100% DCI-P3 delivers inky blacks and vibrant colors. The zero-lattice keyboard, seamless glass touchpad with haptic feedback, and capacitive touch function row create a futuristic interaction paradigm. The 12th Gen Intel Core i7, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, and 512GB SSD ensure responsive performance, while the machined aluminum chassis in Platinum Silver or Graphite exudes minimalist luxury. With four Thunderbolt 4 ports and ExpressCharge, this is the laptop for design-conscious professionals. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1353000, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13-plus.webp', 1501000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

