VALUES ('dell-latitude-7430', 'Dell Latitude 7430 — Intel Core i5-1235U, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 720000, 720000, 590000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-latitude-7430.webp', 'The Dell Latitude 7430 is the workhorse of enterprise computing. This 14-inch business laptop features a 12th Gen Intel Core i5 processor, 16GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB SSD in a chassis tested to 17 MIL-STD-810H standards. The FHD display with ComfortView Plus reduces blue light emissions without color distortion, while the dual-array microphones and HD camera with temporal noise reduction ensure you look and sound professional on every video call. With Dell Optimizer AI that learns your work patterns, ExpressResponse, and ExpressSign-in, your laptop works as intelligently as you do. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 590000, '/assets/products/dell-latitude-7430.webp', 655000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

