VALUES ('dell-alienware-m16-r2', 'Dell Alienware m16 R2 — Intel Core i9-14900HX, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD, RTX 4070', 'laptops', 3200000, 3200000, 2624000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-alienware-m16-r2.webp', 'The Dell Alienware m16 R2 is a gaming behemoth that devours AAA titles at maximum settings. The 16-inch QHD+ 240Hz display with 3ms response time and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates motion blur and screen tearing. The 14th Gen Intel Core i9-14900HX, 32GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB SSD, and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 with 8GB GDDR6 deliver ray-traced 1440p gaming at 120+ fps. The Alienware Cryo-tech cooling with quad fans and seven heat pipes prevents thermal throttling, while the AlienFX per-key RGB keyboard and Dolby Atmos audio create an immersive battle station. This is not merely a laptop — it is a desktop replacement that travels. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2624000, '/assets/products/dell-alienware-m16-r2.webp', 2912000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

