VALUES ('lenovo-thinkpad-x1-carbon-gen-12', 'Lenovo ThinkPad X1 Carbon Gen 12 — Intel Core i7-155U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 1950000, 1950000, 1599000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x1-carbon-gen-12.webp', 'The Lenovo ThinkPad X1 Carbon Gen 12 is the flagship of business mobility. Weighing just 1.09kg, this 14-inch ultrabook features an Intel Core Ultra 7 processor, 16GB LPDDR5x RAM, and 512GB SSD in a chassis crafted from carbon fiber and magnesium alloy. The 2.8K OLED display with 100% DCI-P3, Dolby Vision, and 400 nits delivers stunning visuals, while the legendary ThinkPad keyboard with TrackPoint and haptic touchpad ensures precise input. With Intel vPro security, dTPM 2.0, fingerprint reader, and optional 4G LTE, this is the laptop that CEOs and consultants trust implicitly. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1599000, '/assets/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x1-carbon-gen-12.webp', 1774000, 4.5, 1, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

