VALUES ('hp-250-g9', 'HP 250 G9 — Intel Core i3-1215U, 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 380000, 380000, 311000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-250-g9.webp', 'The HP 250 G9 is the reliable workhorse for students, small businesses, and everyday computing. The 15.6-inch HD display, 12th Gen Intel Core i3 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB SSD provide solid performance for document editing, web browsing, and video streaming. The full-size keyboard with numeric keypad, dual speakers, and HP Fast Charge support create a practical, no-nonsense computing experience. With a durable chassis, comprehensive port selection, and Windows 11 Pro, this laptop delivers essential productivity at an accessible price point. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 311000, '/assets/products/hp-250-g9.webp', 345000, 4.5, 0, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

