VALUES ('lenovo-ideapad-slim-3', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 — Intel Core i5-1235U, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3.webp', 'The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 is the everyday laptop that exceeds expectations. The 15.6-inch FHD display with narrow bezels, Intel Core i5 processor, 8GB RAM, and 512GB SSD handle multitasking, entertainment, and light productivity with ease. The Dolby Audio speakers, privacy shutter on the HD camera, and rapid charge technology ensure you stay connected and entertained. With a slim 1.79cm profile, 1.65kg weight, and multiple color options, this is the ideal laptop for students and home users seeking reliable performance without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

