VALUES ('apple-ipad-pro-13-m4', 'Apple iPad Pro 13" M4 — 256GB, WiFi + Cellular', 'tablets', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-13-m4.webp', 'The iPad Pro 13" with M4 chip is the thinnest Apple product ever created, yet it houses the most powerful mobile processor in the industry. The breathtaking Ultra Retina XDR display with Tandem OLED technology delivers 1000 nits full-screen brightness and 1600 nits peak HDR — a first for iPad. The M4 chip''s 9-core CPU and 10-core GPU outperform most laptops, enabling professional video editing, 3D rendering, and console-quality gaming. With Apple Pencil Pro support, Magic Keyboard compatibility, and cellular connectivity, this is not a tablet — it is a creative studio, gaming console, and mobile office in a 5.1mm-thin chassis. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-13-m4.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

