VALUES ('apple-ipad-air-11-m2', 'Apple iPad Air 11" M2 — 128GB, WiFi', 'tablets', 980000, 980000, 803000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-air-11-m2.webp', 'The iPad Air 11" with M2 chip brings pro-level performance to the mainstream. The Liquid Retina display with P3 wide color and True Tone ensures accurate, comfortable viewing, while the M2 chip''s 8-core CPU and 9-core GPU handle 4K video editing, graphic design, and immersive gaming effortlessly. Compatible with Apple Pencil Pro and Magic Keyboard, the iPad Air transforms from a content consumption device to a productivity powerhouse in seconds. With all-day battery life, Touch ID, and a stunning array of colors, this is the iPad for everyone who wants more than the basics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 803000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-air-11-m2.webp', 891000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

