VALUES ('amazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-max', 'Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Max (2nd Gen) — Streaming Device', 'smart-home', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/amazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-max.webp', 'The Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Max is the most powerful streaming stick ever created. The 2.0GHz quad-core processor and WiFi 6E support deliver lightning-fast app launches and buffer-free 4K Ultra HD streaming with Dolby Vision, HDR10+, and immersive Dolby Atmos audio. The Alexa Voice Remote with TV controls searches across Netflix, Prime Video, Disney+, YouTube, and hundreds of other apps using just your voice. With 16GB storage for apps, Live View Picture-in-Picture for security cameras, and Alexa Home Theater for wireless speaker pairing, this tiny stick transforms any HDMI-equipped TV into a smart entertainment powerhouse. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/amazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-max.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

