VALUES ('google-chromecast-with-google-tv', 'Google Chromecast with Google TV (4K) — Streaming Stick', 'smart-home', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/google-chromecast-with-google-tv.webp', 'The Google Chromecast with Google TV revolutionizes streaming with a personalized, content-first interface. The 4K HDR output with Dolby Vision and Dolby Atmos delivers cinematic quality, while Google TV organizes your subscriptions from Netflix, Disney+, HBO Max, and 10,000+ apps into a single, curated home screen with recommendations tailored to your tastes. The voice remote with Google Assistant enables hands-free searching, smart home control, and YouTube casting. With 8GB storage, Bluetooth connectivity for headphones, and a sleek, eco-friendly design, this is the streaming device that puts content discovery above app navigation. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/google-chromecast-with-google-tv.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

