VALUES ('steelseries-arctis-nova-pro-wireless', 'SteelSeries Arctis Nova Pro Wireless — Multi-System Gaming Headset', 'gaming-accessories', 420000, 420000, 344000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/steelseries-arctis-nova-pro-wireless.webp', 'The SteelSeries Arctis Nova Pro Wireless is the audiophile''s gaming headset. The Nova Pro Acoustic System with custom-designed Premium High Fidelity Drivers delivers immersive 360-degree Spatial Audio, while the Active Noise Cancellation with 4-mic hybrid technology eliminates environmental distractions. The Infinity Power System includes two hot-swappable batteries that charge in the base station, ensuring you never run out of power mid-session. The multi-system connect base station provides lossless 2.4GHz wireless and Bluetooth simultaneously, allowing you to mix game audio with Discord chat or music. With a ClearCast Gen 2 mic that retracts into the earcup, this is the headset for gamers who demand studio-quality sound. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SteelSeries packaging, 1-year SteelSeries warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 344000, '/assets/products/steelseries-arctis-nova-pro-wireless.webp', 382000, 4.5, 0, 'SteelSeries', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

