VALUES ('lg-ultragear-27gp850-b', 'LG UltraGear 27GP850-B — 27" QHD Nano IPS 180Hz Gaming Monitor', 'pc-peripherals', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 2.0, '/assets/products/lg-ultragear-27gp850-b.webp', 'The LG UltraGear 27GP850-B is the competitive gaming monitor that doesn''t sacrifice color accuracy for speed. The 27-inch QHD (2560x1440) Nano IPS display with 1ms GtG response time and 180Hz overclocked refresh rate delivers silky-smooth gameplay with vibrant, accurate colors covering 98% DCI-P3. NVIDIA G-SYNC Compatible and AMD FreeSync Premium eliminate screen tearing, while the HDR400 certification adds depth to supported titles. The virtually borderless design, tilt/height/pivot adjustable stand, and Dynamic Action Sync that reduces input lag make this the monitor that gives you the competitive edge without making your games look washed out. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original LG packaging, 1-year LG warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/lg-ultragear-27gp850-b.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'LG', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

