VALUES ('anker-675-usb-c-docking-station', 'Anker 675 USB-C Docking Station — 12-in-1, Monitor Stand', 'pc-peripherals', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 2.0, '/assets/products/anker-675-usb-c-docking-station.webp', 'The Anker 675 USB-C Docking Station is the monitor stand that transforms your laptop into a desktop powerhouse. This 12-in-1 hub integrates a wireless charging pad, 4K HDMI output, 100W USB-C Power Delivery, USB-A ports, SD/microSD card readers, and Ethernet — all while elevating your monitor to ergonomic height with integrated storage drawer. The 100W pass-through charging powers your laptop while connecting peripherals, and the 4K@30Hz HDMI output drives an external monitor for expanded productivity. With a sturdy design supporting monitors up to 32 inches and 10kg, this is the workspace upgrade that declutters your desk while expanding your connectivity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/anker-675-usb-c-docking-station.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

