VALUES ('ninja-foodi-dual-zone-air-fryer', 'Ninja Foodi Dual Zone Air Fryer — 9.5L, 2 Drawers', 'kitchen', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/ninja-foodi-dual-zone-air-fryer.webp', 'The Ninja Foodi Dual Zone Air Fryer is the culinary multitasker that cooks two foods, two ways, and finishes them simultaneously. With two independent 4.75-liter drawers and DualZone Technology, you can roast chicken in one drawer while air frying fries in the other — both ready to serve at the same time via the Smart Finish feature. The 6 cooking functions — Air Fry, Max Crisp, Roast, Bake, Reheat, and Dehydrate — eliminate the need for multiple appliances, while the 2470-watt power and Cyclonic Air Technology deliver crispy results with up to 75% less fat than traditional frying. The dishwasher-safe baskets and non-stick coating ensure cleanup is as effortless as the cooking. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ninja packaging, 1-year Ninja warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/ninja-foodi-dual-zone-air-fryer.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Ninja', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

