VALUES ('philips-5000-series-fully-automatic-espresso', 'Philips 5000 Series Fully Automatic Espresso Machine — LatteGo', 'kitchen', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/philips-5000-series-fully-automatic-espresso.webp', 'The Philips 5000 Series LatteGo is your personal barista in brushed stainless steel. The fully automatic ceramic grinder with 12 settings transforms whole beans into the perfect grind, while the Aroma Extract system maintains optimal temperature and aroma extraction. The innovative LatteGo milk system froths milk at high speed in a cyclonic chamber, then pours silky smooth foam directly into your cup — with no tubes to clean. With 5 coffee varieties (Espresso, Coffee, Americano, Cappuccino, Latte Macchiato), 3 temperature settings, and the AquaClean filter that allows up to 5,000 cups without descaling, this machine delivers café-quality beverages with the press of a button. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Philips packaging, 2-year Philips warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/philips-5000-series-fully-automatic-espresso.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Philips', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

