VALUES ('vitamix-a3500-ascent-series-smart-blender', 'Vitamix A3500 Ascent Series Smart Blender — Brushed Stainless', 'kitchen', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/vitamix-a3500-ascent-series-smart-blender.webp', 'The Vitamix A3500 Ascent is the commercial-grade blender that professional chefs use at home. The 2.2-peak horsepower motor and laser-cut stainless steel blades pulverize ice, frozen fruit, nuts, and fibrous vegetables into silky smooth soups, nut butters, and smoothies in seconds. The five program settings (Smoothies, Hot Soups, Dips & Spreads, Frozen Desserts, Self-Cleaning) automatically adjust speed and time, while the built-in wireless connectivity recognizes the container size and adjusts blending accordingly. The programmable timer ensures walk-away convenience, and the self-cleaning function with drop of dish soap and warm water eliminates disassembly. With a 10-year full warranty, this is the last blender you will ever buy. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Vitamix packaging, 10-year Vitamix warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/vitamix-a3500-ascent-series-smart-blender.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'Vitamix', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

