VALUES ('breville-smart-oven-air-fryer-pro', 'Breville Smart Oven Air Fryer Pro — BOV900BSS, Brushed Stainless', 'kitchen', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/breville-smart-oven-air-fryer-pro.webp', 'The Breville Smart Oven Air Fryer Pro is the 13-function countertop oven that replaces your full-size oven for most tasks. The Element iQ system uses 6 independent quartz heating elements and smart algorithms to direct power where it''s needed, eliminating cold spots and ensuring precise, even cooking. The super convection setting with 2-speed fan delivers air fryer crispiness, while the massive 1 cubic foot interior accommodates a 14-pound turkey, 12-cup muffin tray, or 9 slices of toast. With 13 cooking functions including Toast, Bagel, Broil, Bake, Roast, Warm, Pizza, Proof, Air Fry, Reheat, Cookies, Slow Cook, and Dehydrate, this is the only countertop appliance a modern kitchen needs. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Breville packaging, 2-year Breville warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/breville-smart-oven-air-fryer-pro.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Breville', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

