VALUES ('instant-pot-duo-crisp-11-in-1', 'Instant Pot Duo Crisp 11-in-1 — 8 Quart with Ultimate Lid', 'kitchen', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/instant-pot-duo-crisp-11-in-1.webp', 'The Instant Pot Duo Crisp with Ultimate Lid is the multicooker that air fries without swapping lids. The innovative single-lid design combines pressure cooking and air frying in one sealed system, eliminating the need to change lids between functions. The 11-in-1 versatility includes Pressure Cook, Steam, Slow Cook, Sauté, Warm, Air Fry, Roast, Bake, Broil, Dehydrate, and Yogurt — all in an 8-quart stainless steel pot that feeds large families. The EvenCrisp technology delivers golden, crispy results from the top down, while the advanced safety mechanisms and easy-seal pressure cooking lid make this the most convenient and safest Instant Pot ever created. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Instant Pot packaging, 1-year Instant Pot warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/instant-pot-duo-crisp-11-in-1.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Instant Pot', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

