VALUES ('kitchenaid-artisan-series-5-qt-stand-mixer', 'KitchenAid Artisan Series 5-Qt Stand Mixer — Empire Red', 'kitchen', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 5.0, '/assets/products/kitchenaid-artisan-series-5-qt-stand-mixer.webp', 'The KitchenAid Artisan Stand Mixer is the iconic countertop appliance that has defined home baking for generations. The 5-quart stainless steel bowl with comfortable handle accommodates dough for 9 dozen cookies or 4 loaves of bread, while the 325-watt motor and 59-point planetary mixing action ensures thorough incorporation of ingredients. The tilt-head design provides easy access to the bowl and beaters, and the power hub accepts over 15 optional attachments — from pasta makers to meat grinders — transforming this mixer into a complete culinary center. With 10 speeds, a pouring shield, and the legendary KitchenAid build quality, this is the heirloom appliance that inspires generations of home chefs. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original KitchenAid packaging, 1-year KitchenAid warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/kitchenaid-artisan-series-5-qt-stand-mixer.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'KitchenAid', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

