VALUES ('omron-evolv', 'Omron Evolv — Wireless Upper Arm Blood Pressure Monitor', 'health', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/omron-evolv.webp', 'The Omron Evolv is the clinically validated blood pressure monitor that eliminates tubes and wires. The innovative all-in-one design integrates the cuff, display, and inflation pump into a sleek, portable unit that wraps comfortably around your upper arm. The Advanced Accuracy technology measures five times more data points than standard monitors, while the Bluetooth connectivity syncs readings to the Omron Connect app for trend tracking and sharing with your physician. The Intelli Wrap Cuff ensures accurate measurements in any position around the arm, and the irregular heartbeat detection alerts you to potential arrhythmias. With FDA clearance and validation by the American Heart Association, this is medical-grade monitoring for home use. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Omron packaging, 5-year Omron warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/omron-evolv.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Omron', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('theragun-elite', 'Theragun Elite — Premium Percussive Therapy Device, Black', 'health', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/theragun-elite.webp', 'The Theragun Elite is the percussive therapy device that professional athletes and physical therapists trust for recovery. The QX65 motor with QuietForce Technology delivers 40 lbs of force with remarkable silence, while the 16mm amplitude reaches 60% deeper into muscle than consumer massagers. The OLED screen displays current speed and force meter, and the built-in guided treatment routines via the Therabody app ensure you target the right muscle groups with the correct technique. With 5 built-in speeds, 5 attachments for different body areas, and a 120-minute battery life, this device reduces muscle soreness, improves circulation, and accelerates recovery after intense training sessions. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Therabody packaging, 1-year Therabody warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/theragun-elite.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Theragun', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hyperice-hypervolt-2-pro', 'Hyperice Hypervolt 2 Pro — Percussion Massage Gun', 'health', 420000, 420000, 344000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/hyperice-hypervolt-2-pro.webp', 'The Hyperice Hypervolt 2 Pro is the percussion device that delivers professional-grade recovery with five speeds of intense power. The high-torque 90W motor generates up to 2700 percussions per minute, penetrating deep into muscle tissue to relieve knots, stiffness, and soreness. The patented QuietGlide technology maintains a whisper-quiet operation despite the power, while the digital speed dial and pressure sensor LEDs provide real-time feedback on application force. The five interchangeable head attachments target specific muscle groups, and the 3-hour battery life ensures this device is ready whenever your muscles demand relief. With Bluetooth connectivity to the Hyperice app for guided routines, this is the recovery tool that keeps you performing at your peak. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Hyperice packaging, 1-year Hyperice warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 344000, '/assets/products/hyperice-hypervolt-2-pro.webp', 382000, 4.5, 0, 'Hyperice', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('beurer-mg-320', 'Beurer MG 320 — Shiatsu Massage Seat Cover', 'health', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/beurer-mg-320.webp', 'The Beurer MG 320 transforms any chair into a shiatsu massage throne. The 4 rotating massage heads travel up and down your back, neck, and shoulders, delivering deep-kneading shiatsu that mimics the thumbs and palms of a professional masseuse. The optional heat function soothes tense muscles with gentle warmth, while the 3 massage zones (full back, upper back, lower back) and spot massage function allow targeted relief. The adjustable neck massage nodes accommodate users of different heights, and the remote control with LED display ensures effortless operation. With automatic shut-off after 15 minutes and a snug fit on most chairs, this is the home office upgrade that prevents the aches of sedentary work. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Beurer packaging, 3-year Beurer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/beurer-mg-320.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Beurer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('philips-sonicare-diamondclean-smart-9300', 'Philips Sonicare DiamondClean Smart 9300 — Electric Toothbrush, Black', 'health', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/philips-sonicare-diamondclean-smart-9300.webp', 'The Philips Sonicare DiamondClean Smart 9300 is the intelligent toothbrush that coaches you to perfect oral health. The premium brush head sensors communicate with the handle to select the optimal mode and intensity, while the 3D mouth map in the Sonicare app tracks your brushing coverage in real time, ensuring no zone is neglected. The sonic technology creates 31,000 brush strokes per minute, driving fluid deep between teeth and along the gum line for a feeling you cannot achieve manually. With 4 modes (Clean, White+, Deep Clean+, Gum Health), 3 intensities, a sleek charging glass, and a USB travel case, this toothbrush transforms a daily chore into a data-driven wellness ritual. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Philips packaging, 2-year Philips warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/philips-sonicare-diamondclean-smart-9300.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Philips', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('oral-b-io-series-9', 'Oral-B iO Series 9 — Electric Toothbrush with Magnetic Drive, Black Onyx', 'health', 220000, 220000, 180000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/oral-b-io-series-9.webp', 'The Oral-B iO Series 9 represents a fundamental reinvention of the electric toothbrush. The revolutionary magnetic drive system delivers micro-vibrations with a smooth, frictionless sensation that feels completely different from traditional oscillating brushes. The Smart Pressure Sensor glows red when brushing too hard, white when too soft, and green when just right, while the interactive color display provides real-time coaching, timer countdowns, and greeting messages. The AI-powered 3D Teeth Tracking via the Oral-B app monitors 16 zones of your mouth, providing personalized feedback. With 7 smart modes, a magnetic charging puck, and a premium travel case, this is the toothbrush that makes oral care genuinely engaging. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Oral-B packaging, 2-year Oral-B warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 180000, '/assets/products/oral-b-io-series-9.webp', 200000, 4.5, 0, 'Oral-B', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dyson-purifier-cool', 'Dyson Purifier Cool — TP07 Air Purifier and Fan, White/Silver', 'health', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dyson-purifier-cool.webp', 'The Dyson Purifier Cool TP07 is the air purifier that thinks. The HEPA H13 and activated carbon filtration captures 99.95% of particles as small as 0.1 microns — including allergens, bacteria, pollen, and VOCs — while the Air Multiplier technology projects purified air throughout the entire room. The intelligent sensors continuously monitor airborne particles and gases, automatically adjusting purification levels and reporting real-time air quality via the LCD display and MyDyson app. The bladeless design is safe for children and pets, while the 10 airspeed settings and night mode ensure whisper-quiet operation. With oscillation, tilt, and backward airflow mode for purification without cooling, this is the air quality command center for health-conscious households. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dyson packaging, 2-year Dyson warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/dyson-purifier-cool.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'Dyson', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('levoit-core-400s', 'Levoit Core 400S — Smart True HEPA Air Purifier', 'health', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/levoit-core-400s.webp', 'The Levoit Core 400S is the smart air purifier that cleans spaces up to 83 square meters with whisper-quiet efficiency. The 3-stage filtration system — Pre-Filter, True HEPA Filter, and Custom High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter — captures 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.3 microns, including dust, smoke, odors, and pet dander. The AirSight Plus laser dust sensor detects particles and auto-adjusts fan speed in real time, while the VeSync app provides remote control, scheduling, and air quality history. With 24dB quiet sleep mode, LED display that dims automatically, and voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant, this purifier works silently in the background, ensuring you breathe only the cleanest air. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Levoit packaging, 1-year Levoit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/levoit-core-400s.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Levoit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('irobot-roomba-j7', 'iRobot Roomba j7+ — Self-Emptying Robot Vacuum', 'cleaning', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/irobot-roomba-j7.webp', 'The iRobot Roomba j7+ is the first robot vacuum that actually avoids pet waste and cords. Powered by iRobot OS and PrecisionVision Navigation, this intelligent cleaner recognizes and steers clear of obstacles like socks, shoes, and pet accidents — eliminating the horror stories of smeared disasters. The self-emptying Clean Base Automatic Dirt Disposal holds up to 60 days of debris, while the Imprint Smart Mapping learns your home''s layout, allowing room-specific cleaning schedules and keep-out zones via the iRobot Home app. The dual multi-surface rubber brushes adjust to different floor types, and the 3-stage cleaning system with 10x the suction power lifts embedded dirt, dust, and pet hair from carpets and hard floors. This is autonomous cleaning with genuine intelligence. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original iRobot packaging, 1-year iRobot warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/irobot-roomba-j7.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'iRobot', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roborock-s8-pro-ultra', 'Roborock S8 Pro Ultra — Robot Vacuum and Mop with RockDock Ultra', 'cleaning', 1250000, 1250000, 1024000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/roborock-s8-pro-ultra.webp', 'The Roborock S8 Pro Ultra is the fully autonomous cleaning system that vacuums, mops, self-empties, self-washes, and self-dries. The dual rubber brush system with 6000Pa hyper suction lifts debris from carpets, while the VibraRise 2.0 mopping system scrubs floors at 3000 times per minute with 6N downward pressure. The RockDock Ultra station automatically empties the dustbin into a 2.5L bag, washes the mop pads with 60°C hot water, and dries them with 45°C warm air to prevent mildew. The Reactive 3D Obstacle Avoidance with 3D structured light identifies 42 object types, and the LDS navigation maps your home in minutes. With app control, voice assistant integration, and carpet detection that automatically lifts the mop, this is the robot that makes manual cleaning obsolete. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Roborock packaging, 1-year Roborock warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1024000, '/assets/products/roborock-s8-pro-ultra.webp', 1137000, 4.5, 1, 'Roborock', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni', 'Ecovacs Deebot X2 Omni — Robot Vacuum with All-in-One Station', 'cleaning', 1450000, 1450000, 1189000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni.webp', 'The Ecovacs Deebot X2 Omni redefines autonomous cleaning with a square design that reaches corners traditional round robots miss. The 8000Pa suction power, 15mm auto-lift mopping, and dual-laser LiDAR navigation with AI-powered AIVI 3D 2.0 obstacle avoidance create the most advanced cleaning robot on the market. The all-in-one OMNI station hot-washes mop pads with 55°C water, hot-air dries them, auto-empties the 3L dust bag for 75 days of hands-free operation, and refills the water tank automatically. The built-in YIKO voice assistant responds to natural language commands, and the 6400mAh battery cleans up to 200 square meters on a single charge. For luxury homes that demand spotless floors without lifting a finger, this is the ultimate domestic servant. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ecovacs packaging, 1-year Ecovacs warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1189000, '/assets/products/ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni.webp', 1319000, 4.5, 1, 'Ecovacs', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dyson-v15-detect-absolute', 'Dyson V15 Detect Absolute — Cordless Vacuum, Laser illumination', 'cleaning', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/dyson-v15-detect-absolute.webp', 'The Dyson V15 Detect Absolute is the cordless vacuum that reveals the invisible. The pioneering Laser Slim Fluffy cleaner head projects a green laser beam across hard floors, illuminating microscopic dust particles invisible to the naked eye so nothing is missed. The piezo sensor continuously sizes and counts dust particles, displaying real-time data on the LCD screen and automatically increasing suction when more dust is detected. The Hyperdymium motor generates 230AW of suction, while the 5-stage filtration captures 99.99% of particles down to 0.3 microns. With up to 60 minutes of run time, anti-tangle Hair Screw tool, and a wall-mounted charging dock, this is the vacuum for perfectionists who refuse to leave a single particle behind. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dyson packaging, 2-year Dyson warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/dyson-v15-detect-absolute.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'Dyson', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('shark-stratos-cordless', 'Shark Stratos Cordless — IZ420EUT, Anti Hair Wrap, PowerFins', 'cleaning', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/shark-stratos-cordless.webp', 'The Shark Stratos Cordless is the vacuum that never loses suction. The DuoClean PowerFins technology combines a soft front roller for large debris and a bristle brushroll for deep carpet cleaning in a single pass, while the Anti Hair Wrap Plus actively removes hair from the brushroll as you clean. The Clean Sense IQ detects dirt you cannot see and automatically adjusts suction power in real time, while the Odor Neutralizer Technology guards against bad smells inside the vacuum. With up to 60 minutes of runtime, Flexology wand that bends to clean under furniture, and Anti-Allergen Complete Seal that captures 99.9% of dust and allergens, this is the cordless vacuum that rivals corded performance. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Shark packaging, 2-year Shark warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/shark-stratos-cordless.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Shark', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('karcher-sc-3-easyfix', 'Karcher SC 3 EasyFix — Steam Cleaner, 1900W', 'cleaning', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/karcher-sc-3-easyfix.webp', 'The Karcher SC 3 EasyFix is the chemical-free cleaning revolution. Using only tap water heated to 147°C, this steam cleaner sanitizes 99.99% of common household bacteria on hard surfaces without detergents or residues. The rapid heat-up time of just 30 seconds means you start cleaning immediately, while the continuously refillable water tank eliminates waiting for cooldown. The EasyFix floor nozzle with lamella technology ensures perfect cleaning results on all hard floors, and the comprehensive accessory kit — including hand nozzle, round brush, power nozzle, and detail nozzle — tackles everything from tile grout to oven interiors. For homes with children, pets, or allergy sufferers, this is the deep clean that nature intended. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Karcher packaging, 2-year Karcher warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/karcher-sc-3-easyfix.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Karcher', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ecoflow-delta-2', 'EcoFlow Delta 2 — 1024Wh Portable Power Station', 'power', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/ecoflow-delta-2.webp', 'The EcoFlow Delta 2 is the portable power station that replaces your generator for daily use. The 1024Wh LFP battery with 3000+ cycle life powers essential appliances during outages — running a refrigerator for 7 hours, a TV for 15 hours, or charging a laptop 16 times. The X-Stream fast charging technology recharges from 0 to 80% in just 50 minutes via AC wall outlet, while the 1800W continuous output (2700W surge) handles power tools and kitchen appliances. With 15 output ports including USB-C PD 100W, pure sine wave AC outlets, and a 12V car port, plus app control for monitoring and scheduling, this is the clean, silent alternative to petrol generators for Nigerian homes. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original EcoFlow packaging, 5-year EcoFlow warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/ecoflow-delta-2.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'EcoFlow', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ecoflow-delta-pro', 'EcoFlow Delta Pro — 3600Wh Expandable Power Station', 'power', 2850000, 2850000, 2337000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/ecoflow-delta-pro.webp', 'The EcoFlow Delta Pro is the whole-home battery backup that challenges traditional generators. With a massive 3600Wh capacity expandable to 25kWh with additional batteries, this power station runs your entire home during extended blackouts — air conditioners, refrigerators, washing machines, and all. The 3600W continuous output (7200W surge) with X-Boost technology handles 4500W appliances, while the multiple charging options — AC, solar up to 1600W, EV charging stations, and car charging — ensure you are never without power. The EcoFlow app provides smart energy management, and the NEMA 14-50 outlet directly powers high-voltage appliances. For homes and businesses seeking energy independence from the grid, this is the future of Nigerian power. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original EcoFlow packaging, 5-year EcoFlow warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2337000, '/assets/products/ecoflow-delta-pro.webp', 2593000, 4.5, 1, 'EcoFlow', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('jackery-explorer-1000-v2', 'Jackery Explorer 1000 v2 — 1070Wh Portable Power Station', 'power', 720000, 720000, 590000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/jackery-explorer-1000-v2.webp', 'The Jackery Explorer 1000 v2 is the adventure-ready power station that brings wall-outlet convenience to the wilderness. The 1070Wh lithium battery with 4000+ cycle life and 1000W continuous output (2000W surge) powers camping fridges, CPAP machines, projectors, and power tools far from the grid. The 3x AC pure sine wave outlets, 2x USB-C PD 100W ports, and 1x USB-A Quick Charge 3.0 port charge everything simultaneously, while the compact 10.8kg design with integrated handle travels easily. With solar charging compatibility via the Jackery SolarSaga panels, this is the off-grid power solution for campers, outdoor event planners, and emergency preparedness enthusiasts who refuse to be left in the dark. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Jackery packaging, 2-year Jackery warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 590000, '/assets/products/jackery-explorer-1000-v2.webp', 655000, 4.5, 1, 'Jackery', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('bluetti-ac200max', 'Bluetti AC200MAX — 2048Wh Expandable Power Station', 'power', 1450000, 1450000, 1189000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/bluetti-ac200max.webp', 'The Bluetti AC200MAX is the expandable power fortress for serious off-grid living. The 2048Wh LiFePO4 battery with 3500+ cycles to 80% capacity provides a decade of reliable service, while the 2200W continuous output (4800W surge) runs heavy-duty appliances including microwaves, electric kettles, and induction cooktops. The 16 output ports include 4x AC pure sine wave, 1x 30A RV port, 2x USB-C PD 100W, and wireless charging pads. Expandable to 8192Wh with two B230 batteries, and chargeable via 900W solar, 500W AC, or dual charging for 1400W total input, this power station is the backbone of remote cabins, food trucks, and backup home power systems. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bluetti packaging, 2-year Bluetti warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1189000, '/assets/products/bluetti-ac200max.webp', 1319000, 4.5, 1, 'Bluetti', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel', 'EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel — Foldable, Waterproof', 'power', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel.webp', 'The EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel is the renewable energy harvester that folds to the size of a briefcase. The advanced monocrystalline silicon cells with high-efficiency solar energy conversion achieve 23% efficiency, while the kickstand case adjusts from 0 to 45 degrees for optimal sun angle. The IP68 waterproof and dustproof rating ensures durability in harsh Nigerian weather, and the universal MC4 connector works with most power stations on the market. Weighing just 16kg and folding to 1/5 of its deployed size, this panel pairs perfectly with the EcoFlow Delta series to create a self-sustaining power ecosystem that never requires fuel. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original EcoFlow packaging, 1-year EcoFlow warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'EcoFlow', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('anker-solix-f1200', 'Anker SOLIX F1200 — PowerHouse 757, 1229Wh GaNPrime', 'power', 850000, 850000, 697000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/anker-solix-f1200.webp', 'The Anker SOLIX F1200 PowerHouse 757 is the GaNPrime power station that redefines portable energy density. The 1229Wh LFP battery with 3000 cycles and Anker''s proprietary GaNPrime technology delivers 1500W continuous output (2400W surge) in a remarkably compact form factor. The InfiniPower technology with industrial-grade electronic components, impact-resistant structural design, and smart temperature control ensures 10-year daily reliability. With 6 AC outlets, 4 USB ports including 100W USB-C, a car outlet, and app-based energy management, this power station is the durable, efficient choice for home backup, outdoor work, and mobile offices that demand Anker''s legendary reliability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 5-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 697000, '/assets/products/anker-solix-f1200.webp', 773000, 4.5, 1, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('garmin-dash-cam-67w', 'Garmin Dash Cam 67W — 1440p Wide Angle with GPS', 'car-tech', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-67w.webp', 'The Garmin Dash Cam 67W is the silent witness that protects you on every journey. The 180-degree ultra-wide lens captures the entire road ahead in crisp 1440p resolution, while the Garmin Clarity HDR technology ensures license plates remain readable in harsh sunlight or low-light conditions. The integrated GPS logs time, location, and speed data, and the voice control allows hands-free operation to save videos or start the Travelapse feature. With automatic incident detection that saves footage before and after impact, Parking Guard that monitors your vehicle while parked, and the Drive app for easy video access, this dash cam provides the evidence you need when it matters most. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Garmin packaging, 1-year Garmin warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-67w.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Garmin', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

