VALUES ('sony-wf-1000xm5', 'Sony WF-1000XM5 — Industry Leading Noise Canceling Earbuds, Black', 'audio', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/sony-wf-1000xm5.webp', 'The Sony WF-1000XM5 represents the apex of personal audio isolation. The newly developed 8.4mm driver unit X delivers unprecedented sound clarity across all frequencies, while the upgraded V2 integrated processor and QN2e noise canceling processor achieve the most effective noise cancellation ever in truly wireless earbuds. The AI-based noise reduction algorithm with 6 microphones ensures crystal-clear voice calls even in hurricane-level wind. With 8 hours of playback with ANC on, 24 hours total with the case, LDAC high-resolution wireless audio, and a 25% smaller, lighter design than its predecessor, these earbuds create a sanctuary of silence and sound. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/sony-wf-1000xm5.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

