VALUES ('bose-quietcomfort-ultra-earbuds', 'Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds — Immersive Audio, Black', 'audio', 220000, 220000, 180000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/bose-quietcomfort-ultra-earbuds.webp', 'The Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds introduce CustomTune technology that personalizes audio and noise cancellation to your unique ear canal geometry. The immersive audio with spatial processing places sound in front of you rather than inside your head, creating a concert-hall sensation. The world-class noise cancellation with 3 listening modes — Quiet, Aware, and Immersion — adapts to any environment, while the CustomTune calibration optimizes everything specifically for your ears. With 6 hours of battery life, IPX4 water resistance, and the most stable, comfortable eartip fit Bose has ever engineered, these earbuds prove that personalized audio is the future of listening. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bose packaging, 1-year Bose warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 180000, '/assets/products/bose-quietcomfort-ultra-earbuds.webp', 200000, 4.5, 0, 'Bose', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

