VALUES ('huawei-freebuds-pro-3', 'Huawei FreeBuds Pro 3 — Kirin A2 Chip, Pure Voice, Green', 'audio', 115000, 115000, 94000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/huawei-freebuds-pro-3.webp', 'The Huawei FreeBuds Pro 3 is the first earbuds powered by Huawei''s proprietary Kirin A2 chip, enabling a 1.5Mbps lossless audio transmission rate that preserves every detail of studio master recordings. The intelligent dynamic ANC 3.0 with tri-mic hybrid noise cancellation adapts across 3 modes and 4 levels, while the Pure Voice 2.0 technology with multi-channel DNN algorithm reduces noise by 50% more than previous generations for pristine calls. The 11mm dual-magnet driver with micro-plate treble unit delivers full-range Hi-Res audio, and the 33-hour total battery life with wireless charging ensures uninterrupted listening. For Huawei ecosystem users, this is audio synergy at its finest. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Huawei packaging, 1-year Huawei warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 94000, '/assets/products/huawei-freebuds-pro-3.webp', 104000, 4.5, 0, 'Huawei', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

