VALUES ('edifier-neobuds-pro-2', 'Edifier NeoBuds Pro 2 — Spatial Audio, LDAC, Black', 'audio', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/edifier-neobuds-pro-2.webp', 'The Edifier NeoBuds Pro 2 brings audiophile-grade specifications to the mid-range market. The Knowles balanced armature driver combined with the 10mm dynamic driver creates a hybrid dual-driver system that delivers exceptional detail and punch. The spatial audio with head tracking, LDAC codec support for 990kbps transmission, and Hi-Res Wireless certification ensure you hear music as the artist intended. The -50dB multi-mode ANC with 4 levels of noise cancellation and 6-mic AI call noise reduction provide flagship-level isolation and communication. With 24 hours total battery life, fast charging, and the Edifier Connect app for deep customization, these earbuds challenge established premium brands on pure specifications. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Edifier packaging, 1-year Edifier warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/edifier-neobuds-pro-2.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Edifier', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

