VALUES ('jbl-tour-one-m2', 'JBL Tour One M2 — True Adaptive ANC, Black', 'audio', 165000, 165000, 135000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/jbl-tour-one-m2.webp', 'The JBL Tour One M2 is the business-class headphone for professionals who fly, commute, and command. The True Adaptive ANC with 4 smart microphones automatically adjusts to environmental changes in real time, while the Smart Ambient technology keeps you aware of important announcements without removing your headphones. The 40mm drivers with JBL Pro Sound deliver reference-grade audio, and the 4-mic crystal clear AI call technology with VoiceAware ensures you hear your own voice naturally during important calls. With 50 hours of battery life, Personi-Fi 2.0 personalized sound, and a premium lightweight design, these headphones are engineered for the executive who lives on calls and travels constantly. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original JBL packaging, 1-year JBL warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 135000, '/assets/products/jbl-tour-one-m2.webp', 150000, 4.5, 0, 'JBL', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

