VALUES ('anker-soundcore-space-one', 'Anker Soundcore Space One — Adaptive ANC, 40H Battery, Black', 'audio', 75000, 75000, 61000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/anker-soundcore-space-one.webp', 'The Anker Soundcore Space One delivers flagship noise cancellation at a mid-range price that disrupts the category. The adaptive ANC automatically detects external noise and adjusts cancellation depth up to 98%, while the 40mm custom drivers deliver Hi-Res Audio certified sound with LDAC codec support. The 40-hour battery life with ANC on, comfortable memory foam earcups, and foldable design make these ideal for long flights and daily commutes. The Soundcore app provides 22 EQ presets, customizable ANC levels, and wear detection that pauses playback when you remove the headphones. For value-conscious buyers who refuse to sacrifice ANC performance, these headphones are the market''s best-kept secret. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 61000, '/assets/products/anker-soundcore-space-one.webp', 68000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

