VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-a15-5g', 'Samsung Galaxy A15 5G — 6GB/128GB, Blue Black', 'phones', 195000, 195000, 159000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a15-5g.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy A15 5G brings next-generation connectivity to the accessible tier. The 6.5-inch Super AMOLED display with 90Hz refresh rate delivers vibrant, smooth visuals rarely seen at this price point. The Dimensity 6100+ 5G processor ensures future-proof network speeds, while the 50MP triple-camera system with OIS on the main lens captures stable, detailed photos. The 5000mAh battery with 25W fast charging, 6GB RAM, and Samsung''s commitment to 4 generations of OS updates and 5 years of security patches make this an investment in longevity. For buyers who want 5G, AMOLED, and Samsung reliability without flagship pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 159000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a15-5g.webp', 177000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

