VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-a35-5g', 'Samsung Galaxy A35 5G — 8GB/128GB, Awesome Navy', 'phones', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a35-5g.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy A35 5G is the mid-range powerhouse that borrows flagship DNA. The 6.6-inch Super AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1000 nits peak brightness delivers stunning outdoor visibility, while the Exynos 1380 5G processor and 8GB RAM provide smooth performance across demanding apps. The 50MP OIS main camera, 8MP ultra-wide, and 5MP macro capture detailed, stable photography, and the 5000mAh battery with 25W charging keeps pace with heavy use. With IP67 water resistance, Gorilla Glass Victus+ protection, and Samsung''s legendary software support, this is the mid-range device that feels premium in every interaction. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a35-5g.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g', 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G — 8GB/256GB, Midnight Black', 'phones', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g.webp', 'The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro+ 5G is the mid-range disruptor that challenges flagship cameras. The 200MP Samsung HP3 main sensor with OIS and 2x/4x in-sensor zoom delivers detail extraction that rivals phones costing three times the price. The 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED curved display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1800 nits peak brightness creates an immersive canvas, while the Dimensity 7200-Ultra 5G processor ensures smooth gaming and multitasking. The 120W HyperCharge technology fills the 5000mAh battery from 0 to 100% in just 19 minutes, and the IP68 water resistance provides peace of mind. For camera enthusiasts on a budget, this is the specification sheet that dreams are made of. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g-1', 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G — 8GB/256GB, Ocean Teal', 'phones', 310000, 310000, 254000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g-1.webp', 'The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G delivers flagship camera performance with a flat display preference. The 200MP main camera with OIS, 8MP ultra-wide, and 2MP macro provide versatile photography, while the 6.67-inch FHD+ AMOLED flat display with 120Hz refresh rate appeals to gamers and users who prefer non-curved screens. The Snapdragon 7s Gen 2 processor, 5100mAh battery with 67W fast charging, and IP54 splash resistance create a balanced, reliable package. With a premium glass back design, dual speakers, and Xiaomi''s feature-rich MIUI, this is the practical choice for users who want maximum camera capability without curved screen compromises. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 254000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-5g-1.webp', 282000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-redmi-note-13-5g', 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 5G — 6GB/128GB, Graphite Black', 'phones', 220000, 220000, 180000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-5g.webp', 'The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 5G is the accessible entry point to the Note 13 series. The 6.67-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate, Dimensity 6080 5G processor, and 5000mAh battery with 33W fast charging deliver core essentials without compromise. The 108MP main camera captures detailed photos for social sharing, and the slim 7.6mm profile with premium design language feels more expensive than its price suggests. For first-time 5G buyers and students seeking a reliable daily driver with modern connectivity and a stunning display, this device delivers exceptional value. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 180000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-note-13-5g.webp', 200000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-14-ultra', 'Xiaomi 14 Ultra — 16GB/512GB, White', 'phones', 2450000, 2450000, 2008000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14-ultra.webp', 'The Xiaomi 14 Ultra is the camera-centric flagship developed in partnership with Leica. The 1-inch Sony LYT-900 variable aperture main sensor, paired with three 50MP cameras covering ultra-wide, 3.2x telephoto, and 5x periscope telephoto, creates a quad-camera system that challenges dedicated cameras. The 6.73-inch WQHD+ AMOLED LTPO display with 3000 nits peak brightness, Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, and 16GB RAM deliver uncompromised performance. The 5300mAh battery with 90W wired and 80W wireless charging, plus the optional Photography Kit with grip and shutter button, transforms this phone into a Leica camera with smartphone connectivity. For mobile photographers who refuse to carry a separate camera. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2008000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14-ultra.webp', 2229000, 4.5, 1, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-14', 'Xiaomi 14 — 12GB/256GB, Black', 'phones', 1650000, 1650000, 1353000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14.webp', 'The Xiaomi 14 distills flagship excellence into a compact form factor. The 6.36-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz LTPO and 3000 nits peak brightness delivers one-handed usability without sacrificing quality. The Leica-tuned triple 50MP camera system with 1/1.31-inch main sensor, 50MP floating telephoto with 3.2x optical zoom, and 50MP ultra-wide captures versatile, color-accurate photography. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 4610mAh battery with 90W wired and 50W wireless charging, and IP68 rating make this the small flagship for users who are tired of oversized phones that stretch their pockets and thumbs. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1353000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14.webp', 1501000, 4.5, 1, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nothing-phone', 'Nothing Phone (2a) — 8GB/128GB, Black', 'phones', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/nothing-phone.webp', 'The Nothing Phone (2a) brings the brand''s iconic transparent design and Glyph Interface to the mid-range. The 6.7-inch AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1300 nits peak brightness delivers vibrant visuals, while the Dimensity 7200 Pro processor and 8GB RAM ensure smooth daily performance. The 50MP Samsung GN9 main camera with OIS and 50MP JN1 ultra-wide provide capable photography, but the standout feature is the Glyph Interface — three LED light strips on the transparent back that visualize notifications, charging status, and camera fill light. For design rebels who refuse to carry another generic black rectangle, this phone is a statement of individuality. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nothing packaging, 1-year Nothing warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/nothing-phone.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Nothing', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nothing-phone-1', 'Nothing Phone (2) — 12GB/256GB, Dark Grey', 'phones', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/nothing-phone-1.webp', 'The Nothing Phone (2) elevates the Glyph Interface from novelty to genuinely useful communication tool. The 6.7-inch LTPO AMOLED display with 120Hz adaptive refresh and 1600 nits peak brightness delivers flagship visuals, while the Snapdragon 8+ Gen 1 and 12GB RAM handle intensive tasks. The 50MP Sony IMX890 main camera with OIS and 50MP Samsung JN1 ultra-wide capture detailed, natural images with Nothing''s restrained color science. The improved Glyph Interface with 33 addressable LED zones provides visual ringtones, progress tracking for Uber deliveries, and notification patterns you can identify without looking at the screen. For tech enthusiasts who value thoughtful design over specification bragging. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nothing packaging, 1-year Nothing warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/nothing-phone-1.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Nothing', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('google-pixel-8a', 'Google Pixel 8a — 8GB/128GB, Obsidian', 'phones', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/google-pixel-8a.webp', 'The Google Pixel 8a brings flagship AI photography to the mid-range. The 6.1-inch Actua display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1400 nits peak brightness delivers smooth, bright visuals, while the Google Tensor G3 chip powers on-device AI features including Magic Editor, Best Take, and Audio Magic Eraser. The 64MP main camera with OIS and 13MP ultra-wide leverage Google''s computational photography to produce images that outperform phones with larger sensors. With 7 years of OS and security updates, IP67 water resistance, and the purest Android experience available, this is the investment in longevity that budget buyers deserve. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/google-pixel-8a.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('google-pixel-8-pro', 'Google Pixel 8 Pro — 12GB/128GB, Obsidian', 'phones', 1150000, 1150000, 943000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/google-pixel-8-pro.webp', 'The Google Pixel 8 Pro is the AI-first flagship that thinks for you. The 6.7-inch Super Actua LTPO OLED display with 2400 nits peak brightness is the brightest Pixel display ever, while the Tensor G3 chip enables revolutionary features like Video Boost for post-capture HDR processing, Zoom Enhance for AI-upscaled telephoto, and Magic Editor for generative photo manipulation. The triple camera system with 50MP main, 48MP ultra-wide, and 48MP 5x telephoto with 30x Super Res Zoom captures any scenario. The temperature sensor, 7-year update promise, and built-in VPN via Google One make this the most intelligent, secure Pixel ever created. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 943000, '/assets/products/google-pixel-8-pro.webp', 1046000, 4.5, 1, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('honor-magic-6-pro', 'Honor Magic 6 Pro — 12GB/512GB, Black', 'phones', 1450000, 1450000, 1189000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/honor-magic-6-pro.webp', 'The Honor Magic 6 Pro is the flagship challenger from Huawei''s former sub-brand, now independent and ambitious. The 6.8-inch LTPO OLED display with 5000 nits peak brightness and 4320Hz PWM dimming delivers the most eye-friendly flagship screen for sensitive users. The 180MP periscope telephoto camera with 2.5x optical zoom, 50MP main camera with variable aperture, and 50MP ultra-wide create a versatile imaging system. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 5600mAh battery with 80W wired and 66W wireless charging, and Honor''s MagicOS with AI features demonstrate that this brand is no longer living in Huawei''s shadow. For buyers seeking a premium alternative to Samsung and Apple. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Honor packaging, 1-year Honor warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1189000, '/assets/products/honor-magic-6-pro.webp', 1319000, 4.5, 1, 'Honor', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('honor-x9b', 'Honor X9b — 8GB/256GB, Midnight Black', 'phones', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/honor-x9b.webp', 'The Honor X9b is the mid-range durability champion with a screen that refuses to crack. The ultra-bounce anti-drop display with 360° whole-machine protection survives drops from 1.5 meters on multiple surfaces — a rarity in the smartphone world. The 6.78-inch AMOLED curved display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1920Hz PWM dimming delivers smooth, comfortable visuals, while the 108MP main camera captures detailed photography. The 5800mAh battery with 35W fast charging provides exceptional endurance, and the Snapdragon 6 Gen 1 processor ensures reliable daily performance. For clumsy users, outdoor workers, and anyone tired of cracked screens, this is the rugged beauty that doesn''t need a case. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Honor packaging, 1-year Honor warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/honor-x9b.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Honor', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('motorola-edge-50-pro', 'Motorola Edge 50 Pro — 12GB/256GB, Black Beauty', 'phones', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/motorola-edge-50-pro.webp', 'The Motorola Edge 50 Pro is the style icon with substance. The world''s first smartphone with genuine wood back options and vegan leather alternatives delivers a tactile, premium feel that plastic and glass cannot match. The 6.7-inch pOLED display with 144Hz refresh rate and 2000 nits peak brightness delivers stunning visuals, while the 50MP main camera with f/1.4 aperture — the widest on any smartphone — captures incredible low-light photography. The 125W TurboPower charging fills the 4500mAh battery in just 18 minutes, and the 50MP front camera with autofocus ensures selfie perfection. For fashion-forward buyers who want their phone to feel as good as it performs. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Motorola packaging, 1-year Motorola warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/motorola-edge-50-pro.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Motorola', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('motorola-moto-g84-5g', 'Motorola Moto G84 5G — 12GB/256GB, Midnight Blue', 'phones', 195000, 195000, 159000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/motorola-moto-g84-5g.webp', 'The Motorola Moto G84 5G is the mid-range all-rounder with a premium display. The 6.5-inch pOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate — a rarity at this price — delivers inky blacks and vibrant colors, while the Snapdragon 695 5G processor and 12GB RAM provide smooth multitasking. The 50MP main camera with OIS captures stable photos and videos, and the 5000mAh battery with 30W fast charging ensures reliable all-day endurance. With Moto''s near-stock Android experience, ThinkShield security, and the iconic Moto gestures, this is the clean, reliable smartphone for users who prioritize display quality and software simplicity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Motorola packaging, 1-year Motorola warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 159000, '/assets/products/motorola-moto-g84-5g.webp', 177000, 4.5, 0, 'Motorola', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nokia-g60-5g', 'Nokia G60 5G — 6GB/128GB, Black', 'phones', 165000, 165000, 135000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/nokia-g60-5g.webp', 'The Nokia G60 5G is the sustainable smartphone built to last. Constructed with 60% recycled plastic, this device embodies HMD Global''s commitment to environmental responsibility without sacrificing performance. The 6.58-inch FHD+ display with 120Hz refresh rate, Snapdragon 695 5G processor, and 50MP triple camera deliver modern essentials, while the 3 years of OS upgrades and 4 years of monthly security updates ensure longevity. The 4500mAh battery with 20W charging and the legendary Nokia build quality make this the eco-conscious choice for buyers who believe technology should not cost the earth. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nokia packaging, 1-year Nokia warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 135000, '/assets/products/nokia-g60-5g.webp', 150000, 4.5, 0, 'Nokia', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nokia-c32', 'Nokia C32 — 4GB/64GB, Charcoal', 'phones', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/nokia-c32.webp', 'The Nokia C32 is the entry-level smartphone that refuses to feel cheap. The 6.5-inch HD+ display with 500 nits brightness, Unisoc SC9863A processor, and 5000mAh battery with 10W charging provide reliable basics for first-time users and secondary phones. The 50MP dual camera with depth sensor captures portrait photos with background blur, and the side-mounted fingerprint sensor provides convenient security. With Nokia''s reputation for durability, clean Android interface, and two years of quarterly security updates, this is the trustworthy starter phone for students and elderly users who need simplicity and reliability above all else. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nokia packaging, 1-year Nokia warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/nokia-c32.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Nokia', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('huawei-nova-12i', 'Huawei nova 12i — 8GB/128GB, Black', 'phones', 195000, 195000, 159000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/huawei-nova-12i.webp', 'The Huawei nova 12i is the photography-focused mid-ranger with exceptional selfie capabilities. The 108MP main camera with 9-in-1 pixel binning captures stunning detail, while the 40MP front camera with AI beauty algorithms ensures social-media-ready self-portraits in any lighting. The 6.75-inch FHD+ display with 90Hz refresh rate provides an immersive canvas, and the 5000mAh battery with 40W Huawei SuperCharge Turbo 2.0 technology delivers rapid replenishment. With EMUI 14, Huawei Mobile Services, and the AppGallery for app discovery, this device is optimized for users embedded in the Huawei ecosystem who prioritize camera performance and charging speed. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Huawei packaging, 1-year Huawei warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 159000, '/assets/products/huawei-nova-12i.webp', 177000, 4.5, 0, 'Huawei', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('huawei-pura-70-ultra', 'Huawei Pura 70 Ultra — 16GB/512GB, Starburst White', 'phones', 2850000, 2850000, 2337000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/huawei-pura-70-ultra.webp', 'The Huawei Pura 70 Ultra is the camera revolution that rethinks smartphone photography from the ground up. The revolutionary 1-inch retractable main camera with variable aperture and sensor-shift stabilization physically extends when in use, maximizing light capture while maintaining a slim profile when retracted. The 50MP ultra-wide and 50MP macro telephoto with 3.5x optical zoom provide versatile coverage, while the 5200mAh battery with 100W wired and 80W wireless charging ensures you never miss a shot due to dead battery. The Kirin 9010 processor, HarmonyOS 4.2, and satellite communication capabilities demonstrate Huawei''s relentless innovation despite global constraints. For photography purists who want technology that dares to be different. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Huawei packaging, 1-year Huawei warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2337000, '/assets/products/huawei-pura-70-ultra.webp', 2593000, 4.5, 1, 'Huawei', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('asus-rog-phone-8-pro', 'Asus ROG Phone 8 Pro — 16GB/512GB, Phantom Black', 'phones', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/asus-rog-phone-8-pro.webp', 'The Asus ROG Phone 8 Pro is the gaming phone that finally looks like a flagship. The redesigned, more compact chassis houses the Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 16GB RAM, and a 6.78-inch 165Hz LTPO AMOLED display with 2500 nits peak brightness. The AirTrigger ultrasonic shoulder buttons provide console-like control, while the GameCool 8 vapor chamber cooling prevents thermal throttling during marathon sessions. The 50MP main camera with gimbal stabilization, 32MP front camera, and 5500mAh battery with 65W fast charging make this a legitimate daily driver, not just a gaming toy. With the optional AeroActive Cooler X and Kunai 3 Gamepad, this is the mobile esports rig that doesn''t embarrass you in business meetings. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Asus packaging, 1-year Asus warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/asus-rog-phone-8-pro.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'Asus', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('zte-nubia-redmagic-9-pro', 'ZTE nubia RedMagic 9 Pro — 12GB/256GB, Sleet', 'phones', 1150000, 1150000, 943000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/zte-nubia-redmagic-9-pro.webp', 'The ZTE nubia RedMagic 9 Pro is the gaming phone that eliminates the camera bump entirely. The completely flat back design with full-screen front display — no notch, no punch-hole — creates the most immersive gaming canvas in the industry. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, 12GB RAM, and 6500mAh battery with 80W fast charging provide sustained performance, while the built-in turbofan with RGB lighting actively cools the device during intensive gameplay. The 520Hz shoulder trigger sampling rate, dual X-axis linear motors for haptic feedback, and 1115K dual speakers create a console-like gaming environment. For mobile gamers who prioritize pure gaming immersion above all else. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ZTE packaging, 1-year ZTE warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 943000, '/assets/products/zte-nubia-redmagic-9-pro.webp', 1046000, 4.5, 1, 'ZTE', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-xperia-1-vi', 'Sony Xperia 1 VI — 12GB/256GB, Black', 'phones', 1650000, 1650000, 1353000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/sony-xperia-1-vi.webp', 'The Sony Xperia 1 VI is the professional tool for creators who demand manual control. The 6.5-inch 19.5:9 FHD+ OLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and real-time eye autofocus delivers a cinematic aspect ratio perfect for video content. The triple camera system with 48MP main, 16mm ultra-wide, and 85-170mm continuous optical zoom telephoto — a world first — provides unprecedented compositional flexibility. The Alpha camera engineering, manual controls, S-Cinetone color science, and 4K 120fps video recording make this the phone that professional videographers use when they leave their cameras at home. With a 5000mAh battery, Snapdragon 8 Gen 3, and 3.5mm headphone jack, this is the creator''s phone that respects tradition while pushing boundaries. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1353000, '/assets/products/sony-xperia-1-vi.webp', 1501000, 4.5, 1, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('fairphone-5', 'Fairphone 5 — 8GB/256GB, Matte Black', 'phones', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 0.2, '/assets/products/fairphone-5.webp', 'The Fairphone 5 is the ethical smartphone that proves technology and sustainability can coexist. The modular design allows you to replace the battery, display, cameras, and other components yourself with just a screwdriver — extending the device''s lifespan indefinitely. The 6.46-inch OLED display with 90Hz refresh rate, dual 50MP rear cameras, and 4200mAh removable battery deliver modern performance, while the 5 years of warranty and 8 years of software updates demonstrate a commitment to longevity over planned obsolescence. Manufactured with fair labor practices, recycled materials, and e-waste reduction at its core, this is the phone for activists, minimalists, and anyone who believes your purchase should align with your values. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Fairphone packaging, 5-year Fairphone warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/fairphone-5.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'Fairphone', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('apple-macbook-air-13-m3', 'Apple MacBook Air 13" M3 — 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD, Midnight', 'laptops', 1450000, 1450000, 1189000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-13-m3.webp', 'The Apple MacBook Air 13" with M3 chip is the world''s most popular laptop for good reason. The stunning 13.6-inch Liquid Retina display with 500 nits brightness and P3 wide color, combined with the M3 chip''s 8-core CPU and 10-core GPU, delivers up to 18 hours of battery life in a fanless, silent design that weighs just 1.24kg. The 1080p FaceTime HD camera, four-speaker sound system with Spatial Audio, and MagSafe 3 charging free up the Thunderbolt ports for accessories. With WiFi 6E, Touch ID, and the unmatched efficiency of Apple silicon, this is the ultimate portable productivity tool for students, writers, and mobile professionals who prioritize battery life and build quality above all else. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1189000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-13-m3.webp', 1319000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

