VALUES ('apple-macbook-air-15-m2', 'Apple MacBook Air 15" M2 — 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD, Starlight', 'laptops', 1350000, 1350000, 1107000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-15-m2.webp', 'The Apple MacBook Air 15" with M2 chip delivers the largest MacBook Air display ever in an impossibly thin 11.5mm chassis. The 15.3-inch Liquid Retina display with 500 nits brightness provides expansive screen real estate for multitasking, while the M2 chip''s 8-core CPU and 10-core GPU handle everything from 4K video editing to immersive gaming. The six-speaker sound system with force-canceling woofers delivers surprisingly rich audio, and the 1080p FaceTime camera ensures you look professional on every call. With 18 hours of battery life, MagSafe 3, and a weight of just 1.51kg, this is the large-screen laptop that redefines portability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1107000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-15-m2.webp', 1228000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

