VALUES ('hp-pavilion-plus-14', 'HP Pavilion Plus 14 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD, 2.8K OLED', 'laptops', 920000, 920000, 754000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-plus-14.webp', 'The HP Pavilion Plus 14 is the premium consumer laptop that brings OLED to the masses. The 14-inch 2.8K OLED display with 90Hz refresh rate, 100% DCI-P3 color gamut, and HDR 500 certification delivers inky blacks and vibrant colors that make standard IPS panels look washed out. The 13th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB RAM, and 1TB SSD ensure responsive multitasking, while the 5MP IR camera with privacy shutter, B&O audio, and HP Fast Charge support create a complete premium package. The aluminum chassis, backlit keyboard, and comprehensive port selection including USB-C and HDMI 2.1 make this the creative professional''s laptop without the workstation price tag. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 754000, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-plus-14.webp', 837000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

