VALUES ('hp-victus-15', 'HP Victus 15 — AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, RTX 3050', 'laptops', 720000, 720000, 590000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-victus-15.webp', 'The HP Victus 15 is the entry-level gaming laptop that doesn''t look like a gaming laptop. The AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS processor and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 with 6GB GDDR6 deliver 1080p gaming at medium to high settings, while the 15.6-inch FHD 144Hz display ensures smooth, tear-free visuals. The 16GB DDR5 RAM and 512GB SSD provide modern multitasking performance, and the tempered blue keyboard with full numeric keypad maintains a professional aesthetic suitable for classrooms and offices. With HP Fast Charge, enhanced thermals, and a design that transitions seamlessly from work to play, this is the gaming laptop for students who need to hide their hobby from professors. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 590000, '/assets/products/hp-victus-15.webp', 655000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

