VALUES ('dell-inspiron-15-3530', 'Dell Inspiron 15 3530 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 620000, 620000, 508000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-inspiron-15-3530.webp', 'The Dell Inspiron 15 3530 is the reliable all-rounder for families and small businesses. The 15.6-inch FHD display with 120Hz refresh rate ensures smooth visuals for everyday tasks, while the 13th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB RAM, and 512GB SSD handle multitasking, streaming, and light productivity with ease. The full-size keyboard with numeric keypad, spacious touchpad, and comprehensive port selection including USB-C, HDMI, and SD card reader provide everyday convenience. With Dell''s reliable build quality, ExpressCharge technology, and Windows 11 Home, this laptop is the dependable workhorse that gets the job done without unnecessary flair. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/dell-inspiron-15-3530.webp', 564000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

