VALUES ('dell-xps-15-9530', 'Dell XPS 15 9530 — Intel Core i7-13700H, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, RTX 4050', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-xps-15-9530.webp', 'The Dell XPS 15 9530 is the creative professional''s dream machine. The stunning 15.6-inch FHD+ InfinityEdge display with 500 nits brightness provides a color-accurate canvas for photo and video editing, while the 13th Gen Intel Core i7-13700H, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD, and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 handle Adobe Creative Suite, 3D rendering, and even light gaming. The CNC-machined aluminum and carbon fiber palm rest with white backlighting exude premium craftsmanship, and the quad-speaker system with 8W of output delivers immersive audio. With Thunderbolt 4, a full-size SD card slot, and the iconic XPS design language, this is the Windows laptop that MacBook users envy. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/dell-xps-15-9530.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

