VALUES ('lenovo-ideapad-gaming-3', 'Lenovo IdeaPad Gaming 3 — AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, RTX 3050', 'laptops', 820000, 820000, 672000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-gaming-3.webp', 'The Lenovo IdeaPad Gaming 3 is the budget gaming laptop that doesn''t compromise on the essentials. The AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS processor and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 deliver solid 1080p gaming performance, while the 15.6-inch FHD 120Hz display ensures smooth visuals. The 16GB DDR5 RAM and 512GB SSD provide modern storage and memory standards, and the Legion Coldfront cooling with dual fans and larger vents prevents thermal throttling during intense sessions. The blue-backlit keyboard, Nahimic audio, and clean design make this suitable for both gaming and classroom use. For students and first-time PC gamers seeking maximum frames per naira. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 672000, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-gaming-3.webp', 746000, 4.5, 1, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

