VALUES ('lenovo-yoga-7i-2-in-1', 'Lenovo Yoga 7i 2-in-1 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 14" 2.2K Touch', 'laptops', 920000, 920000, 754000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-yoga-7i-2-in-1.webp', 'The Lenovo Yoga 7i is the versatile 2-in-1 that adapts to your workflow. The 14-inch 2.2K IPS touchscreen with 100% sRGB, 300 nits brightness, and 360-degree hinge transforms from laptop to tablet to tent mode instantly. The 13th Gen Intel Core i7, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, and 512GB SSD ensure responsive performance, while the included Lenovo Precision Pen 2 enables sketching, note-taking, and creative work. The all-metal chassis, backlit keyboard, fingerprint reader, and Thunderbolt 4 ports deliver premium build quality. With Dolby Atmos speakers, a privacy shutter, and Lenovo''s reliability, this is the convertible for professionals who refuse to choose between productivity and creativity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 754000, '/assets/products/lenovo-yoga-7i-2-in-1.webp', 837000, 4.5, 1, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

