VALUES ('asus-tuf-gaming-a15', 'ASUS TUF Gaming A15 — AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, RTX 4060', 'laptops', 1150000, 1150000, 943000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/asus-tuf-gaming-a15.webp', 'The ASUS TUF Gaming A15 is the military-grade gaming laptop built to survive Nigerian conditions. Validated to MIL-STD-810H standards for drops, vibration, humidity, and extreme temperatures, this laptop features the AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 with 140W max TGP for high-refresh 1080p gaming. The 15.6-inch FHD 144Hz display with Adaptive-Sync eliminates screen tearing, while the 90Wh battery provides all-day productivity when not gaming. The Arc Flow Fans with 84-blade design and multiple heat pipes ensure sustained performance, and the MUX Switch allows direct GPU mode for maximum frames. For gamers who need a laptop that survives dust, heat, and rough handling. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 943000, '/assets/products/asus-tuf-gaming-a15.webp', 1046000, 4.5, 1, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

