VALUES ('asus-zenbook-duo-14', 'ASUS ZenBook Duo 14 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD, Dual Screen', 'laptops', 1450000, 1450000, 1189000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/asus-zenbook-duo-14.webp', 'The ASUS ZenBook Duo 14 is the dual-screen productivity revolution. The primary 14-inch FHD OLED touchscreen pairs with the secondary 12.7-inch ScreenPad Plus — a full-width touchscreen above the keyboard that serves as a secondary monitor, control panel, or creative palette. The 13th Gen Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, and 1TB SSD power seamless multitasking across both displays, while the included ASUS Pen enables precise input. The ErgoLift hinge tilts the ScreenPad Plus for comfortable viewing angles, and the 75Wh battery with USB-C charging ensures all-day mobility. For multitaskers, streamers, and creative professionals who need more screen real estate than any single display can provide. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1189000, '/assets/products/asus-zenbook-duo-14.webp', 1319000, 4.5, 1, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

