VALUES ('microsoft-surface-laptop-5', 'Microsoft Surface Laptop 5 — Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, 13.5" Touch', 'laptops', 1350000, 1350000, 1107000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-laptop-5.webp', 'The Microsoft Surface Laptop 5 is the Windows laptop designed by the company that created Windows. The 13.5-inch PixelSense touchscreen with 3:2 aspect ratio provides 18% more vertical screen real estate than 16:9 laptops — perfect for document editing and web browsing. The 12th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB LPDDR5x RAM, and 512GB SSD deliver smooth performance, while the signature Alcantara or metal keyboard deck and Omnisonic speakers with Dolby Atmos create a sensory experience. With Windows Hello face authentication, all-day battery life, and the premium build quality that defines the Surface line, this is the laptop for professionals who want the purest Windows experience. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1107000, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-laptop-5.webp', 1228000, 4.5, 1, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

