VALUES ('microsoft-surface-pro-9', 'Microsoft Surface Pro 9 — Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD, 13"', 'laptops', 1550000, 1550000, 1271000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-pro-9.webp', 'The Microsoft Surface Pro 9 is the tablet that replaces your laptop. The 13-inch PixelSense Flow display with 120Hz refresh rate and 2880x1920 resolution delivers stunning, responsive visuals, while the 12th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB RAM, and 256GB SSD provide full laptop performance in a 879g tablet. The signature kickstand adjusts to any angle, and the optional Surface Pro Signature Keyboard and Slim Pen 2 transform it into a complete productivity and creativity workstation. With Thunderbolt 4, Windows 11, and the versatility to be whatever you need it to be, this is the 2-in-1 that defined the category. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1271000, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-pro-9.webp', 1410000, 4.5, 1, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

