VALUES ('msi-modern-15', 'MSI Modern 15 — Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/msi-modern-15.webp', 'The MSI Modern 15 is the business laptop that proves MSI can do more than gaming. The 15.6-inch FHD IPS-level display with thin bezels, 13th Gen Intel Core i7 processor, 16GB RAM, and 512GB SSD deliver reliable productivity performance in a chassis weighing just 1.7kg. The backlit keyboard, fingerprint reader, and comprehensive port selection including USB-C and microSD provide everyday convenience, while the 52Wh battery ensures mobility. With a professional, understated design in carbon gray and MSI''s build quality, this is the laptop for professionals who want reliability without gaming aesthetics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original MSI packaging, 1-year MSI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/msi-modern-15.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'MSI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

