VALUES ('lenovo-tab-p12', 'Lenovo Tab P12 — 12.7", 8GB/128GB, WiFi, Storm Grey', 'tablets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-p12.webp', 'The Lenovo Tab P12 is the entertainment tablet with a screen that rivals laptops. The massive 12.7-inch 3K display with 1840x2944 resolution and 400 nits brightness delivers stunning detail for movies, comics, and digital magazines. The MediaTek Dimensity 7050 processor, 8GB RAM, and 128GB storage with microSD expansion handle multitasking and media storage, while the four JBL speakers with Dolby Atmos create a cinematic audio environment. The optional Lenovo Precision Pen 2 and keyboard case transform it into a productivity device, and the 10200mAh battery ensures marathon viewing sessions. For media consumers who prioritize screen size and audio quality above all else. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-p12.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

