VALUES ('lenovo-tab-m10-plus', 'Lenovo Tab M10 Plus (3rd Gen) — 10.6", 4GB/64GB, WiFi, Storm Grey', 'tablets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-m10-plus.webp', 'The Lenovo Tab M10 Plus (3rd Gen) is the accessible tablet for everyday family use. The 10.6-inch 2K display with TÜV Rheinland low blue light certification ensures comfortable viewing for extended periods, while the MediaTek Helio G80 processor and 4GB RAM handle streaming, browsing, and light gaming. The dual speakers with Dolby Atmos, 7700mAh battery, and Google Kids Space with family link parental controls make this the ideal tablet for children and shared household use. With a slim metal design, face unlock, and Android 12, this is the budget tablet that doesn''t feel like a compromise. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-m10-plus.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

