VALUES ('amazon-fire-hd-10-plus', 'Amazon Fire HD 10 Plus — 32GB, 10.1", Slate', 'tablets', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/amazon-fire-hd-10-plus.webp', 'The Amazon Fire HD 10 Plus is the value tablet optimized for Amazon ecosystem devotees. The 10.1-inch 1080p Full HD display, octa-core processor, and 4GB RAM deliver responsive performance for Prime Video, Kindle reading, and Alexa voice control. The wireless charging compatibility and 12-hour battery life ensure convenient, all-day use, while the Show Mode transforms the tablet into an Echo Show when docked. With access to Amazon''s Appstore, parental controls via Amazon Kids+, and a price that undercuts every competitor, this is the tablet for Prime subscribers who want seamless access to their content library without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/amazon-fire-hd-10-plus.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

