VALUES ('pocketbook-era', 'PocketBook Era — 16GB, 7" E Ink Carta 1200, Stardust Silver', 'tablets', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/pocketbook-era.webp', 'The PocketBook Era is the waterproof e-reader with a speaker for audiobooks. The 7-inch E Ink Carta 1200 display with SMARTlight automatic brightness and color temperature adjustment ensures optimal reading in any environment, while the built-in speaker and Bluetooth audio support allow seamless switching between reading and listening to audiobooks. The 16GB storage with cloud integration, support for 25 formats including MP3 and M4B, and text-to-speech functionality make this the most versatile e-reader for multimedia book lovers. The ergonomic design with page-turn buttons and IPX8 waterproof rating complete the package for bath readers and audiobook enthusiasts. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original PocketBook packaging, 1-year PocketBook warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/pocketbook-era.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

