VALUES ('fitbit-sense-2', 'Fitbit Sense 2 — Advanced Health Smartwatch, Shadow Grey/Graphite', 'wearables', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 0.05, '/assets/products/fitbit-sense-2.webp', 'The Fitbit Sense 2 is the health-focused smartwatch that helps you manage stress, not just track it. The cEDA sensor continuously monitors electrodermal activity to detect stress responses, while the ECG app, SpO2 monitoring, and skin temperature tracking provide a comprehensive picture of your wellbeing. The built-in GPS, 40+ exercise modes, and Daily Readiness Score tell you whether to push hard or prioritize recovery. With 6+ days of battery life, Google Wallet, Google Maps integration, and the vibrant AMOLED display, this is the wellness companion for users who want health insights beyond step counting. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Fitbit packaging, 1-year Fitbit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/fitbit-sense-2.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Fitbit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

