VALUES ('fitbit-versa-4', 'Fitbit Versa 4 — Fitness Smartwatch, Black/Graphite', 'wearables', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 0.05, '/assets/products/fitbit-versa-4.webp', 'The Fitbit Versa 4 is the fitness smartwatch that simplifies your health journey. The built-in GPS tracks outdoor workouts without your phone, while the 24/7 heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and Active Zone Minutes ensure you understand how your body responds to exercise. The 40+ exercise modes with automatic workout detection, 6+ days of battery life, and Google Assistant integration provide convenience and motivation. The thin, lightweight design with AMOLED display and Always-On option transitions seamlessly from gym to office, and the Fitbit app ecosystem provides the insights and community that have made Fitbit the world''s most popular fitness tracker brand. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Fitbit packaging, 1-year Fitbit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/fitbit-versa-4.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Fitbit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

