VALUES ('fitbit-charge-6', 'Fitbit Charge 6 — Fitness Tracker with Google Apps, Obsidian/Black', 'wearables', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.05, '/assets/products/fitbit-charge-6.webp', 'The Fitbit Charge 6 is the most advanced fitness band ever created. The built-in GPS, 24/7 heart rate monitoring, and 40+ exercise modes with automatic detection provide comprehensive workout tracking, while the YouTube Music controls, Google Maps turn-by-turn directions, and Google Wallet integration bring smartphone convenience to your wrist. The 7-day battery life, bright color touchscreen, and always-on display option ensure you never miss a notification or health insight. With the Daily Readiness Score, stress management tools, and sleep tracking that Fitbit perfected over a decade, this band proves that not everyone needs a smartwatch to be smart about health. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Fitbit packaging, 1-year Fitbit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/fitbit-charge-6.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Fitbit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

