VALUES ('romoss-pea60', 'Romoss PEA60 — 60000mAh, 22.5W, 3-Input/4-Output, LED Display', 'accessories', 58000, 58000, 47000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/romoss-pea60.webp', 'The Romoss PEA60 is the portable power station disguised as a power bank. With a colossal 60000mAh capacity, this device charges smartphones 12+ times, tablets multiple times, and even powers small appliances via its 22.5W output. The four USB outputs and three input options provide unmatched connectivity flexibility, while the large LED digital display shows precise remaining power. The built-in LED flashlight with SOS mode adds emergency utility, and the rugged construction withstands daily abuse. For camping trips, multi-day festivals, home backup during NEPA outages, and outdoor work sites, this power bank is your energy insurance policy. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Romoss packaging, 1-year Romoss warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 47000, '/assets/products/romoss-pea60.webp', 52000, 4.5, 0, 'Romoss', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

