VALUES ('anker-733-power-bank', 'Anker 733 Power Bank — 2-in-1 Hybrid Charger, 10000mAh, 65W, Black', 'accessories', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/anker-733-power-bank.webp', 'The Anker 733 Power Bank is the transformer that functions as both a wall charger and a portable power bank. Plugged into the wall, it is a 65W GaN charger that powers laptops, tablets, and phones via two USB-C ports and one USB-A port. Unplugged, it becomes a 10000mAh power bank with 30W output for on-the-go charging. The intelligent power allocation ensures optimal charging whether connected to AC power or operating on battery, and the compact GaN technology keeps the unit surprisingly small. For travelers who want to carry one device instead of a separate charger and power bank, this hybrid is the ultimate space-saver. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/anker-733-power-bank.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

