VALUES ('ugreen-145w-power-bank', 'UGREEN 145W Power Bank — 25000mAh, 3-Port, Smart Digital Display', 'accessories', 72000, 72000, 59000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/ugreen-145w-power-bank.webp', 'The UGREEN 145W Power Bank is the capacity king for multi-device professionals. The 25000mAh battery charges a MacBook Pro 1.3 times or smartphones 5+ times, while the 145W total output across two USB-C and one USB-A port handles laptops, tablets, and accessories simultaneously. The 65W fast recharge fills the unit in 2.5 hours, and the smart digital display provides real-time charging metrics. With support for PD 3.0, QC 3.0, PPS, and AFC protocols, this power bank intelligently adapts to any connected device. The aviation-friendly capacity and premium build make this the ultimate travel companion for digital nomads. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original UGREEN packaging, 1-year UGREEN warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 59000, '/assets/products/ugreen-145w-power-bank.webp', 65000, 4.5, 0, 'UGREEN', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

