VALUES ('samsung-45w-travel-adapter', 'Samsung 45W Travel Adapter — USB-C PD PPS, Black', 'accessories', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/samsung-45w-travel-adapter.webp', 'The Samsung 45W Travel Adapter is the official fast charger for Galaxy power users. Supporting USB-C Power Delivery with PPS (Programmable Power Supply), this adapter charges Galaxy S24 Ultra, S23 Ultra, and Z Fold series at maximum 45W Super Fast Charging 2.0 speed. The compact, travel-friendly design with universal voltage support works worldwide, and the single USB-C port eliminates cable confusion. When paired with Samsung''s 5A USB-C cable, this adapter delivers the exact power profile that Samsung devices are engineered for, ensuring optimal charging speed with minimal heat generation. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/samsung-45w-travel-adapter.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

