VALUES ('otterbox-defender-series', 'OtterBox Defender Series — iPhone 14 Pro, Black', 'accessories', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/otterbox-defender-series.webp', 'The OtterBox Defender Series is the rugged case that has protected phones in war zones, construction sites, and Nigerian markets for over a decade. The multi-layer defense includes a solid inner shell, resilient outer slipcover, and built-in screen protector that guards against drops, dust, and scratches. The port covers block dirt and lint from entering charging ports and speakers, while the holster clip doubles as a kickstand. Tested to survive 4x as many drops as military standard requirements, this case is for users who work in harsh environments or simply refuse to take chances with their investment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original OtterBox packaging, lifetime OtterBox warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/otterbox-defender-series.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'OtterBox', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

