VALUES ('caseology-parallax-case', 'Caseology Parallax Case — Google Pixel 8 Pro, Matte Black', 'accessories', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/caseology-parallax-case.webp', 'The Caseology Parallax Case is the geometric grip masterpiece for Pixel enthusiasts. The 3D hexagon pattern on the back and sides provides exceptional tactile grip that prevents slips, while the dual-layer construction of TPU and PC absorbs impacts from daily drops. The precise cutouts accommodate Pixel''s unique camera bar, and the raised edges protect the display and camera lenses. The slim profile maintains wireless charging compatibility, and the modern geometric aesthetic complements Google''s design language. For Pixel users who want stylish protection that feels secure in the hand without adding excessive bulk. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Caseology packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/caseology-parallax-case.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Caseology', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

