VALUES ('esr-halolock-case', 'ESR HaloLock Case — iPhone 15, Clear, MagSafe Compatible', 'accessories', 15000, 15000, 12000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/esr-halolock-case.webp', 'The ESR HaloLock Case is the MagSafe-optimized clear case that maximizes magnetic strength. The built-in HaloLock magnetic ring provides 1500g of holding force — 2x stronger than standard MagSafe cases — ensuring your MagSafe wallet, charger, and car mount stay securely attached. The yellowing-resistant acrylic back maintains clarity over time, while the flexible TPU frame absorbs shocks. The raised camera guard and screen-protector-friendly design ensure comprehensive protection, and the precise cutouts maintain full functionality. For iPhone 15 users who rely on MagSafe accessories and refuse weak magnetic connections. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ESR packaging, 1-year ESR warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 12000, '/assets/products/esr-halolock-case.webp', 13000, 4.5, 0, 'ESR', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

