VALUES ('spigen-tempered-glass-screen-protector', 'Spigen Tempered Glass Screen Protector — iPhone 15 Pro Max, 2-Pack', 'accessories', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/spigen-tempered-glass-screen-protector.webp', 'The Spigen Tempered Glass Screen Protector is the invisible shield that preserves your iPhone''s touch sensitivity. The 9H hardness-rated tempered glass resists scratches from keys and coins, while the oleophobic coating repels fingerprints and smudges. The precise cutout for the Dynamic Island ensures no interference with Face ID or front camera quality, and the thin 0.3mm profile maintains 3D Touch and swipe gestures. The included alignment tray makes installation bubble-free and foolproof, and the 2-pack ensures you have a backup ready. For iPhone users who understand that screen replacement costs far more than prevention. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Spigen packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/spigen-tempered-glass-screen-protector.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Spigen', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

