VALUES ('whitestone-dome-glass', 'Whitestone Dome Glass — Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, UV Cured, 2-Pack', 'accessories', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/whitestone-dome-glass.webp', 'The Whitestone Dome Glass is the only screen protector that truly conforms to curved displays. Using a patented liquid optical clear adhesive and UV curing process, this tempered glass bonds directly to the curved edges of Galaxy S24 Ultra, eliminating the halo effect and touch sensitivity issues that plague standard flat protectors. The 9H hardness and self-healing top layer provide scratch resistance, while the ultrasonic fingerprint sensor compatibility ensures your biometrics work flawlessly. The included UV lamp and installation jig make professional-grade application achievable at home. For Galaxy users who refuse to compromise on edge-to-edge protection. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Whitestone packaging, 1-year Whitestone warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/whitestone-dome-glass.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Whitestone', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

