VALUES ('popsockets-popgrip', 'PopSockets PopGrip — Swappable, Aluminum Black', 'accessories', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/popsockets-popgrip.webp', 'The PopSockets PopGrip is the phone accessory that prevents drops and enables one-handed use. The collapsible grip extends for secure holding during selfies and texting, then collapses flat for pocketability. The swappable top allows you to change styles to match your mood or case, while the adhesive backing attaches to most phones and cases. The built-in stand props your phone for video watching, and the compatibility with PopSockets mounts and wallets creates an entire ecosystem of accessories. For anyone who has ever dropped their phone while taking a photo or struggled to reach the top of a large screen. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original PopSockets packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/popsockets-popgrip.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'PopSockets', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

