VALUES ('anker-610-magnetic-phone-grip', 'Anker 610 Magnetic Phone Grip (MagGo) — iPhone 12/13/14/15, Black', 'accessories', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/anker-610-magnetic-phone-grip.webp', 'The Anker 610 Magnetic Phone Grip is the MagSafe-compatible holder that attaches and detaches instantly. The powerful magnetic ring aligns perfectly with iPhone 12 and later models, providing a secure finger loop for one-handed use without sticky adhesive residue. The ring rotates 360 degrees and flips 125 degrees, serving as both grip and stand for horizontal viewing. The slim 6.8mm profile adds minimal bulk, and the silicone-coated zinc alloy construction feels premium and comfortable. For iPhone users who want the functionality of a PopSocket with the convenience of MagSafe magnetic attachment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/anker-610-magnetic-phone-grip.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

