VALUES ('lamicall-adjustable-phone-stand', 'Lamicall Adjustable Phone Stand — Desktop, Aluminum, Silver', 'accessories', 9500, 9500, 7000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/lamicall-adjustable-phone-stand.webp', 'The Lamicall Adjustable Phone Stand is the desktop essential that ends neck strain. The solid aluminum construction with rubber pads provides a stable platform for phones and tablets up to 10 inches, while the adjustable angle and height ensure optimal viewing whether you''re on video calls, following recipes, or watching tutorials. The anti-scratch silicone pads protect your device, and the cable management hole keeps charging cords organized. The foldable design travels easily, and the weighted base prevents tipping even when tapping the screen. For home offices, kitchens, and bedside tables where hands-free viewing is essential. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lamicall packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 7000, '/assets/products/lamicall-adjustable-phone-stand.webp', 8000, 4.5, 0, 'Lamicall', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

