VALUES ('ugreen-car-phone-mount', 'UGREEN Car Phone Mount — Dashboard/Windshield, Suction Cup, Black', 'accessories', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/ugreen-car-phone-mount.webp', 'The UGREEN Car Phone Mount is the secure viewing solution for Nigerian roads. The industrial-strength suction cup with sticky gel pad adheres firmly to dashboards and windshields even in extreme heat, while the adjustable telescopic arm and 360-degree ball joint provide the perfect viewing angle. The one-touch release button allows single-handed phone insertion and removal, and the adjustable side grips accommodate devices from 4 to 7 inches including bulky cases. With shock-absorbing spring-loaded grips and a design that does not block charging ports, this mount keeps your navigation visible and your hands on the wheel. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original UGREEN packaging, 1-year UGREEN warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/ugreen-car-phone-mount.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'UGREEN', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

