VALUES ('boya-by-mm1', 'Boya BY-MM1+ — Super-Cardioid Shotgun Microphone, Compact', 'cameras', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/boya-by-mm1.webp', 'The Boya BY-MM1+ is the shotgun microphone that mounts on your camera and ignores everything except your subject. The supercardioid polar pattern rejects off-axis ambient noise — traffic, crowd chatter, wind — while focusing on the audio directly in front of the lens. The aluminum body provides RF interference shielding, and the included shock mount, foam windscreen, and furry deadcat cover adapt to indoor and outdoor conditions. With no batteries required and plug-and-play 3.5mm connectivity, this microphone is always ready. For vloggers, wedding filmmakers, and documentary shooters who need directional audio without the complexity of wireless systems. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Boya packaging, 1-year Boya warranty. Neewer 43-Inch 5-in-1 Collapsible Multi-Disc Reflector (New)', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/boya-by-mm1.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Boya', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

