VALUES ('amazon-echo-dot-1', 'Amazon Echo Dot (5th Gen) — Smart Speaker with Alexa, Glacier White', 'smart-home', 58000, 58000, 47000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/amazon-echo-dot-1.webp', 'The Amazon Echo Dot 5th Gen is the smart speaker that transforms any room into a voice-controlled command center. The improved audio architecture delivers twice the bass of the previous generation, while the built-in temperature sensor enables smart home automations based on room climate. The tap controls allow quick snoozing of alarms and pausing of music, and the eero Built-in feature extends your WiFi coverage by up to 1,000 square feet. With access to over 100,000 Alexa skills, seamless smart home device control, and clear voice recognition across the room, this is the entry point to a truly connected Nigerian home. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 47000, '/assets/products/amazon-echo-dot-1.webp', 52000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

