VALUES ('amazon-echo-show-8-1', 'Amazon Echo Show 8 (3rd Gen) — 8" HD Smart Display, Charcoal', 'smart-home', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/amazon-echo-show-8-1.webp', 'The Amazon Echo Show 8 3rd Gen is the visual smart hub that brings video to your voice commands. The 8-inch HD touchscreen with adaptive color adjusts to room lighting for natural video calls, streaming, and recipe viewing. The upgraded 13MP camera with auto-framing keeps you centered during video calls, while the spatial audio with room adaptation delivers immersive sound. The visual Alexa responses show weather forecasts, security camera feeds, and music lyrics, and the smart home control dashboard provides one-touch management of lights, locks, and thermostats. For families who want the convenience of visual information combined with powerful audio. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/amazon-echo-show-8-1.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

