VALUES ('google-nest-hub-1', 'Google Nest Hub (2nd Gen) — 7" Smart Display, Chalk', 'smart-home', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/google-nest-hub-1.webp', 'The Google Nest Hub 2nd Gen is the sleep-tracking smart display that cares about your rest. The 7-inch touchscreen with Ambient EQ matches room lighting for comfortable viewing day and night, while the Soli sleep sensing technology tracks your sleep stages, breathing, and disturbances without cameras or wearables. The Quick Gestures allow pause and play with a wave of your hand, and the built-in Google Assistant provides personalized morning briefings with commute times, weather, and calendar events. With Nest camera and doorbell integration, YouTube streaming, and multi-room audio control, this is the bedside companion that enhances your entire day. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/google-nest-hub-1.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

