VALUES ('philips-hue-white-color-ambiance-starter-kit', 'Philips Hue White & Color Ambiance Starter Kit — 3 Bulbs + Bridge, A60 E27', 'smart-home', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/philips-hue-white-color-ambiance-starter-kit.webp', 'The Philips Hue White & Color Ambiance Starter Kit is the lighting system that paints your home in 16 million colors. The three A60 E27 bulbs deliver warm-to-cool white light and full spectrum colors controllable via the Hue app, voice commands, or automations. The included Hue Bridge enables out-of-home control, scheduling, and integration with Alexa, Google Assistant, and Apple HomeKit. The bulbs sync with music, movies, and games for immersive entertainment lighting, and the wake-up and sleep routines gradually adjust brightness to support your circadian rhythm. For homeowners who understand that lighting sets the mood for every moment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Philips packaging, 2-year Philips warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/philips-hue-white-color-ambiance-starter-kit.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Philips', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-mi-smart-home-security-camera-2k', 'Xiaomi Mi Smart Home Security Camera 2K — 360° Pan/Tilt, AI Detection, White', 'smart-home', 38000, 38000, 31000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/xiaomi-mi-smart-home-security-camera-2k.webp', 'The Xiaomi Mi Smart Home Security Camera 2K is the vigilant guardian that never sleeps. The 2K resolution with F1.4 large aperture captures crisp details even in low light, while the 360-degree pan and 1080-degree tilt eliminate blind spots in any room. The AI human detection distinguishes between people and pets, reducing false alerts, and the two-way voice intercom lets you communicate with family or warn intruders. The microSD card and cloud storage options ensure footage is preserved, and the physical lens shield provides privacy when you are home. For families who want professional-grade security without monthly subscription fees. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 31000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-mi-smart-home-security-camera-2k.webp', 34000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('tp-link-tapo-c200', 'TP-Link Tapo C200 — Pan/Tilt Home Security Wi-Fi Camera, 1080P, Night Vision', 'smart-home', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/tp-link-tapo-c200.webp', 'The TP-Link Tapo C200 is the affordable security camera that punches above its weight. The 1080p Full HD resolution with advanced night vision up to 30 feet ensures clear footage around the clock, while the 360-degree horizontal and 114-degree vertical range covers entire rooms from a single mounting point. The motion detection with instant push notifications alerts you to activity within seconds, and the two-way audio with built-in siren deters unwanted visitors. The local microSD storage up to 128GB eliminates cloud subscription costs, and the Tapo app provides intuitive control and playback. For budget-conscious homeowners who refuse to compromise on home security coverage. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original TP-Link packaging, 2-year TP-Link warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/tp-link-tapo-c200.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'TP-Link', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ring-video-doorbell-4-1', 'Ring Video Doorbell 4 — 1080p HD Video, Color Pre-Roll, Black', 'smart-home', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/ring-video-doorbell-4-1.webp', 'The Ring Video Doorbell 4 is the door guardian that shows you what happened before the knock. The unique Color Pre-Roll technology captures four seconds of full-color video before motion events, ensuring you never miss the beginning of an incident. The 1080p HD video with night vision, two-way talk with noise cancellation, and customizable motion zones provide comprehensive front-door security. The quick-release battery pack allows easy charging without removing the entire doorbell, and the dual-band WiFi ensures stable connectivity. With Alexa integration for announcements on Echo devices and Ring Protect compatibility for video history, this is the ultimate deterrent for porch pirates and unwanted visitors. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ring packaging, 1-year Ring warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/ring-video-doorbell-4-1.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Ring', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('google-nest-doorbell', 'Google Nest Doorbell (Battery) — Smart Video Doorbell, Snow', 'smart-home', 115000, 115000, 94000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/google-nest-doorbell.webp', 'The Google Nest Doorbell Battery is the wire-free doorbell that thinks before it alerts. The on-device machine learning distinguishes between people, packages, animals, and vehicles, sending only relevant notifications to your phone. The 960x1280 vertical HD video with HDR shows visitors from head to toe, while the night vision with 850nm IR LEDs maintains clarity after dark. The three-hour battery life snapshot history provides context even without a subscription, and the wire-free design installs in minutes on any doorframe. With Google Home app integration, two-way talk, and pre-recorded quick responses, this is the intelligent doorbell for renters and homeowners alike. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 94000, '/assets/products/google-nest-doorbell.webp', 104000, 4.5, 0, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('august-wi-fi-smart-lock', 'August Wi-Fi Smart Lock (4th Gen) — Silver', 'smart-home', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/august-wi-fi-smart-lock.webp', 'The August Wi-Fi Smart Lock 4th Gen is the retrofit lock that makes your existing deadbolt brilliant. The compact design installs on the inside of your door in minutes without replacing exterior hardware, while the built-in WiFi eliminates the need for a separate bridge. The auto-lock and auto-unlock features detect your arrival and departure via smartphone proximity, and the activity feed shows who entered and when. The virtual guest keys allow temporary access for cleaners, dog walkers, and Airbnb guests, and the DoorSense sensor confirms the door is closed and locked. For smart home enthusiasts who want keyless entry without changing their door''s appearance. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original August packaging, 1-year August warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/august-wi-fi-smart-lock.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'August', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('switchbot-bot', 'SwitchBot Bot — Smart Button Pusher, Bluetooth, White', 'smart-home', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/switchbot-bot.webp', 'The SwitchBot Bot is the tiny robot that makes dumb devices smart. This coin-sized gadget physically presses buttons and toggles switches on any appliance — coffee makers, air conditioners, PCs, lamps — without wiring or modification. The Bluetooth connectivity with SwitchBot Hub Mini enables remote control and voice assistant integration, while the scheduling feature automates daily routines like turning on the coffee maker at 6 AM. The included 3M adhesive mounts securely to any surface, and the replaceable CR2 battery lasts up to 600 days. For renters and homeowners who want smart home control without replacing perfectly functional appliances. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SwitchBot packaging, 1-year SwitchBot warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/switchbot-bot.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'SwitchBot', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('switchbot-hub-mini', 'SwitchBot Hub Mini — Smart Remote, IR Blaster, White', 'smart-home', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/switchbot-hub-mini.webp', 'The SwitchBot Hub Mini is the universal remote that learns your entire home. The IR blaster controls TVs, air conditioners, fans, and set-top boxes via the SwitchBot app, while the Bluetooth gateway connects SwitchBot Bots and sensors to WiFi for remote access. The learning mode copies commands from existing remotes in seconds, and the scheduling and scene automation create complex routines like "Movie Night" that dims lights, lowers AC, and turns on the TV. With Alexa, Google Assistant, and Siri Shortcuts integration, this compact hub transforms legacy electronics into voice-controlled smart devices. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SwitchBot packaging, 1-year SwitchBot warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/switchbot-hub-mini.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'SwitchBot', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('broadlink-rm4-pro', 'Broadlink RM4 Pro — Universal IR/RF Remote Control, Black', 'smart-home', 32000, 32000, 26000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/broadlink-rm4-pro.webp', 'The Broadlink RM4 Pro is the all-frequency remote that commands everything. The combined IR and RF support controls air conditioners, TVs, curtains, garage doors, and RF switches from a single app, while the temperature and humidity sensor enables climate-based automations. The learning function copies signals from existing remotes, and the IFTTT and Alexa integration create powerful cross-platform scenes. The USB-powered design with external sensor cable provides flexible placement, and the Broadlink app offers intuitive device management and scheduling. For tech enthusiasts who want one app to rule every remote-controlled device in their home. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Broadlink packaging, 1-year Broadlink warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/broadlink-rm4-pro.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'Broadlink', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('wyze-cam-v3', 'Wyze Cam v3 — 1080p Indoor/Outdoor Security Camera, Color Night Vision', 'smart-home', 25000, 25000, 20000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/wyze-cam-v3.webp', 'The Wyze Cam v3 is the budget security camera that refuses to cut corners. The Starlight Sensor enables full-color night vision in environments too dark for traditional cameras, while the IP65 weatherproof rating allows indoor and outdoor installation without additional housing. The 1080p Full HD with 130-degree wide-angle lens captures expansive views, and the two-way audio with built-in siren provides deterrence and communication. The free 14-day cloud storage and local microSD recording up to 32GB ensure footage is always accessible, and the motion and sound detection with AI person detection minimize false alerts. For homeowners who want premium security features at a price that seems impossible. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Wyze packaging, 1-year Wyze warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 20000, '/assets/products/wyze-cam-v3.webp', 22000, 4.5, 0, 'Wyze', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('eufy-security-solocam-s40', 'Eufy Security SoloCam S40 — Solar-Powered, Wireless, 2K, Spotlight', 'smart-home', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/eufy-security-solocam-s40.webp', 'The Eufy Security SoloCam S40 is the solar-powered camera that frees you from charging cycles. The integrated solar panel continuously charges the built-in battery with just two hours of direct sunlight daily, providing perpetual wireless operation. The 2K resolution with color night vision and built-in spotlight captures crystal-clear footage and deters intruders, while the on-device AI distinguishes humans from animals and vehicles. The local storage with no monthly fees, military-grade encryption, and IP67 weatherproof rating ensure security and privacy in any environment. For homeowners who want set-and-forget security without subscription costs or charging hassles. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Eufy packaging, 1-year Eufy warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/eufy-security-solocam-s40.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Eufy', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('aqara-hub-m2', 'Aqara Hub M2 — Smart Home Bridge, IR Blaster, HomeKit Compatible, Black', 'smart-home', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/aqara-hub-m2.webp', 'The Aqara Hub M2 is the command center that unites Zigbee, WiFi, and IR devices under one roof. The Zigbee 3.0 gateway connects up to 128 Aqara sensors and switches with stable, low-power mesh networking, while the IR blaster controls legacy TVs and AC units. The HomeKit, Alexa, Google Assistant, and IFTTT compatibility ensures seamless integration with any ecosystem, and the built-in speaker provides alarm tones and doorbell chimes. The Ethernet and WiFi connectivity options provide reliable networking, and the automation engine creates complex conditional scenes. For serious smart home builders who demand protocol flexibility and local control. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Aqara packaging, 1-year Aqara warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/aqara-hub-m2.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Aqara', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('aqara-door-window-sensor', 'Aqara Door & Window Sensor — Zigbee 3.0, Mini Size, White', 'smart-home', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/aqara-door-window-sensor.webp', 'The Aqara Door & Window Sensor is the tiny sentinel that monitors every entry point. The compact 41x22x11mm design installs discreetly on any door, window, or drawer, while the Zigbee 3.0 protocol provides instant status updates with minimal battery drain. The sensor triggers automations like turning on lights when a door opens or sounding alarms when windows open unexpectedly, and the Aqara Hub integration enables complex conditional logic. The replaceable CR1632 battery lasts up to two years, and the IPX0 rating ensures reliable indoor operation. For security-conscious homeowners who want invisible monitoring throughout their property. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Aqara packaging, 1-year Aqara warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/aqara-door-window-sensor.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Aqara', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('aqara-motion-sensor-p1', 'Aqara Motion Sensor P1 — Zigbee 3.0, 5-Year Battery, Adjustable Sensitivity', 'smart-home', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/aqara-motion-sensor-p1.webp', 'The Aqara Motion Sensor P1 is the long-lasting presence detector that adapts to any room. The adjustable sensitivity with three detection distance settings reduces false triggers in small spaces, while the five-year battery life eliminates maintenance anxiety. The 170-degree detection angle and 7-meter range cover large areas, and the light sensor enables brightness-based automations like turning on lights only when motion is detected in dark rooms. The Zigbee 3.0 mesh networking with Aqara Hub integration provides local, low-latency automation execution. For smart home enthusiasts who want reliable motion detection without frequent battery swaps. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Aqara packaging, 1-year Aqara warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/aqara-motion-sensor-p1.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Aqara', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

