VALUES ('aqara-temperature-humidity-sensor', 'Aqara Temperature & Humidity Sensor — Zigbee 3.0, LCD Display, White', 'smart-home', 14000, 14000, 11000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/aqara-temperature-humidity-sensor.webp', 'The Aqara Temperature & Humidity Sensor is the climate monitor that triggers comfort automations. The precision Swiss-made sensor measures temperature to ±0.3°C and humidity to ±3%, displaying readings on the built-in E Ink LCD screen. The Zigbee 3.0 connectivity with Aqara Hub enables automations like turning on fans when temperature rises or activating dehumidifiers when humidity spikes. The compact magnetic design attaches to walls or stands on desks, and the CR2032 battery provides two years of continuous monitoring. For homeowners who want data-driven climate control and energy savings. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Aqara packaging, 1-year Aqara warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 11000, '/assets/products/aqara-temperature-humidity-sensor.webp', 12000, 4.5, 0, 'Aqara', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

