VALUES ('sonoff-minir4', 'Sonoff MINIR4 — WiFi Smart Switch, Matter Supported, 10A, White', 'smart-home', 9500, 9500, 7000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/sonoff-minir4.webp', 'The Sonoff MINIR4 is the tiny smart switch that brings Matter compatibility to any light. The compact design fits behind existing wall switches in standard 86mm and European-style boxes, converting traditional circuits into smart, app-controlled lighting. The Matter support ensures future-proof compatibility with Apple Home, Google Home, Amazon Alexa, and Samsung SmartThings, while the 10A rating handles LED, incandescent, and halogen loads. The detached relay mode maintains smart control even when the physical switch is turned off, and the eWeLink app provides scheduling, scenes, and remote access. For DIY smart home builders who want affordable, standards-compliant lighting control. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sonoff packaging, 1-year Sonoff warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 7000, '/assets/products/sonoff-minir4.webp', 8000, 4.5, 0, 'Sonoff', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

