VALUES ('sonoff-nspanel', 'Sonoff NSPanel — Smart Scene Wall Switch, 3.5" Touchscreen, White', 'smart-home', 48000, 48000, 39000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/sonoff-nspanel.webp', 'The Sonoff NSPanel is the wall switch that replaces your light switch with a smart home control panel. The 3.5-inch HMI touchscreen displays weather, time, and customizable scene buttons, while the dual-gang relay controls existing lights with physical buttons and app access. The built-in thermostat with temperature and humidity sensors controls connected HVAC devices, and the eWeLink-Remote support enables two-way communication with Sonoff devices. The modern glass panel design elevates any room''s aesthetic, and the scene management consolidates control of multiple devices into single-tap actions. For homeowners who want centralized smart home control without cluttering walls with multiple switches. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sonoff packaging, 1-year Sonoff warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 39000, '/assets/products/sonoff-nspanel.webp', 43000, 4.5, 0, 'Sonoff', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

