VALUES ('govee-led-strip-lights-m1', 'Govee LED Strip Lights M1 — Matter Compatible, RGBIC, 2M', 'smart-home', 35000, 35000, 28000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/govee-led-strip-lights-m1.webp', 'The Govee LED Strip Lights M1 is the matter-enabled light strip that syncs with your entire smart home. The Matter over WiFi support ensures seamless integration with Apple Home, Alexa, Google Home, and Samsung SmartThings without proprietary bridges. The RGBIC technology displays multiple colors simultaneously along the strip for stunning gradient effects, while the music sync mode pulses lights to your playlist. The Govee Home app offers 64+ scene modes, scheduling, and DIY color creation, and the high-density LEDs provide smooth, vibrant illumination without hotspots. For gamers and entertainment enthusiasts who want boundary-pushing lighting that plays nice with every ecosystem. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Govee packaging, 1-year Govee warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 28000, '/assets/products/govee-led-strip-lights-m1.webp', 31000, 4.5, 0, 'Govee', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

