VALUES ('govee-glide-wall-light', 'Govee Glide Wall Light — RGBIC Smart Wall Lights, 6+1 Segments, Black', 'smart-home', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/govee-glide-wall-light.webp', 'The Govee Glide Wall Light is the modular wall art that reacts to your life. The six straight segments and one corner piece assemble into custom geometric patterns, while the RGBIC technology displays multiple colors per segment for flowing gradient animations. The music sync with 11 reactive modes transforms your wall into a visual equalizer, and the 40+ dynamic scene presets create ambiance for gaming, movies, or relaxation. The Govee Home app provides granular control, scheduling, and DIY effects, and the Alexa/Google Assistant integration enables voice-activated mood changes. For content creators and gamers who want Instagram-worthy wall lighting that moves with their content. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Govee packaging, 1-year Govee warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/govee-glide-wall-light.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Govee', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

