VALUES ('lifx-a19-smart-bulb', 'LIFX A19 Smart Bulb — WiFi Color, 1100 Lumens, No Hub Required', 'smart-home', 32000, 32000, 26000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/lifx-a19-smart-bulb.webp', 'The LIFX A19 Smart Bulb is the hub-free color bulb that connects directly to your WiFi. The 1100 lumens of brightness with 16 million colors and tunable whites from 1500K to 9000K provide complete lighting control via the LIFX app. The direct WiFi connection eliminates the need for bridges or hubs, and the energy-efficient LED technology consumes just 11W while replacing 75W incandescents. The scheduling, scenes, and effects including Candle Flicker and Strobe create ambiance for any occasion, and the Alexa, Google Assistant, and Siri integration enable hands-free control. For smart home minimalists who want powerful color lighting without ecosystem lock-in. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original LIFX packaging, 2-year LIFX warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/lifx-a19-smart-bulb.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'LIFX', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

