VALUES ('yeelight-smart-led-bulb-1s', 'Yeelight Smart LED Bulb 1S — Color, 800 Lumens, HomeKit Compatible, White', 'smart-home', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/yeelight-smart-led-bulb-1s.webp', 'The Yeelight Smart LED Bulb 1S is the HomeKit-ready color bulb at a budget-friendly price. The 800 lumens with 16 million colors and 1700K-6500K white temperature range provide versatile lighting for any mood, while the HomeKit, Alexa, Google Assistant, and SmartThings compatibility ensures universal control. The WiFi connectivity requires no hub, and the Yeelight app offers scheduling, scenes, and music sync. The energy-efficient 8.5W consumption and 25,000-hour lifespan provide long-term savings, and the LAN control option enables local operation even during internet outages. For Apple Home users who want affordable, reliable color lighting without proprietary ecosystems. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Yeelight packaging, 1-year Yeelight warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/yeelight-smart-led-bulb-1s.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Yeelight', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('roborock-s8-pro-ultra-1', 'Roborock S8 Pro Ultra — Robot Vacuum & Mop, Auto-Empty Dock, White', 'smart-home', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/roborock-s8-pro-ultra-1.webp', 'The Roborock S8 Pro Ultra is the self-maintaining cleaning robot that eliminates chore lists. The dual rubber brush system with 6000Pa suction lifts dirt, hair, and debris from carpets and hard floors, while the VibraRise 2.0 mopping system scrubs floors 3000 times per minute with automatic mop lifting on carpets. The all-in-one dock auto-empties dust, washes mops with hot water, refills the water tank, and dries mops with hot air — requiring human intervention only every few weeks. The PreciSense LiDAR navigation with 3D structured light obstacle avoidance maps your home with millimeter precision, and the multi-level mapping supports up to four floors. For busy professionals who want immaculate floors without lifting a finger. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Roborock packaging, 1-year Roborock warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/roborock-s8-pro-ultra-1.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Roborock', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni-1', 'Ecovacs Deebot X2 Omni — Robot Vacuum, 8000Pa, Auto-Clean Station, Black', 'smart-home', 520000, 520000, 426000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni-1.webp', 'The Ecovacs Deebot X2 Omni is the square-shaped robot that cleans where round robots cannot. The unique square design with extended side brush reaches into corners and along edges with 99.77% coverage, while the 8000Pa hurricane suction extracts embedded dirt from deep carpet piles. The auto-clean station washes mops with 55°C hot water, dries them with hot air, and empties the dustbin automatically. The AIVI 3D 2.0 obstacle avoidance with dual-laser LiDAR identifies and navigates around shoes, cables, and pet waste, and the YIKO voice assistant enables hands-free command without apps. For homeowners with complex floor plans who demand corner-to-corner cleanliness. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ecovacs packaging, 1-year Ecovacs warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 426000, '/assets/products/ecovacs-deebot-x2-omni-1.webp', 473000, 4.5, 1, 'Ecovacs', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dreame-l20-ultra', 'Dreame L20 Ultra — Robot Vacuum & Mop, MopExtend, Auto-Empty, White', 'smart-home', 465000, 465000, 381000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/dreame-l20-ultra.webp', 'The Dreame L20 Ultra is the extendable-mop robot that cleans baseboards and edges like a human. The MopExtend technology extends the mop pad to reach wall edges and furniture legs, eliminating the gap left by traditional circular mops. The 7000Pa suction with dual rubber brushes handles pet hair without tangling, and the auto-empty station with 3.2L dust bag holds up to 75 days of debris. The AI Action obstacle recognition identifies 55 object types and adjusts cleaning patterns accordingly, while the hot water mop washing and hot air drying maintain hygiene. For perfectionists who notice the two-inch gap along walls that most robot vacuums miss. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dreame packaging, 1-year Dreame warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 381000, '/assets/products/dreame-l20-ultra.webp', 423000, 4.5, 0, 'Dreame', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('irobot-roomba-j7-1', 'iRobot Roomba j7+ — Self-Emptying Robot Vacuum, Obstacle Avoidance, Graphite', 'smart-home', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/irobot-roomba-j7-1.webp', 'The iRobot Roomba j7+ is the poop-avoiding robot that learns your home''s chaos. The PrecisionVision Navigation identifies and avoids obstacles including pet waste, cords, and socks — backed by iRobot''s Pet Owner Official Promise. The Clean Base Automatic Dirt Disposal empties the bin for up to 60 days, while the Imprint Smart Mapping learns your floor plan and lets you schedule room-specific cleaning. The dual multi-surface rubber brushes adjust to different floor types, and the Dirt Detect technology focuses on high-traffic areas. With Alexa, Google Assistant, and Siri integration, this is the worry-free vacuum for pet owners and cluttered households. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original iRobot packaging, 1-year iRobot warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/irobot-roomba-j7-1.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'iRobot', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('xiaomi-robot-vacuum-x10', 'Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+ — Auto-Clean, 4000Pa, LiDAR, White', 'smart-home', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/xiaomi-robot-vacuum-x10.webp', 'The Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+ is the auto-cleaning powerhouse that delivers premium features at a disruptive price. The 4000Pa suction with all-rubber main brush and dual side brushes captures fine dust and large debris, while the auto-clean station washes and dries mop pads automatically. The LDS LiDAR navigation with 3D obstacle recognition maps complex environments in real-time, and the S-Cross 3D obstacle avoidance prevents collisions with furniture and pets. The 5200mAh battery cleans up to 200 square meters on a single charge, and the Mi Home app provides scheduling, zone cleaning, and multi-floor mapping. For value-conscious homeowners who want hands-free cleaning without flagship pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-robot-vacuum-x10.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

