VALUES ('zojirushi-rice-cooker', 'Zojirushi Rice Cooker — Neuro Fuzzy Logic, 5.5-Cup, White', 'smart-home', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/zojirushi-rice-cooker.webp', 'The Zojirushi Neuro Fuzzy Rice Cooker is the Japanese-engineered grain perfectionist. The advanced Neuro Fuzzy logic technology adjusts temperature and cooking time based on internal sensors, producing restaurant-quality white, brown, sushi, and mixed rice with optimal texture. The spherical nonstick inner pan with heating elements on bottom, sides, and lid ensures even cooking, while the keep-warm function maintains rice at serving temperature for hours without drying. The programmable delay timer starts cooking automatically, and the detachable inner lid and steam vent facilitate thorough cleaning. For rice-loving households who understand that perfectly cooked rice is worth the investment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Zojirushi packaging, 1-year Zojirushi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/zojirushi-rice-cooker.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Zojirushi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

