VALUES ('levoit-core-400s-1', 'Levoit Core 400S — Smart Air Purifier, H13 HEPA, 83m² Coverage, White', 'smart-home', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/levoit-core-400s-1.webp', 'The Levoit Core 400S is the smart air purifier that breathes for large Nigerian living rooms. The H13 True HEPA filter captures 99.97% of airborne particles as small as 0.3 microns including dust, pollen, smoke, and pet dander, while the activated carbon filter neutralizes odors and VOCs. The AirSight Plus laser sensor detects particles as small as 0.3 microns and auto-adjusts fan speed, and the VeSync app provides air quality reports, remote control, and scheduling. The QuietKEAP technology reduces noise to 24dB on sleep mode, and the 83-square-meter coverage handles open-plan apartments and large bedrooms. For allergy sufferers and urban dwellers who want visible proof of cleaner air. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Levoit packaging, 1-year Levoit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/levoit-core-400s-1.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Levoit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

