VALUES ('sony-playstation-5-slim', 'Sony PlayStation 5 Slim — 1TB SSD, Disc Edition, White', 'gaming', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/sony-playstation-5-slim.webp', 'The Sony PlayStation 5 Slim is the evolved gaming powerhouse that delivers next-gen performance in a sleeker silhouette. The custom AMD Zen 2 CPU and RDNA 2 GPU enable ray-traced 4K gaming at 120fps, while the ultra-high-speed 1TB SSD loads worlds in seconds rather than minutes. The haptic feedback and adaptive triggers of the DualSense controller translate in-game textures and tension into your fingertips, and the 3D audio technology creates spatial soundscapes that surround you. The disc drive plays physical PS5 and PS4 games, 4K UHD Blu-rays, and standard DVDs, and the backward compatibility library includes thousands of PS4 titles. For gamers who demand the definitive console experience with physical media flexibility. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/sony-playstation-5-slim.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-playstation-5-digital-edition', 'Sony PlayStation 5 Digital Edition — 1TB SSD, White', 'gaming', 425000, 425000, 348000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/sony-playstation-5-digital-edition.webp', 'The Sony PlayStation 5 Digital Edition is the all-digital gateway to next-gen gaming. Identical in processing power to the disc version, this streamlined console focuses purely on digital downloads and streaming, eliminating the disc drive for a lighter, more compact design. The custom SSD architecture virtually eliminates loading screens, while the Tempest 3D AudioTech creates immersive soundscapes through any headphones or TV speakers. The DualSense controller''s haptic feedback and adaptive triggers redefine tactile gaming immersion, and the PlayStation Plus ecosystem provides access to hundreds of games via the Game Catalog. For digital-native gamers with fast internet who have embraced the all-download lifestyle. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 348000, '/assets/products/sony-playstation-5-digital-edition.webp', 386000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('microsoft-xbox-series-x', 'Microsoft Xbox Series X — 1TB SSD, Black', 'gaming', 465000, 465000, 381000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-series-x.webp', 'The Microsoft Xbox Series X is the world''s most powerful console, built for speed and performance. The 12 teraflops of processing power with custom AMD Zen 2 and RDNA 2 architectures deliver true 4K gaming at 60fps with up to 120fps support, while the 1TB custom NVMe SSD with Velocity Architecture loads games in seconds. The Quick Resume feature suspends multiple games simultaneously, letting you switch between titles instantly, and the backward compatibility spans four generations of Xbox games with Auto HDR and FPS Boost enhancements. The Dolby Vision and Dolby Atmos support creates cinema-quality visuals and audio, and the Xbox Game Pass ecosystem provides unlimited access to hundreds of titles. For gamers who want raw power, fastest load times, and the ultimate game subscription value. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 381000, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-series-x.webp', 423000, 4.5, 0, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('microsoft-xbox-series-s', 'Microsoft Xbox Series S — 512GB SSD, All-Digital, White', 'gaming', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-series-s.webp', 'The Microsoft Xbox Series S is the compact next-gen console that delivers flagship features at an accessible price. The custom NVMe SSD provides the same lightning-fast load times and Quick Resume capabilities as the Series X, while the targeted 1440p resolution with up to 120fps support offers stunning visuals on modern monitors and TVs. The all-digital design fits anywhere with its minimalist white tower aesthetic, and the backward compatibility with thousands of Xbox, Xbox 360, and Xbox One titles ensures your library travels forward. With Xbox Game Pass integration, ray tracing support, and whisper-quiet operation, this is the perfect entry point into next-generation gaming. For casual gamers, students, and secondary-room setups that demand modern performance without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-series-s.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nintendo-switch-oled-model', 'Nintendo Switch OLED Model — 64GB, Neon Blue/Red', 'gaming', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/nintendo-switch-oled-model.webp', 'The Nintendo Switch OLED Model is the definitive handheld hybrid with a screen that finally matches Nintendo''s visual creativity. The vibrant 7-inch OLED display with reduced bezels delivers richer colors and deeper contrast than the original LCD, while the enhanced audio with onboard speakers provides immersive handheld sound. The wide adjustable stand enables stable tabletop gaming at multiple angles, and the dock''s wired LAN port ensures stable online play in TV mode. The 64GB internal storage provides more space for digital downloads, and the three play modes — TV, tabletop, and handheld — adapt to any situation. For Nintendo fans who want the best possible screen for Hyrule, the Mushroom Kingdom, and beyond. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nintendo packaging, 1-year Nintendo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/nintendo-switch-oled-model.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Nintendo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nintendo-switch-lite', 'Nintendo Switch Lite — 32GB, Coral', 'gaming', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/nintendo-switch-lite.webp', 'The Nintendo Switch Lite is the dedicated handheld that perfects portable Nintendo gaming. The compact, lightweight design with integrated controls fits comfortably in hands and bags, while the 5.5-inch touchscreen displays Nintendo''s colorful worlds with crisp clarity. The directional pad replaces the separate buttons for precise fighting game inputs, and the longer battery life supports extended play sessions on commutes and flights. The extensive library of handheld-compatible Switch games provides hundreds of hours of entertainment, and the coral colorway adds personality to your portable setup. For commuters, travelers, and younger gamers who want pure handheld play without TV docking. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nintendo packaging, 1-year Nintendo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/nintendo-switch-lite.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Nintendo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('steam-deck-oled', 'Steam Deck OLED — 512GB, Handheld Console, Black', 'gaming', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/steam-deck-oled.webp', 'The Steam Deck OLED is the portable PC that runs your entire Steam library anywhere. The stunning 7.4-inch HDR OLED display with 90Hz refresh rate and 1000+ nits peak brightness brings PC games to life in your hands, while the custom AMD APU with Zen 2 CPU and RDNA 2 GPU handles AAA titles at playable frame rates. The 512GB NVMe SSD provides fast storage for dozens of games, and the microSD slot expands capacity infinitely. The ergonomic controls with trackpads, gyro aiming, and back buttons adapt to any genre from FPS to strategy, and SteamOS with Proton compatibility runs Windows games without Windows. For PC gamers who refuse to leave their library at home when traveling. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Valve packaging, 1-year Valve warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/steam-deck-oled.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('asus-rog-ally-x', 'ASUS ROG Ally X — Handheld Gaming PC, 1TB SSD, 24GB RAM, Black', 'gaming', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/asus-rog-ally-x.webp', 'The ASUS ROG Ally X is the Windows handheld that doubles down on performance and battery life. The AMD Ryzen Z1 Extreme processor with RDNA 3 graphics delivers desktop-class gaming in a portable form factor, while the upgraded 24GB LPDDR5X RAM and 1TB SSD ensure smooth multitasking and ample storage. The 7-inch 120Hz Full HD touchscreen with FreeSync Premium eliminates screen tearing, and the 80Wh battery provides up to 8 hours of gameplay — double the original Ally. The revised ergonomics with deeper grips and improved stick placement reduce hand fatigue, and the dual USB-C ports with Thunderbolt 4 enable docking and external GPU support. For gamers who want a true Windows PC in their pocket with no compatibility compromises. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/asus-rog-ally-x.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('lenovo-legion-go', 'Lenovo Legion Go — Handheld Gaming, 8.8" QHD, 512GB, Shadow Black', 'gaming', 325000, 325000, 266000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-legion-go.webp', 'The Lenovo Legion Go is the detachable handheld with a screen larger than the competition. The 8.8-inch QHD+ display with 144Hz refresh rate and 500 nits brightness provides expansive, fluid visuals for strategy games and shooters, while the detachable TrueStrike controllers with hall effect joysticks eliminate drift. The AMD Ryzen Z1 Extreme processor handles demanding PC titles, and the 512GB SSD with microSD expansion stores extensive libraries. The integrated kickstand enables tabletop play, and the FPS mode detaches the right controller into a vertical mouse for precision aiming. For gamers who prioritize screen real estate and versatile control schemes in their portable PC. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 266000, '/assets/products/lenovo-legion-go.webp', 295000, 4.5, 0, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-dualsense-edge', 'Sony DualSense Edge — Wireless Controller, White', 'gaming', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/sony-dualsense-edge.webp', 'The Sony DualSense Edge is the pro-level controller that puts tournament customization in your hands. The replaceable stick modules extend the controller''s lifespan, while the rear paddle buttons, adjustable trigger lengths, and customizable control profiles adapt to any game genre. The haptic feedback and adaptive triggers deliver the same immersive sensations as the standard DualSense, and the braided USB-C cable with connector housing ensures stable wired tournament play. The on-controller interface lets you swap profiles on the fly, and the included carrying case organizes the controller, stick caps, and back buttons. For competitive PlayStation gamers who demand hardware customization without third-party compromises. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/sony-dualsense-edge.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-dualsense-wireless-controller', 'Sony DualSense Wireless Controller — Midnight Black', 'gaming', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/sony-dualsense-wireless-controller.webp', 'The Sony DualSense Wireless Controller is the haptic revolution that changed how games feel. The adaptive L2 and R2 triggers dynamically adjust tension to simulate drawing a bowstring or pressing a brake pedal, while the haptic feedback replaces rumble with nuanced texture sensations — feel raindrops, sand, and engine vibrations with startling realism. The built-in microphone array enables voice chat without a headset, and the create button streams gameplay instantly. The comfortable ergonomic design accommodates all hand sizes, and the USB-C charging provides modern connectivity. For every PlayStation 5 owner who wants to experience games as the developers intended them to feel. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/sony-dualsense-wireless-controller.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

