VALUES ('microsoft-xbox-elite-wireless-controller-series-2', 'Microsoft Xbox Elite Wireless Controller Series 2 — Core, White', 'gaming', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-elite-wireless-controller-series-2.webp', 'The Xbox Elite Wireless Controller Series 2 Core is the tournament-grade gamepad that elevates competitive play. The adjustable-tension thumbsticks with three different resistance settings provide precise aim control, while the shorter hair trigger locks enable faster firing in shooters. The wrap-around rubberized grip maintains control during intense sessions, and the USB-C connectivity with Bluetooth enables wired and wireless play across Xbox and PC. The customizable button mapping via Xbox Accessories app creates game-specific profiles, and the included carrying case and charging dock keep the controller protected and powered. For competitive Xbox and PC gamers who refuse to let hardware limit their skill ceiling. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/microsoft-xbox-elite-wireless-controller-series-2.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

