VALUES ('8bitdo-ultimate-bluetooth-controller', '8BitDo Ultimate Bluetooth Controller — Hall Effect Joysticks, White', 'gaming', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/8bitdo-ultimate-bluetooth-controller.webp', 'The 8BitDo Ultimate Bluetooth Controller is the third-party champion with drift-proof sticks. The hall effect magnetic sensors in the joysticks eliminate physical contact and wear, guaranteeing zero stick drift for the controller''s lifetime. The customizable back buttons, trigger locks, and vibration intensity adapt to any game via the 8BitDo Ultimate Software on PC and mobile. The Bluetooth connectivity pairs with Switch, PC, Android, and Steam Deck, while the included 2.4GHz USB receiver provides lag-free wireless for competitive play. The charging dock with automatic wake-up ensures the controller is always ready, and the 22-hour battery life supports extended sessions. For multi-platform gamers who want premium features without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original 8BitDo packaging, 1-year 8BitDo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/8bitdo-ultimate-bluetooth-controller.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, '8BitDo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

