VALUES ('razer-wolverine-v2-chroma', 'Razer Wolverine V2 Chroma — Wired Controller for Xbox/PC, Black', 'gaming', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/razer-wolverine-v2-chroma.webp', 'The Razer Wolverine V2 Chroma is the RGB-enhanced controller built for esports precision. The six additional remappable buttons — four triggers and two bumpers — provide more inputs than standard controllers, while the Mecha-Tactile action buttons deliver hyper-responsive clicks with a 3-million tap lifecycle. The Razer Chroma RGB lighting with 16.8 million colors syncs with your setup, and the interchangeable thumbstick caps with two heights and two grip textures customize feel. The hair trigger mode with trigger stop switches enables instant firing, and the Razer Controller Setup app maps buttons and adjusts lighting. For competitive Xbox and PC players who want more buttons, faster response, and customizable aesthetics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Razer packaging, 1-year Razer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/razer-wolverine-v2-chroma.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Razer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

