VALUES ('scuf-instinct-pro', 'SCUF Instinct Pro — Xbox/PC Performance Controller, Black', 'gaming', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/scuf-instinct-pro.webp', 'The SCUF Instinct Pro is the professional-grade controller trusted by esports champions. The four rear remappable paddles replicate face button inputs without lifting your thumbs, while the adjustable instant triggers eliminate pull distance for mouse-click firing speed. The interchangeable thumbsticks with three heights and two dome shapes customize aim precision, and the high-performance grip maintains control during clutch moments. The wireless connectivity with Xbox and PC provides tournament-grade latency, and the embedded anti-friction rings ensure smooth stick movement. For competitive FPS players who want the hardware advantage that separates amateurs from professionals. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SCUF packaging, 1-year SCUF warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/scuf-instinct-pro.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'SCUF', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

