VALUES ('elgato-hd60-x', 'Elgato HD60 X — 1080p60 HDR10 Capture Card, External', 'gaming', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/elgato-hd60-x.webp', 'The Elgato HD60 X is the external capture card that records your gameplay in stunning fidelity. The 1080p60 capture with HDR10 passthrough preserves the visual quality of PS5 and Xbox Series X, while the zero-lag HDMI passthrough ensures responsive gaming while recording. The plug-and-play setup with USB 3.0 requires no driver installation, and the 4K60 HDR10 passthrough future-proofs your setup for next-gen consoles. The Flashback Recording feature saves gameplay retroactively, ensuring you never miss a highlight, and the Elgato 4KCU software provides intuitive recording and streaming management. For content creators who want console capture without opening their PC case. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Elgato packaging, 1-year Elgato warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/elgato-hd60-x.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Elgato', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('elgato-facecam', 'Elgato Facecam — 1080p60 True Full HD, Sony Sensor, Fixed Focus', 'gaming', 75000, 75000, 61000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/elgato-facecam.webp', 'The Elgato Facecam is the webcam that treats streaming like cinema. The Sony STARVIS CMOS sensor with advanced image processing delivers uncompressed 1080p60 video with accurate colors and low noise, while the fixed-focus Elgato Prime Lens maintains sharpness from 30cm to infinity without hunting. The Camera Hub software provides ISO, shutter speed, white balance, and field-of-view control rivaling DSLR software, and the aluminum unibody construction with privacy cap exudes professional quality. The optimized heat management prevents overheating during marathon streams, and the universal monitor mount fits any display. For streamers who refuse to compromise on facecam quality and want DSLR-level control in a plug-and-play package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Elgato packaging, 1-year Elgato warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 61000, '/assets/products/elgato-facecam.webp', 68000, 4.5, 0, 'Elgato', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('razer-kiyo-pro-ultra', 'Razer Kiyo Pro Ultra — 4K Webcam, Sony Starvis Sensor, HDR, Black', 'gaming', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/razer-kiyo-pro-ultra.webp', 'The Razer Kiyo Pro Ultra is the 4K webcam that makes DSLRs obsolete for streaming. The large Sony STARVIS 2 sensor with 2.9μm pixel size captures stunning low-light performance and dynamic range, while the AI-powered face tracking and autofocus keep you sharp during movement. The 4K30 or 1080p60 recording options accommodate any platform, and the HDR support preserves detail in highlights and shadows. The Razer Synapse software provides granular control over exposure, white balance, and field of view, and the built-in omnidirectional microphone captures clear audio without additional hardware. For content creators who want the highest possible webcam quality without the complexity of mirrorless cameras. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Razer packaging, 1-year Razer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/razer-kiyo-pro-ultra.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Razer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('logitech-brio-4k-webcam-1', 'Logitech Brio 4K Webcam — Ultra HD, HDR, Windows Hello, Black', 'gaming', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/logitech-brio-4k-webcam-1.webp', 'The Logitech Brio 4K Webcam is the business-class camera that elevates every video call. The 4K Ultra HD sensor with RightLight 3 and HDR technology optimizes appearance in any lighting condition, while the 5x digital zoom with autoframe keeps you centered during presentations. The Windows Hello facial recognition provides secure, password-free login, and the three field-of-view presets — 65°, 78°, and 90° — accommodate solo calls and group meetings. The dual omnidirectional microphones with noise cancellation ensure clear audio, and the USB-C connectivity with included privacy shade provides modern convenience and security. For professionals who want to look their best on Zoom, Teams, and Google Meet. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Logitech packaging, 2-year Logitech warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/logitech-brio-4k-webcam-1.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Logitech', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('blue-yeti-usb-microphone', 'Blue Yeti USB Microphone — Professional, 4 Patterns, Midnight Blue', 'gaming', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/blue-yeti-usb-microphone.webp', 'The Blue Yeti USB Microphone is the streaming standard that launched a million podcasts. The four pickup patterns — cardioid, bidirectional, omnidirectional, and stereo — adapt to solo streaming, interviews, conference calls, and ASMR recording. The plug-and-play USB connectivity requires no drivers or audio interfaces, and the headphone output with zero-latency monitoring ensures clean recordings. The gain control, mute button, and pattern selection are accessible on the mic body, and the included desktop stand provides immediate setup. For podcasters, streamers, and remote workers who want professional audio quality without XLR complexity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Blue packaging, 2-year Blue warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/blue-yeti-usb-microphone.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Blue', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('blue-yeti-nano', 'Blue Yeti Nano — Premium USB Mic, 2 Patterns, Vivid Blue', 'gaming', 38000, 38000, 31000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/blue-yeti-nano.webp', 'The Blue Yeti Nano is the compact podcast microphone that retains the Yeti''s legendary sound. The two pickup patterns — cardioid for solo recording and omnidirectional for conference calls — cover essential use cases, while the 24-bit/48kHz recording resolution captures broadcast-quality audio. The compact footprint fits cluttered desks and travel bags, and the no-latency headphone monitoring ensures clean takes. The plug-and-play USB connectivity works with Mac, PC, and mobile devices, and the included desktop stand provides immediate setup. For podcasters and streamers who want the Yeti sound signature in a smaller, more affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Blue packaging, 2-year Blue warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 31000, '/assets/products/blue-yeti-nano.webp', 34000, 4.5, 0, 'Blue', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('audio-technica-at2020usb', 'Audio-Technica AT2020USB+ — Cardioid Condenser USB Microphone, Black', 'gaming', 48000, 48000, 39000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/audio-technica-at2020usb.webp', 'The Audio-Technica AT2020USB+ is the studio condenser that democratized professional recording. The custom-engineered low-mass diaphragm provides extended frequency response and superior transient response, capturing vocals and instruments with remarkable clarity and detail. The cardioid polar pattern isolates the sound source from room noise, and the headphone jack with volume control provides direct monitoring without latency. The tripod desk stand with pivoting mount enables optimal positioning, and the USB connectivity eliminates the need for external preamps or audio interfaces. For musicians, voiceover artists, and podcasters who want studio condenser quality with plug-and-play simplicity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Audio-Technica packaging, 2-year Audio-Technica warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 39000, '/assets/products/audio-technica-at2020usb.webp', 43000, 4.5, 0, 'Audio-Technica', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('rode-nt-usb-mini', 'Rode NT-USB Mini — Studio-Quality USB Mic, Magnetic Base, Black', 'gaming', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/rode-nt-usb-mini.webp', 'The Rode NT-USB Mini is the Australian-engineered microphone that punches above its size. The high-quality condenser capsule with tight cardioid pickup pattern delivers warm, detailed vocals for podcasting, streaming, and music recording, while the built-in pop filter reduces plosives without bulky external shields. The unique magnetic desk stand provides stability and easy removal for boom arm mounting, and the studio-grade headphone amplifier ensures clear, loud monitoring. The USB-C connectivity with class-compliant operation requires no drivers, and the compact design fits any desktop setup. For content creators who want Rode''s renowned audio quality in a compact, travel-friendly package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Rode packaging, 1-year Rode warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/rode-nt-usb-mini.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Rode', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('shure-mv7', 'Shure MV7 — Hybrid XLR/USB Podcast Microphone, Black', 'gaming', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/shure-mv7.webp', 'The Shure MV7 is the hybrid microphone that bridges podcasting and professional broadcasting. Inspired by the legendary SM7B, the MV7 features both USB and XLR outputs — start with USB and upgrade to XLR as your studio grows. The Voice Isolation Technology focuses on your voice while ignoring background noise, and the Auto Level Mode automatically optimizes gain in real-time. The touch panel controls provide intuitive mute and headphone volume adjustment, and the ShurePlus MOTIV app enables deep DSP customization including EQ, compression, and limiter. For podcasters who want broadcast-grade audio with the flexibility to grow into professional setups. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Shure packaging, 2-year Shure warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/shure-mv7.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Shure', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('shure-sm7b', 'Shure SM7B — Dynamic Studio Microphone, Cardioid, Black', 'gaming', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/shure-sm7b.webp', 'The Shure SM7B is the microphone that has defined the sound of broadcasting for decades. The smooth, flat, wide-range frequency response reproduces speech and music with exceptional naturalness, while the electromagnetic shielding eliminates hum from computer monitors and other electronics. The internal air suspension shock isolation eliminates mechanical noise transmission, and the pop filter reduces explosive breath sounds without external windscreens. The cardioid polar pattern rejects off-axis noise, and the rugged construction withstands daily studio abuse. For professional podcasters, broadcasters, and musicians who want the iconic vocal sound heard on countless albums and radio shows. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Shure packaging, 2-year Shure warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/shure-sm7b.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Shure', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('elgato-wave3', 'Elgato Wave:3 — Premium USB Condenser Mic, Clipguard, Black', 'gaming', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/elgato-wave3.webp', 'The Elgato Wave:3 is the streaming microphone with anti-distortion technology built in. The proprietary Clipguard anti-distortion technology automatically routes audio through a secondary signal path when levels peak, preventing distortion without compressing dynamics. The cardioid condenser capsule captures broadcast-quality vocals, and the capacitive mute button provides instant silence with visual feedback. The Wave Link software mixes multiple audio sources — mic, game, music, chat — into a single stream, and the 24-bit/96kHz analog-to-digital converter ensures pristine recording quality. For streamers who want professional audio mixing and anti-clipping protection in one elegant package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Elgato packaging, 1-year Elgato warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/elgato-wave3.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Elgato', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hyperx-quadcast-s', 'HyperX QuadCast S — USB Condenser Mic, RGB, Shock Mount, Black', 'gaming', 48000, 48000, 39000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/hyperx-quadcast-s.webp', 'The HyperX QuadCast S is the RGB microphone that sounds as good as it looks. The radiant RGB lighting with dynamic effects adds visual flair to any streaming setup, while the anti-vibration shock mount isolates the condenser capsule from desk bumps and keyboard clicks. The four selectable polar patterns — stereo, omnidirectional, cardioid, and bidirectional — adapt to any recording scenario, and the built-in pop filter reduces plosives without external accessories. The tap-to-mute sensor with LED status indicator prevents accidental broadcasting, and the 3.5mm headphone jack provides zero-latency monitoring. For RGB enthusiasts who want their microphone to be both a visual centerpiece and a recording tool. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HyperX packaging, 2-year HyperX warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 39000, '/assets/products/hyperx-quadcast-s.webp', 43000, 4.5, 0, 'HyperX', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

