VALUES ('samsung-odyssey-g9-1', 'Samsung Odyssey G9 — 49" DQHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor, Black', 'gaming', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/samsung-odyssey-g9-1.webp', 'The Samsung Odyssey G9 is the super-ultrawide monitor that surrounds you with gameplay. The 49-inch 1000R curved DQHD panel with 5120x1440 resolution and 240Hz refresh rate creates an immersive wraparound view that replaces multi-monitor setups. The 1ms response time with G-Sync and FreeSync Premium Pro eliminates tearing and ghosting, while the QLED technology with HDR1000 delivers vibrant, high-contrast visuals. The Infinity Core Lighting with 52 colors and 5 lighting effects adds customizable ambiance, and the ergonomic stand with swivel, tilt, and height adjustment ensures comfortable positioning. For sim racers, traders, and gamers who want the most immersive, expansive display experience possible. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/samsung-odyssey-g9-1.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

