VALUES ('samsung-odyssey-g7', 'Samsung Odyssey G7 — 32" QHD 240Hz Curved Gaming Monitor, Black', 'gaming', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/samsung-odyssey-g7.webp', 'The Samsung Odyssey G7 is the 1000R curved monitor that matches the human eye''s natural curvature. The 32-inch QHD VA panel with 240Hz refresh rate and 1ms response time delivers competitive gaming performance, while the QLED with HDR600 provides vibrant colors and deep blacks. The Infinity Core Lighting with customizable colors syncs with your setup, and the G-Sync and FreeSync Premium Pro compatibility eliminates screen tearing across NVIDIA and AMD GPUs. The ergonomic stand with height, tilt, and swivel adjustments ensures comfortable positioning, and the 1000R curve draws you into the game without distortion. For gamers who want immersive curvature without the extreme width of super-ultrawide displays. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/samsung-odyssey-g7.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('alienware-aw3423dwf', 'Alienware AW3423DWF — 34" QD-OLED 165Hz Curved, FreeSync Premium Pro', 'gaming', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/alienware-aw3423dwf.webp', 'The Alienware AW3423DWF is the QD-OLED ultrawide that delivers perfect blacks and infinite contrast. The 34-inch curved QD-OLED panel with 3440x1440 resolution and 165Hz refresh rate combines OLED''s pixel-perfect lighting with quantum dot color volume for stunning HDR visuals. The 0.1ms response time eliminates motion blur in fast-paced games, and the FreeSync Premium Pro with VRR ensures tear-free gaming on PC and consoles. The AlienFX customizable lighting with four zones adds atmospheric flair, and the 1800R curve with 21:9 aspect ratio provides cinematic immersion. For gamers who want the contrast and response time of OLED in an immersive ultrawide format. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Alienware packaging, 1-year Alienware warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/alienware-aw3423dwf.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('lg-27gr95qe-b', 'LG 27GR95QE-B — 27" OLED 240Hz Gaming Monitor, 0.03ms, Black', 'gaming', 425000, 425000, 348000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/lg-27gr95qe-b.webp', 'The LG 27GR95QE-B is the 27-inch OLED gaming monitor that brings TV technology to your desk. The 240Hz refresh rate with 0.03ms response time delivers the fastest, clearest motion in gaming, while the OLED panel with infinite contrast and true blacks creates stunning HDR visuals. The 98.5% DCI-P3 color gamut with factory calibration ensures color accuracy for content creation, and the anti-glare low-reflection coating maintains visibility in bright rooms. The HDMI 2.1 supports 4K120 on consoles, and the DisplayPort 1.4 with DSC enables full 1440p240 on PC. For competitive gamers who want OLED response times and contrast in a desktop-friendly 27-inch size. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original LG packaging, 1-year LG warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 348000, '/assets/products/lg-27gr95qe-b.webp', 386000, 4.5, 0, 'LG', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('asus-rog-swift-pg27aqdm', 'ASUS ROG Swift PG27AQDM — 27" OLED 240Hz, 0.03ms, G-Sync, Black', 'gaming', 465000, 465000, 381000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/asus-rog-swift-pg27aqdm.webp', 'The ASUS ROG Swift PG27AQDM is the ROG OLED monitor engineered for esports dominance. The 26.5-inch OLED panel with 240Hz refresh rate and 0.03ms response time delivers unmatched motion clarity, while the custom heatsink and intelligent voltage optimization extend OLED lifespan and reduce burn-in risk. The 99% DCI-P3 with Delta E < 2 ensures professional color accuracy, and the uniform brightness setting maintains consistent luminance across the screen. The G-Sync compatibility and HDMI 2.1 provide tear-free gaming on PC and consoles, and the ROG Gaming AI technology includes dynamic crosshair and shadow boost. For competitive gamers who want the fastest, most responsive gaming monitor with ROG engineering reliability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 381000, '/assets/products/asus-rog-swift-pg27aqdm.webp', 423000, 4.5, 0, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('acer-predator-x32-fp', 'Acer Predator X32 FP — 32" 4K 160Hz Mini LED, 576 Zones, Black', 'gaming', 585000, 585000, 479000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/acer-predator-x32-fp.webp', 'The Acer Predator X32 FP is the Mini LED monitor that rivals OLED brightness without burn-in concerns. The 32-inch 4K panel with 576 local dimming zones and 1200 nits peak brightness delivers stunning HDR with precise contrast control, while the 160Hz refresh rate with 1ms response time ensures competitive gaming performance. The HDMI 2.1 with VRR supports 4K120 on PS5 and Xbox Series X, and the USB-C with 90W PD charges laptops while transmitting video. The Delta E < 1 factory calibration ensures color accuracy for creators, and the Predator GameView provides crosshairs, FPS counters, and black boost. For gamers and creators who want OLED-level HDR brightness with the longevity of Mini LED technology. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Acer packaging, 1-year Acer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 479000, '/assets/products/acer-predator-x32-fp.webp', 532000, 4.5, 1, 'Acer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('benq-mobiuz-ex3210u', 'BenQ MOBIUZ EX3210U — 32" 4K 144Hz HDR600, 2.1ch Speakers, White', 'gaming', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/benq-mobiuz-ex3210u.webp', 'The BenQ MOBIUZ EX3210U is the 4K gaming monitor with built-in audio that eliminates desk clutter. The 32-inch 4K IPS panel with 144Hz refresh rate and 1ms MPRT delivers crisp, responsive gaming, while the HDR600 with 98% DCI-P3 provides vibrant, accurate colors. The unique 2.1ch treVolo audio system with a 5W subwoofer delivers surprisingly full sound without external speakers, and the AI noise-cancelling microphone enables clear voice chat directly through the monitor. The HDRi technology with light sensors auto-optimizes image quality, and the remote control provides convenient adjustment from your couch. For console and PC gamers who want 4K performance with integrated audio in a clean setup. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original BenQ packaging, 1-year BenQ warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/benq-mobiuz-ex3210u.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'BenQ', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('msi-mag274qrf-qd', 'MSI MAG274QRF-QD — 27" QHD 170Hz Rapid IPS, Quantum Dot, Black', 'gaming', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/msi-mag274qrf-qd.webp', 'The MSI MAG274QRF-QD is the quantum dot gaming monitor that maximizes value. The 27-inch QHD Rapid IPS panel with 170Hz refresh rate and 1ms GtG response time delivers competitive gaming performance, while the quantum dot technology enhances color gamut to 97% DCI-P3 and 147% sRGB. The HDR400 support provides improved contrast in supported games, and the G-Sync Compatible certification ensures tear-free gaming on NVIDIA GPUs. The adjustable stand with height, tilt, swivel, and pivot accommodates any desk setup, and the MSI Gaming OSD app provides software-based control without reaching for buttons. For budget-conscious gamers who want high refresh rates, quantum dot color, and IPS speed without flagship pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original MSI packaging, 1-year MSI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/msi-mag274qrf-qd.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'MSI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('viewsonic-elite-xg270qg', 'ViewSonic Elite XG270QG — 27" QHD 165Hz Nano IPS, G-Sync, Black', 'gaming', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/viewsonic-elite-xg270qg.webp', 'The ViewSonic Elite XG270QG is the Nano IPS monitor with true 1ms response time and G-Sync. The 27-inch QHD Nano IPS panel with 165Hz refresh rate and 1ms GtG delivers both stunning color and competitive speed, while the NVIDIA G-Sync module provides the most tear-free experience available. The 98% DCI-P3 color gamut with 10-bit color depth ensures vibrant, accurate visuals for gaming and content creation, and the Elite Display Controller provides quick access to settings and RGB lighting. The fully adjustable stand with mouse bungee and headphone hook reduces desk clutter, and the IPS panel maintains color accuracy at any viewing angle. For gamers who want the color quality of IPS with the response time previously reserved for TN panels. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ViewSonic packaging, 1-year ViewSonic warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/viewsonic-elite-xg270qg.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-inzone-m9', 'Sony INZONE M9 — 27" 4K 144Hz IPS, Full Array Local Dimming, White', 'gaming', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/sony-inzone-m9.webp', 'The Sony INZONE M9 is the PlayStation-optimized 4K monitor that brings Sony''s TV expertise to gaming desks. The 27-inch 4K IPS panel with 144Hz refresh rate and Full Array Local Dimming with 96 zones delivers precise HDR with deep blacks and bright highlights. The Auto KVM Switch enables control of two PCs with one keyboard and mouse, and the HDR tone mapping optimized for PS5 ensures accurate colors on console. The adjustable stand with cable management and tripod socket for webcams streamlines streaming setups, and the INZONE Hub software centralizes settings. For PlayStation and PC gamers who want Sony''s display engineering in a desktop monitor. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/sony-inzone-m9.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('gigabyte-m32u', 'Gigabyte M32U — 32" 4K 144Hz IPS, KVM, USB-C 18W, Black', 'gaming', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 3.5, '/assets/products/gigabyte-m32u.webp', 'The Gigabyte M32U is the 32-inch 4K gaming monitor with built-in KVM for multi-device productivity. The 31.5-inch 4K SS IPS panel with 144Hz refresh rate and 1ms response time delivers crisp, responsive gaming, while the KVM feature controls two devices with one keyboard and mouse set. The USB-C with 18W PD charges laptops and mobile devices, and the HDMI 2.1 supports 4K120 on PS5 and Xbox Series X. The 90% DCI-P3 with 10-bit color and VESA DisplayHDR400 provides vibrant HDR visuals, and the OSD Sidekick software enables monitor control via keyboard and mouse. For professionals who game and need seamless switching between work laptop and gaming PC. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Gigabyte packaging, 1-year Gigabyte warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/gigabyte-m32u.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-mini-4-pro-1', 'DJI Mini 4 Pro — 4K/60fps, 34min Flight, Under 249g, Gray', 'drones', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-mini-4-pro-1.webp', 'The DJI Mini 4 Pro is the sub-250g drone that delivers flagship features without registration hassle. The 1/1.3-inch CMOS sensor with dual native ISO captures stunning 4K/60fps HDR video and 48MP photos, while the omnidirectional obstacle sensing provides comprehensive protection in complex environments. The 34-minute flight time with Intelligent Flight Battery extends aerial sessions, and the O4 video transmission delivers 1080p/60fps live feed up to 20km. The ActiveTrack 360° follows subjects with automatic obstacle avoidance, and the Waypoint mode enables cinematic automated flight paths. For content creators and travelers who want professional aerial footage in a pocketable, regulation-friendly package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/dji-mini-4-pro-1.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-air-3', 'DJI Air 3 — Dual-Camera Drone, 4K/100fps, 46min Flight, Gray', 'drones', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-air-3.webp', 'The DJI Air 3 is the dual-camera aerial platform that captures perspectives other drones cannot. The 1/1.3-inch CMOS wide-angle and 3x medium telephoto cameras both record 4K/100fps slow-motion video, enabling dynamic focal length transitions in a single flight. The 46-minute maximum flight time with dual batteries covers expansive locations, and the O4 transmission provides stable 1080p/60fps video up to 20km. The omnidirectional obstacle sensing with APAS 5.0 navigates complex environments automatically, and the Night Mode optimizes low-light performance for stunning twilight cinematography. For professional videographers and real estate photographers who need versatile focal lengths and extended flight endurance. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/dji-air-3.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-mavic-3-pro-1', 'DJI Mavic 3 Pro — Triple-Camera Hasselblad, 5.1K, Cine Version, Gray', 'drones', 1250000, 1250000, 1024000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-mavic-3-pro-1.webp', 'The DJI Mavic 3 Pro is the triple-camera cinema drone that redefines aerial cinematography. The Hasselblad 4/3 CMOS main camera with 24mm equivalent lens captures 5.1K/50fps video and 20MP photos with natural color solutions, while the 70mm and 166mm telephoto cameras provide 3x and 7x optical zoom for compressed perspectives. The 43-minute flight time, 15km O3+ transmission, and omnidirectional obstacle sensing enable confident long-range missions. The Apple ProRes 422 HQ encoding with 1TB internal SSD stores cinema-grade footage, and the advanced return-to-home with AI route planning ensures safe retrieval. For professional cinematographers and commercial drone operators who demand the absolute best in aerial imaging. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1024000, '/assets/products/dji-mavic-3-pro-1.webp', 1137000, 4.5, 1, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-avata-2-1', 'DJI Avata 2 — FPV Drone, 4K/60fps, Motion Controller 3, Gray', 'drones', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-avata-2-1.webp', 'The DJI Avata 2 is the immersive FPV drone that makes first-person flight accessible. The 1/1.3-inch sensor captures 4K/60fps video with 155-degree super-wide FOV, while the integrated propeller guards enable confident close-quarters flying and indoor exploration. The Motion Controller 3 translates natural hand movements into flight commands, and the Goggles 3 with Micro-OLED displays deliver stunning first-person views with real-time head tracking. The 23-minute flight time and O4 transmission provide extended range, and the Easy ACRO mode enables cinematic flips and rolls with single-button input. For adrenaline seekers and content creators who want immersive flight experiences without months of FPV training. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/dji-avata-2-1.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-neo-1', 'DJI Neo — 4K Vlog Drone, 135g, Palm Takeoff, Gray', 'drones', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-neo-1.webp', 'The DJI Neo is the palm-sized vlogging drone that launches from your hand. Weighing just 135g, this ultra-light drone takes off and lands on your palm without a controller, while the 1/2-inch sensor captures 4K/30fps stabilized video perfect for social media. The AI subject tracking follows you automatically during hikes, cycling, and running, and the six intelligent shooting modes including Dronie, Circle, and Rocket create cinematic clips with one tap. The 18-minute flight time and 10km video transmission provide ample range for personal vlogging, and the voice control enables hands-free operation. For solo travelers and content creators who want automatic aerial selfies without piloting skills. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/dji-neo-1.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

