VALUES ('dji-mini-3', 'DJI Mini 3 — 4K HDR, 38min Flight, Under 249g, Gray', 'drones', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-mini-3.webp', 'The DJI Mini 3 is the entry-level drone that refuses to feel entry-level. The 1/1.3-inch sensor with dual native ISO captures 4K HDR video and 12MP photos with impressive dynamic range, while the 38-minute flight time exceeds many flagship drones. The vertical shooting mode captures portrait-oriented content optimized for Instagram and TikTok, and the wind resistance up to 38kph maintains stability in breezy conditions. The GPS + GLONASS positioning ensures accurate hovering and return-to-home, and the DJI Fly app provides intuitive control and editing tools. For first-time drone buyers who want professional-quality footage without the complexity of larger aircraft. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/dji-mini-3.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

