VALUES ('autel-robotics-evo-nano', 'Autel Robotics EVO Nano+ — 4K HDR, 50MP, Under 249g, Orange', 'drones', 325000, 325000, 266000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/autel-robotics-evo-nano.webp', 'The Autel Robotics EVO Nano+ is the DJI alternative with a larger sensor in a sub-250g body. The 1/1.28-inch CMOS sensor with RYYB color filter array captures 50MP photos and 4K/30fps HDR video with exceptional low-light performance. The three-way obstacle avoidance provides front, rear, and bottom protection, and the 28-minute flight time with 10km transmission range covers substantial distances. The Dynamic Track 2.1 follows subjects with precision, and the SkyPortrait mode automatically blurs backgrounds for professional-looking aerial portraits. For drone enthusiasts who want a premium sub-250g option with a different feature set from the market leader. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Autel packaging, 1-year Autel warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 266000, '/assets/products/autel-robotics-evo-nano.webp', 295000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

