VALUES ('autel-robotics-evo-lite', 'Autel Robotics EVO Lite+ — 1" CMOS, 6K Video, 40min Flight, Gray', 'drones', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/autel-robotics-evo-lite.webp', 'The Autel Robotics EVO Lite+ is the 1-inch sensor drone that challenges DJI''s Air series. The large 1-inch CMOS sensor captures 6K/30fps video and 20MP photos with exceptional dynamic range and low-light capability, while the adjustable aperture from f/2.8 to f/11 provides creative exposure control. The 40-minute flight time with 12km transmission range enables extended professional missions, and the three-way obstacle avoidance with binocular vision sensors navigates complex terrain. The Sky app provides intelligent flight modes including cinematic orbit, waypoint navigation, and subject tracking. For aerial photographers who prioritize sensor size and aperture control in a foldable, travel-friendly drone. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Autel packaging, 1-year Autel warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/autel-robotics-evo-lite.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

