VALUES ('holy-stone-hs720e', 'Holy Stone HS720E — 4K EIS GPS Drone, Brushless Motors, Black', 'drones', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/holy-stone-hs720e.webp', 'The Holy Stone HS720E is the budget GPS drone that delivers stability and video quality for beginners. The 4K camera with electronic image stabilization captures smooth aerial footage, while the brushless motors provide efficient, quiet flight with level-5 wind resistance. The GPS-assisted flight with auto return-to-home, follow-me, and waypoint modes provides confidence for new pilots, and the 46-minute total flight time with two batteries extends practice sessions. The foldable design with carrying case enables travel, and the intuitive remote with smartphone holder provides FPV viewing. For aspiring drone pilots who want GPS stability and 4K video without investing in premium brands. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Holy Stone packaging, 1-year Holy Stone warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/holy-stone-hs720e.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

