VALUES ('potensic-atom-se', 'Potensic Atom SE — 4K GPS Drone, Under 249g, 62min Flight, Gray', 'drones', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/potensic-atom-se.webp', 'The Potensic Atom SE is the ultra-budget sub-250g drone with marathon battery life. The 4K camera with Sony sensor captures surprisingly detailed footage for the price, while the 62-minute total flight time with two batteries outlasts drones costing five times as much. The GPS with GLONASS positioning enables precise hovering, return-to-home, and follow-me modes, and the level-5 wind resistance maintains stability in breezy conditions. The foldable design weighs under 249g, avoiding registration requirements in most regions, and the PotensicPro app provides one-tap cinematic shots. For budget-conscious beginners who want maximum flight time and GPS features at an unbeatable price. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Potensic packaging, 1-year Potensic warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/potensic-atom-se.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

