VALUES ('dji-rc-2', 'DJI RC 2 — Smart Controller, 5.5" FHD, O4 Transmission, Gray', 'drones', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/dji-rc-2.webp', 'The DJI RC 2 is the standalone smart controller that eliminates phone dependency. The built-in 5.5-inch FHD display with 700 nits brightness remains visible in direct sunlight, while the O4 transmission technology provides stable, low-latency video feed up to 20km. The dual-spring control sticks deliver precise, smooth inputs, and the ergonomic design with customizable buttons reduces fatigue during long flights. The pre-installed DJI Fly app requires no phone connection, and the 4-hour battery life covers multiple flight sessions. For drone pilots who are tired of draining their phone battery and dealing with overheating during flights. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/dji-rc-2.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

