VALUES ('google-nest-wifi-pro', 'Google Nest Wifi Pro — WiFi 6E Mesh Router, 3-Pack, Snow', 'drones', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/google-nest-wifi-pro.webp', 'The Google Nest Wifi Pro is the WiFi 6E mesh system that thinks as beautifully as it looks. The three-pack covers up to 650 square meters with tri-band WiFi 6E including the new 6GHz band for congestion-free performance, while the built-in Thread border router supports Matter smart home devices. The Google Home app provides intuitive setup, device prioritization, and parental controls, and the automatic security updates protect against emerging threats. The minimalist design blends into any room decor, and the Ethernet ports on each router enable wired backhaul for maximum performance. For Google ecosystem users who want beautiful, simple, secure whole-home WiFi with smart home integration. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Google packaging, 1-year Google warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/google-nest-wifi-pro.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Google', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

