VALUES ('asus-zenwifi-ax-mini', 'ASUS ZenWiFi AX Mini (XD4) — AX1800 Mesh WiFi 6, 3-Pack, White', 'drones', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/asus-zenwifi-ax-mini.webp', 'The ASUS ZenWiFi AX Mini is the compact mesh system that disappears into your decor while delivering whole-home coverage. The three-unit AX1800 system covers up to 480 square meters with seamless roaming and AiMesh compatibility, while the small 9cm cube design fits on shelves and countertops without visual clutter. The AiProtection Classic powered by Trend Micro provides commercial-grade security, and the parental controls manage internet access and content filtering. The easy setup via ASUS Router app takes minutes, and the wired backhaul option maximizes performance between nodes. For apartment dwellers and small homes who want discreet, reliable mesh WiFi without bulky hardware. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 3-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/asus-zenwifi-ax-mini.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

