VALUES ('d-link-dir-x5460', 'D-Link DIR-X5460 — AX5400 WiFi 6 Router, Black', 'drones', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/d-link-dir-x5460.webp', 'The D-Link DIR-X5460 is the WiFi 6 router that maximizes value for multi-device homes. The AX5400 speeds with 160MHz channels and OFDMA efficiently handle 4K streaming, gaming, and video calls simultaneously across dozens of devices. The six external antennas with Beamforming extend coverage throughout multi-room homes, and the four gigabit LAN ports provide high-speed wired connections. The D-Link WiFi app enables parental controls, guest networks, and QoS management, and the WPA3 encryption protects against modern security threats. The USB 3.0 port shares storage and printers across the network. For budget-conscious families upgrading to WiFi 6 without overspending on features they will not use. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original D-Link packaging, 1-year D-Link warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/d-link-dir-x5460.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

