VALUES ('mercusys-mr90x', 'Mercusys MR90X — AX6000 WiFi 6 Router, Black', 'drones', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/mercusys-mr90x.webp', 'The Mercusys MR90X is the budget WiFi 6 router that delivers flagship speeds at a fraction of the cost. The AX6000 dual-band speeds with 160MHz bandwidth support 8K streaming and competitive gaming, while the 8 high-gain antennas with Beamforming concentrate signal for maximum range. The 2.5G WAN port prepares your network for next-gen internet speeds, and the four gigabit LAN ports handle wired devices. The MERCUSYS app provides intuitive setup, parental controls, and guest network management, and the OFDMA and MU-MIMO ensure efficient multi-device performance. For value hunters who want WiFi 6 performance and 2.5G future-proofing without premium branding. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Mercusys packaging, 3-year Mercusys warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/mercusys-mr90x.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

