VALUES ('ubiquiti-unifi-cloud-key-gen2-plus', 'Ubiquiti UniFi Cloud Key Gen2 Plus — NVR Controller, 1TB HDD, Black', 'drones', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/ubiquiti-unifi-cloud-key-gen2-plus.webp', 'The Ubiquiti UniFi Cloud Key Gen2 Plus is the hybrid cloud device that manages and protects your network and cameras. The built-in 1TB hard drive stores up to 20 days of 1080p camera footage from UniFi Protect cameras, while the UniFi Network application manages routers, switches, and access points. The hybrid cloud technology enables remote access without exposing your network to the public internet, and the battery backup ensures graceful shutdown during power outages. The sleek design with front LCD display shows system status, and the plug-and-play setup requires no technical expertise. For UniFi ecosystem users who want local video storage and network management in one compact device. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ubiquiti packaging, 1-year Ubiquiti warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/ubiquiti-unifi-cloud-key-gen2-plus.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Ubiquiti', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

