VALUES ('ubiquiti-unifi-switch-lite-8-poe', 'Ubiquiti UniFi Switch Lite 8 PoE — 8-Port Gigabit with 4 PoE+, White', 'drones', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/ubiquiti-unifi-switch-lite-8-poe.webp', 'The Ubiquiti UniFi Switch Lite 8 PoE is the managed PoE switch that powers your UniFi ecosystem. The four PoE+ ports deliver up to 30W per port for access points, cameras, and phones, while the four additional gigabit ports handle non-PoE devices. The UniFi Network application provides centralized management, VLAN configuration, and traffic analysis, and the compact design with wall-mount option fits anywhere. The silent, fanless operation suits office and home environments, and the 52W total PoE budget supports multiple powered devices. For UniFi users who want to power access points and cameras through a single, manageable switch. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Ubiquiti packaging, 1-year Ubiquiti warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/ubiquiti-unifi-switch-lite-8-poe.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Ubiquiti', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

