VALUES ('starlink-standard-actuated-kit', 'Starlink Standard Actuated Kit — Satellite Internet, Roam Capable, White', 'drones', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/starlink-standard-actuated-kit.webp', 'The Starlink Standard Actuated Kit is the satellite internet system that connects remote Nigerian locations. The motorized dish automatically aligns with low-Earth orbit satellites, providing high-speed, low-latency internet in areas without fiber or reliable 4G coverage. The included WiFi 6 router broadcasts connectivity throughout your property, and the weather-resistant dish operates in rain, dust, and heat. The easy self-installation requires only a clear view of the sky, and the Starlink app provides real-time diagnostics and obstruction identification. For rural homes, remote offices, and off-grid locations that have been underserved by traditional internet infrastructure. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Starlink packaging, 1-year Starlink warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/starlink-standard-actuated-kit.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

