VALUES ('starlink-mini', 'Starlink Mini — Portable Satellite Internet, DC Power, White', 'drones', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.8, '/assets/products/starlink-mini.webp', 'The Starlink Mini is the travel-sized satellite internet that fits in a backpack. The integrated dish and router design weighs just 1.1kg and consumes 20-40W, enabling portable high-speed internet from RVs, boats, and remote work sites. The IP67-rated weather resistance handles outdoor conditions, and the DC power input enables direct battery and solar panel connection for off-grid use. The Starlink app provides easy setup and network management, and the Roam service enables connectivity across multiple countries. For digital nomads, overlanders, and remote workers who need reliable internet beyond cellular coverage areas. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Starlink packaging, 1-year Starlink warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/starlink-mini.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

