VALUES ('apple-ipad-pro-129', 'Apple iPad Pro 12.9" (M4) — 256GB, WiFi, Space Black', 'tablets', 985000, 985000, 807000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-129.webp', 'The Apple iPad Pro 12.9-inch M4 is the tablet that outperforms most laptops. The M4 chip with second-generation 3-nanometer technology delivers desktop-class CPU and GPU performance, while the Ultra Retina XDR display with tandem OLED provides stunning brightness and precision. The 12.9-inch Liquid Retina XDR with ProMotion and True Tone adapts to any lighting, and the Thunderbolt / USB 4 port connects to 6K external displays and high-speed storage. The all-day battery life supports creative workflows on location, and the iPadOS multitasking with Stage Manager enables true multi-window productivity. For creative professionals, architects, and power users who want the most powerful tablet ever created. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 807000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-129.webp', 896000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

