VALUES ('apple-ipad-pro-11', 'Apple iPad Pro 11" (M4) — 256GB, WiFi, Silver', 'tablets', 785000, 785000, 643000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-11.webp', 'The Apple iPad Pro 11-inch M4 packs flagship performance into a more portable form factor. The M4 chip with 10-core GPU handles 4K video editing, 3D rendering, and console-quality gaming, while the Ultra Retina Tandem OLED display delivers 1000 nits full-screen brightness and 1600 nits peak HDR. The 11-inch size fits comfortably in bags and on airplane trays, and the Thunderbolt connectivity supports pro accessories and external monitors. The all-day battery life and 5G option enable work from anywhere, and the Apple Pencil Pro with haptic feedback and squeeze gestures transforms the tablet into a digital canvas. For mobile professionals who want maximum power in a travel-friendly size. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 643000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-pro-11.webp', 714000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('apple-ipad-air', 'Apple iPad Air (M2) — 128GB, WiFi, Blue', 'tablets', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-air.webp', 'The Apple iPad Air M2 is the creative tablet that balances performance and portability. The M2 chip with 8-core CPU and 9-core GPU delivers 50% faster performance than the previous generation, while the 11-inch Liquid Retina display with P3 wide color and True Tone provides a vibrant canvas for creation and entertainment. The landscape 12MP ultra-wide front camera with Center Stage keeps you framed during video calls, and the Apple Pencil Pro and Magic Keyboard support transform it into a laptop replacement. The all-day battery life and lightweight design enable all-day portability, and the iPadOS ecosystem provides access to millions of optimized apps. For students, creators, and professionals who want near-Pro performance at a more accessible price. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-air.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('apple-ipad', 'Apple iPad (10th Gen) — 256GB, WiFi, Pink', 'tablets', 325000, 325000, 266000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad.webp', 'The Apple iPad 10th Gen is the colorful gateway to the iPad ecosystem. The A14 Bionic chip handles everyday tasks, gaming, and creative apps with ease, while the 10.9-inch Liquid Retina display with sRGB color provides a spacious, vibrant canvas. The all-screen design with Touch ID in the power button modernizes the classic iPad formula, and the landscape ultra-wide front camera with Center Stage improves video call framing. The USB-C connectivity enables universal accessory compatibility, and the first-generation Apple Pencil support enables note-taking and sketching. For students, families, and first-time tablet buyers who want the essential iPad experience in fun colors. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 266000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad.webp', 295000, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('apple-ipad-mini', 'Apple iPad mini (A17 Pro) — 128GB, WiFi, Starlight', 'tablets', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-mini.webp', 'The Apple iPad mini A17 Pro is the pocket rocket that fits powerhouse performance in one hand. The A17 Pro chip with 6-core GPU handles demanding games and apps, while the 8.3-inch Liquid Retina display with True Tone and P3 wide color provides an immersive, portable canvas. The compact design fits in jacket pockets and small bags, making it the ultimate travel companion for reading, gaming, and note-taking. The Apple Pencil Pro support enables precision input, and the USB-C port connects to cameras and accessories. The all-day battery life and cellular option ensure connectivity anywhere, and the iPadOS multitasking adapts to the smaller screen. For readers, gamers, and mobile professionals who want iPad Pro performance in an ultra-portable size. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/apple-ipad-mini.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-ultra-1', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra — 14.6" AMOLED, 256GB, WiFi, Graphite', 'tablets', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-ultra-1.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra is the Android tablet with a screen larger than most laptops. The massive 14.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with 120Hz refresh rate and HDR10+ provides an expansive canvas for multitasking, drawing, and media consumption. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 processor handles demanding apps and DeX desktop mode, while the included S Pen with 2.8ms latency provides natural writing and drawing. The quad speakers tuned by AKG with Dolby Atmos create immersive audio, and the 11,200mAh battery supports all-day use. The IP68 water and dust resistance adds durability, and the Book Cover Keyboard transforms it into a laptop replacement. For Android users who want the largest, most powerful tablet for productivity and entertainment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-ultra-1.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-tab-s9', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab S9+ — 12.4" AMOLED, 256GB, WiFi, Beige', 'tablets', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab S9+ is the balanced flagship tablet that excels at everything. The 12.4-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X with 120Hz and HDR10+ delivers vibrant, smooth visuals for creative work and streaming, while the Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 provides flagship Android performance. The included S Pen with Air Actions enables gesture control and precise input, and the Samsung DeX mode transforms the tablet into a desktop experience with resizable windows and keyboard shortcuts. The quad AKG speakers with Dolby Atmos provide room-filling sound, and the 10,090mAh battery with 45W fast charging minimizes downtime. For professionals and students who want a versatile Android tablet that replaces a laptop for most tasks. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-fe-1', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 FE — 10.9" LCD, 128GB, WiFi, Gray', 'tablets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-fe-1.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 FE is the value flagship that brings premium features to a broader audience. The 10.9-inch LCD display with 90Hz refresh rate provides smooth scrolling and responsive touch, while the Exynos 1380 processor handles everyday tasks and light gaming with ease. The included S Pen enables note-taking and drawing without additional purchase, and the IP68 rating provides durability that budget tablets lack. The Samsung DeX mode enables desktop-style multitasking, and the 8,000mAh battery supports extended use. For students and casual users who want S Pen functionality, water resistance, and Samsung''s ecosystem at a mid-range price. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s9-fe-1.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-2', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A9+ — 11" LCD, 64GB, WiFi, Graphite', 'tablets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-2.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab A9+ is the accessible tablet that covers entertainment essentials. The 11-inch LCD display with 90Hz refresh rate provides smooth video playback and browsing, while the quad speakers with Dolby Atmos create immersive sound for movies and music. The Snapdragon 695 processor handles streaming, social media, and casual gaming, and the slim metal design feels premium for the price. The Samsung Kids mode provides safe, educational content for children, and the multi-window support enables basic multitasking. For families who want an affordable tablet for streaming, browsing, and light productivity without flagship complexity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-2.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

