VALUES ('lenovo-tab-p12-pro', 'Lenovo Tab P12 Pro — 12.7" OLED, 256GB, Snapdragon 870, Storm Gray', 'tablets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-p12-pro.webp', 'The Lenovo Tab P12 Pro is the OLED Android tablet that rivals Samsung at a lower price. The 12.7-inch AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh rate and HDR10+ delivers stunning contrast and color for media consumption and creative work, while the Snapdragon 870 processor provides smooth performance for multitasking and gaming. The quad JBL speakers with Dolby Atmos fill rooms with immersive audio, and the precision pen support enables note-taking and sketching. The Lenovo Productivity Mode enables desktop-style window management, and the 10,200mAh battery supports all-day use. For Android users who want a large OLED tablet for media and productivity without Samsung pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 1-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/lenovo-tab-p12-pro.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

