VALUES ('amazon-kindle-paperwhite', 'Amazon Kindle Paperwhite (2024) — 6.8" 300ppi, 16GB, Black', 'tablets', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 0.5, '/assets/products/amazon-kindle-paperwhite.webp', 'The Amazon Kindle Paperwhite 2024 is the best-value e-reader for the majority of readers. The 6.8-inch 300ppi display with adjustable warm light provides paper-like reading in any lighting, while the 16GB storage accommodates thousands of books. The USB-C charging modernizes connectivity, and the 10-week battery life means monthly charging at most. The waterproof IPX8 rating enables worry-free reading anywhere, and the flush-front design with thin bezels maximizes screen space. The Kindle Store with Kindle Unlimited access provides unlimited reading for a flat fee. For casual and dedicated readers who want the essential premium e-reader without signature edition extras. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/amazon-kindle-paperwhite.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

