VALUES ('apple-macbook-pro-16-1', 'Apple MacBook Pro 16" (M3 Max) — 36GB RAM, 1TB SSD, Space Black', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1517000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-16-1.webp', 'The Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M3 Max is the ultimate portable workstation for the most demanding professionals. The M3 Max chip with 14-core CPU and 30-core GPU handles 8K video editing, complex 3D scenes, and machine learning training with ease, while the 16.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display with ProMotion provides the largest, most advanced laptop screen Apple has ever made. The 22-hour battery life is the longest ever in a Mac, and the advanced thermal architecture sustains maximum performance without throttling. The comprehensive port selection including HDMI 2.1 and SDXC handles any workflow, and the six-speaker sound system with force-canceling woofers delivers remarkable audio. For film editors, VFX artists, and engineers who refuse to compromise on portable performance. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1517000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-16-1.webp', 1683000, 4.5, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

