VALUES ('dell-xps-13', 'Dell XPS 13 (2024) — Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD, Platinum', 'laptops', 985000, 985000, 807000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13.webp', 'The Dell XPS 13 2024 is the Copilot+ PC that brings AI to your fingertips. The Snapdragon X Elite processor with dedicated NPU delivers 45 TOPS of AI performance for real-time translation, image generation, and intelligent assistance, while the 13.4-inch InfinityEdge OLED touch display with 3K resolution provides stunning visuals. The 27-hour battery life redefines all-day computing, and the seamless Windows 11 integration with Copilot enables natural language control of your PC. The premium CNC-machined aluminum and Gorilla Glass construction exudes quality, and the zero-lattice keyboard with haptic touchpad maximizes usable space. For professionals who want the future of AI-powered computing in an iconic, compact design. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dell packaging, 1-year Dell warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 807000, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13.webp', 896000, 4.5, 1, 'Dell', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

