VALUES ('lenovo-thinkpad-t14s-gen-4', 'Lenovo ThinkPad T14s Gen 4 — AMD Ryzen 7 Pro, 16GB, 512GB, Black', 'laptops', 785000, 785000, 643000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/lenovo-thinkpad-t14s-gen-4.webp', 'The Lenovo ThinkPad T14s Gen 4 is the AMD-powered business laptop that maximizes value without cutting corners. The AMD Ryzen 7 Pro 7840U with Radeon 780M graphics delivers exceptional multi-threaded performance and capable integrated graphics, while the 14-inch WUXGA IPS display with 400 nits brightness provides clear visibility in any lighting. The ThinkPad keyboard with TrackPoint and large precision touchpad enable efficient input, and the MIL-STD-810H construction withstands daily business travel abuse. The 57Wh battery with rapid charge provides all-day productivity, and the comprehensive security including fingerprint reader and dTPM 2.0 protects sensitive data. For business users who want ThinkPad reliability and AMD efficiency at a more accessible price point. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lenovo packaging, 3-year Lenovo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 643000, '/assets/products/lenovo-thinkpad-t14s-gen-4.webp', 714000, 4.5, 1, 'Lenovo', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

