VALUES ('hp-spectre-x360-14', 'HP Spectre x360 14 — Intel Core Ultra 7, 16GB, 1TB, Nightfall Black', 'laptops', 985000, 985000, 807000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-spectre-x360-14.webp', 'The HP Spectre x360 14 is the convertible luxury laptop that transforms from notebook to tablet to tent. The Intel Core Ultra 7 processor with Arc graphics handles creative tasks and entertainment, while the 14-inch 2.8K OLED touch display with 100% DCI-P3 provides vibrant, accurate colors in any mode. The 360-degree hinge enables laptop, tablet, tent, and stand configurations for any workflow, and the included HP Rechargeable MPP2.0 Tilt Pen enables natural note-taking and drawing. The gem-cut design with angular edges and brass accents exudes luxury, and the 9.5-hour battery life supports mobile productivity. For creative professionals and style-conscious users who want versatility and beauty in equal measure. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 807000, '/assets/products/hp-spectre-x360-14.webp', 896000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

