VALUES ('hp-envy-16', 'HP Envy 16 — Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD, Natural Silver', 'laptops', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-envy-16.webp', 'The HP Envy 16 is the creator laptop that brings premium features to a broader audience. The Intel Core i7 processor with optional NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 handles video editing, 3D work, and gaming, while the 16-inch 2.5K touch display with 120Hz refresh rate provides smooth, expansive visuals. The quad-speaker system tuned by Bang & Olufsen delivers immersive audio for content consumption and creation, and the large touchpad with multi-touch gestures enhances productivity. The aluminum chassis with recycled materials feels premium and sustainable, and the comprehensive port selection minimizes dongle use. For aspiring creators and students who want a large, capable laptop without workstation pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/hp-envy-16.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

