VALUES ('asus-zenbook-14-oled-1', 'ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED — AMD Ryzen 9, 16GB, 1TB, Ponder Blue', 'laptops', 585000, 585000, 479000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-1.webp', 'The ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED is the AMD-powered ultrabook with a display that punches above its weight. The AMD Ryzen 9 8945HS processor with Radeon 780M graphics delivers desktop-class performance in a 1.2kg chassis, while the 14-inch 3K OLED display with 100% DCI-P3 and Pantone Validation provides color accuracy for creative work. The 75Wh battery provides up to 15 hours of use, and the NumberPad 2.0 touchpad transforms into a numeric keypad with a tap. The MIL-STD-810H durability ensures travel resilience, and the comprehensive connectivity including HDMI 2.1 and USB4 handles any peripheral. For mobile professionals who want OLED color accuracy and AMD performance in an ultra-portable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 479000, '/assets/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-1.webp', 532000, 4.5, 1, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

