VALUES ('asus-rog-zephyrus-g14-1', 'ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14 (2024) — Ryzen 9, RTX 4060, 16GB, 1TB, Platinum White', 'laptops', 985000, 985000, 807000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-g14-1.webp', 'The ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14 2024 is the compact gaming laptop that defies physics. The AMD Ryzen 9 8945HS with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 delivers desktop-class gaming in a 1.5kg, 18.2mm chassis, while the 14-inch 3K OLED display with 120Hz and 100% DCI-P3 provides stunning, responsive visuals. The vapor chamber cooling with liquid metal thermal compound sustains peak performance without excessive noise, and the 73Wh battery supports productivity away from the wall. The AniMe Matrix LED lid display adds customizable flair, and the Dolby Atmos speakers create immersive audio. For gamers and creators who want flagship performance in a laptop that actually fits in a backpack. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original ASUS packaging, 1-year ASUS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 807000, '/assets/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-g14-1.webp', 896000, 4.5, 1, 'ASUS', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

