VALUES ('microsoft-surface-laptop-7', 'Microsoft Surface Laptop 7 — Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB, 512GB, Platinum', 'laptops', 785000, 785000, 643000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-laptop-7.webp', 'The Microsoft Surface Laptop 7 is the Copilot+ PC that reimagines Windows on ARM. The Snapdragon X Elite processor with 45 TOPS NPU enables on-device AI features including Recall, Cocreator, and live captions, while the 13.8-inch PixelSense touchscreen with 120Hz and HDR provides a responsive, vibrant display. The iconic 3:2 aspect ratio maximizes productivity for documents and web browsing, and the all-day battery life with instant-on resume matches smartphone convenience. The premium aluminum construction with Omnisonic speakers delivers remarkable audio, and the Surface Connect and USB-C ports provide flexible connectivity. For Windows users who want AI-first computing in Microsoft''s most refined laptop design. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Microsoft packaging, 1-year Microsoft warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 643000, '/assets/products/microsoft-surface-laptop-7.webp', 714000, 4.5, 1, 'Microsoft', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

