VALUES ('caldigit-ts4', 'Caldigit TS4 — Thunderbolt 4 Dock, 18 Ports, 98W Charging, Silver', 'laptops', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/caldigit-ts4.webp', 'The Caldigit TS4 is the Thunderbolt 4 dock that replaces your entire cable collection. The 18 ports include Thunderbolt 4, USB-A, USB-C, DisplayPort 1.4, SD 4.0, microSD 4.0, 2.5Gb Ethernet, and audio — all from a single cable to your laptop. The 98W power delivery charges even 16-inch MacBook Pros at full speed, and the dual 4K60 or single 8K30 display support transforms your laptop into a desktop workstation. The aluminum chassis with vertical stand option saves desk space, and the UHS-II SD card slots transfer photos at maximum speed. For creative professionals and power users who want one dock to connect every peripheral and display. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Caldigit packaging, 2-year Caldigit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/caldigit-ts4.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

