VALUES ('hp-usb-c-dock-g5', 'HP USB-C Dock G5 — Universal Dock, 100W, Dual 4K, Black', 'laptops', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/hp-usb-c-dock-g5.webp', 'The HP USB-C Dock G5 is the universal dock that works with any USB-C laptop. The single-cable connection provides dual 4K display support, USB-A and USB-C ports, Ethernet, and audio, while the 100W power delivery charges most laptops at full speed. The compact design with cable management reduces desk clutter, and the firmware update capability ensures compatibility with future devices. The DisplayPort and HDMI outputs accommodate any monitor, and the RJ45 Ethernet provides reliable wired networking. For mixed-device offices and home workers who want one dock that works with any brand of USB-C laptop. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original HP packaging, 1-year HP warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/hp-usb-c-dock-g5.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'HP', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

