VALUES ('satechi-usb-c-slim-dock', 'Satechi USB-C Slim Dock — For 24" iMac, M.2 SSD Enclosure, Silver', 'laptops', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/satechi-usb-c-slim-dock.webp', 'The Satechi USB-C Slim Dock is the iMac companion that adds ports and storage without visible cables. The design matches the 24-inch iMac''s color and profile, sitting flush beneath the stand while adding USB-A ports, SD card readers, and a 3.5mm audio jack. The integrated M.2 SATA SSD enclosure expands storage up to 2TB without external drives, and the USB-C data and power passthrough maintains the single-cable aesthetic. For 24-inch iMac users who want expanded connectivity and storage while preserving Apple''s clean desktop aesthetic. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Satechi packaging, 1-year Satechi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/satechi-usb-c-slim-dock.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

