VALUES ('twelve-south-bookarc', 'Twelve South BookArc — Vertical Laptop Stand, Aluminum, Space Gray', 'laptops', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/twelve-south-bookarc.webp', 'The Twelve South BookArc is the vertical stand that turns your closed laptop into a desktop tower. The vertical orientation saves valuable desk space and improves airflow, while the soft silicone inserts protect your laptop''s finish and accommodate any MacBook or thin PC. The cable management slot routes power and peripherals neatly, and the weighted aluminum base prevents tipping. For MacBook users who run their laptop in clamshell mode with external monitors and want a clean, space-efficient desk setup. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Twelve South packaging, 1-year Twelve South warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/twelve-south-bookarc.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

