VALUES ('rain-design-mstand', 'Rain Design mStand — Laptop Stand, Aluminum, Silver', 'laptops', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/rain-design-mstand.webp', 'The Rain Design mStand is the elevated laptop stand that improves posture and cooling. The 15cm height raise brings laptop screens to eye level, reducing neck strain during long work sessions, while the aluminum construction acts as a heat sink, drawing heat away from the chassis. The cable management hole routes power and peripherals neatly, and the tilted design positions the keyboard at a comfortable typing angle. The sturdy construction supports laptops up to 17 inches, and the silver anodized finish matches Apple aesthetics. For remote workers who want ergonomic screen positioning and improved laptop cooling without complex adjustable mechanisms. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Rain Design packaging, 1-year Rain Design warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/rain-design-mstand.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

