VALUES ('nulaxy-laptop-stand', 'Nulaxy Laptop Stand — Adjustable, Aluminum, Ergonomic, Silver', 'laptops', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/nulaxy-laptop-stand.webp', 'The Nulaxy Laptop Stand is the adjustable riser that adapts to any desk and user height. The multi-angle adjustment from 0 to 90 degrees optimizes screen height for sitting or standing desks, while the open design improves airflow and cooling. The aluminum alloy construction with anti-slip silicone pads supports laptops from 10 to 17 inches securely, and the foldable design enables travel and storage. The cable management hook keeps cords organized, and the ergonomic design reduces neck and shoulder strain during extended use. For budget-conscious remote workers who want adjustable ergonomics without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Nulaxy packaging, 1-year Nulaxy warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/nulaxy-laptop-stand.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

