VALUES ('moft-invisible-laptop-stand', 'MOFT Invisible Laptop Stand — Adhesive, Foldable, Space Gray', 'laptops', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/moft-invisible-laptop-stand.webp', 'The MOFT Invisible Laptop Stand is the paper-thin riser that attaches to your laptop and travels everywhere. At just 3mm thick and 89g, this adhesive stand folds into 15° and 25° angles for ergonomic typing and viewing, while remaining virtually invisible when folded flat. The removable and repositionable adhesive attaches securely without residue, and the PU and fiberglass construction supports up to 8kg. For mobile professionals who want ergonomic elevation in coffee shops and co-working spaces without carrying a separate stand. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original MOFT packaging, 1-year MOFT warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/moft-invisible-laptop-stand.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

