VALUES ('benq-x3000i', 'BenQ X3000i — 4K HDR, 3000 Lumens, 240Hz, Android TV, White', 'laptops', 585000, 585000, 479000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/benq-x3000i.webp', 'The BenQ X3000i is the 4LED gaming projector that delivers cinematic color and competitive speed. The 4LED light source with DCI-P3 100% color coverage produces vibrant, accurate colors without color wheel artifacts, while the 4K UHD resolution with 3000 lumens maintains clarity in ambient light. The 240Hz 1080p mode with 4.16ms input lag satisfies competitive gamers, and the dedicated RPG, FPS, and SPG audio-visual modes optimize settings by genre. The Android TV 10 provides app access without external devices, and the 5W treVolo speakers with Bongiovi DPS create immersive audio. For serious gamers who want projector immersion without sacrificing competitive performance or color accuracy. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original BenQ packaging, 3-year BenQ warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 479000, '/assets/products/benq-x3000i.webp', 532000, 4.5, 1, 'BenQ', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

