VALUES ('anker-nebula-cosmos-laser-4k', 'Anker Nebula Cosmos Laser 4K — 2200 ANSI Lumens, Android TV 10.0, Black', 'laptops', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/anker-nebula-cosmos-laser-4k.webp', 'The Anker Nebula Cosmos Laser 4K is the laser projector that eliminates lamp anxiety. The laser light source delivers 2200 ANSI lumens with 30,000-hour lifespan, while the 4K UHD resolution with HDR10 provides stunning detail and contrast. The Intelligent Environment Adaptation 3.0 auto-focuses, auto-keystones, and fits images to your wall in seconds, and the built-in 30W speakers with Dolby Audio create immersive sound. The Android TV 10 provides streaming access, and the ergonomic handle enables easy repositioning between rooms. For homeowners who want a bright, long-lasting 4K projector with intelligent setup and powerful built-in audio. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/anker-nebula-cosmos-laser-4k.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

