VALUES ('anker-nebula-capsule-3', 'Anker Nebula Capsule 3 — 1080P Mini Projector, Google TV, Built-in Battery', 'laptops', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.5, '/assets/products/anker-nebula-capsule-3.webp', 'The Anker Nebula Capsule 3 is the soda-can-sized projector that streams anywhere. The 1080p DLP technology with 200 ANSI lumens projects clear images up to 120 inches in dark environments, while the built-in 52Wh battery provides 2.5 hours of video playback without outlets. The Google TV integration provides access to Netflix, YouTube, and thousands of apps, and the 8W Dolby Digital speaker delivers surprisingly capable audio. The compact 7.5cm x 17cm cylinder design fits in bags and cup holders, and the auto-focus and keystone correction set up instantly on any surface. For campers, travelers, and spontaneous movie hosts who want streaming projection that fits in a backpack pocket. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/anker-nebula-capsule-3.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

