VALUES ('garmin-dash-cam-67w-1', 'Garmin Dash Cam 67W — 1440p, 180° FOV, Voice Control, Black', 'car-tech', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-67w-1.webp', 'The Garmin Dash Cam 67W is the wide-angle guardian that captures everything in front of your car. The 1440p resolution with 180-degree field of view records expansive road views including adjacent lanes, while the Garmin Clarity HDR optimizes footage in high-contrast lighting and low-light conditions. The voice control enables hands-free operation while driving, and the automatic incident detection with GPS saves and timestamps impacts. The Parking Guard mode monitors your vehicle when parked, and the Drive app provides easy video access and sharing. For safety-conscious drivers who want comprehensive front-facing documentation of every journey. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Garmin packaging, 1-year Garmin warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-67w-1.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Garmin', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

