VALUES ('garmin-dash-cam-mini-2', 'Garmin Dash Cam Mini 2 — 1080p, 140° FOV, Tiny Size, Black', 'car-tech', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-mini-2.webp', 'The Garmin Dash Cam Mini 2 is the discreet recorder that hides behind your mirror. The 1080p resolution with 140-degree field of view captures clear footage of the road ahead, while the coin-sized design at just 5.4cm wide remains virtually invisible to drivers and passengers. The automatic incident detection saves footage before and after impacts, and the Parking Guard mode monitors your vehicle when unattended. The Bluetooth connectivity with Garmin Drive app enables easy video downloads, and the included adhesive mount attaches securely to windshields. For drivers who want incident documentation without dashboard clutter or visible electronics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Garmin packaging, 1-year Garmin warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/garmin-dash-cam-mini-2.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Garmin', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

