VALUES ('viofo-a229-pro', 'Viofo A229 Pro — Dual 4K Dash Cam, Sony STARVIS 2, 5GHz WiFi, Black', 'car-tech', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/viofo-a229-pro.webp', 'The Viofo A229 Pro is the dual 4K dash cam that maximizes value without cutting resolution. Both front and rear cameras record in 4K with Sony STARVIS 2 sensors, capturing license plates and road details with exceptional clarity. The 5GHz WiFi enables fast video downloads to smartphones, and the buffered parking mode with pre-recording captures events leading up to impacts. The supercapacitor design withstands Nigerian heat without battery swelling, and the voice control provides hands-free operation. The CPL filter reduces windshield glare, and the compact design hides discreetly behind rearview mirrors. For value-conscious drivers who want dual 4K coverage without paying premium brand prices. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Viofo packaging, 1-year Viofo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/viofo-a229-pro.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

