VALUES ('thinkware-u3000', 'Thinkware U3000 — 4K Front + 2K Rear, Radar Parking Mode, Black', 'car-tech', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/thinkware-u3000.webp', 'The Thinkware U3000 is the radar-equipped dash cam that detects threats before they touch your car. The front 4K and rear 2K cameras with Sony STARVIS 2 sensors capture detailed footage, while the built-in radar enables energy-efficient parking surveillance that detects approaching vehicles and pedestrians. The Super Night Vision 4.0 delivers clear low-light footage, and the ADAS features including lane departure and forward collision warnings enhance driving safety. The 5GHz WiFi and Thinkware Cloud enable remote viewing and notifications, and the thermal protection ensures reliable operation in extreme heat. For drivers who want proactive parking protection and advanced safety features in a premium package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Thinkware packaging, 1-year Thinkware warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/thinkware-u3000.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

