VALUES ('anker-roav-smartcharge-f0', 'Anker Roav SmartCharge F0 — Bluetooth FM Transmitter, 2 USB Ports, Black', 'car-tech', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/anker-roav-smartcharge-f0.webp', 'The Anker Roav SmartCharge F0 is the Bluetooth bridge that modernizes any car stereo. The FM transmitter broadcasts phone audio to any car radio, while the Bluetooth 5.0 connection provides stable, clear audio streaming and hands-free calling. The two USB ports charge devices at up to 24W combined, and the PowerIQ technology optimizes charging speed for any connected device. The compact design plugs discreetly into cigarette lighters, and the automatic frequency scanning finds the clearest FM channel. For drivers with older cars lacking Bluetooth who want affordable wireless audio and charging without replacing their head unit. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 1-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/anker-roav-smartcharge-f0.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

