VALUES ('jbl-club-a5055', 'JBL Club A5055 — 5-Channel Car Amplifier, 1200W, Class D', 'car-tech', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/jbl-club-a5055.webp', 'The JBL Club A5055 is the five-channel amplifier that powers complete car audio systems. The 1200W total output drives front speakers, rear speakers, and a subwoofer from a single compact chassis, while the Class D efficiency minimizes heat and power draw from your electrical system. The variable crossover and bass boost enable precise system tuning, and the high-level inputs connect to factory head units without additional adapters. The compact design fits under seats and in small trunk spaces, and the protection circuitry guards against short circuits and thermal overload. For car audio enthusiasts who want to upgrade their entire sound system with one powerful, efficient amplifier. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original JBL packaging, 1-year JBL warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/jbl-club-a5055.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'JBL', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

