VALUES ('pioneer-ts-a6970f', 'Pioneer TS-A6970F — 6x9" 5-Way Coaxial Speakers, 650W, Black', 'car-tech', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/pioneer-ts-a6970f.webp', 'The Pioneer TS-A6970F is the 6x9-inch speaker upgrade that transforms car audio. The five-way design with carbon and mica reinforced IMPP cone, horn tweeter, and midrange drivers delivers full-range sound from a single speaker location. The 650W maximum power handling and 100W nominal rating provide headroom for dynamic music, and the open and smooth sound signature improves on factory speakers dramatically. The easy installation fits standard 6x9 locations in most vehicles, and the included grilles protect the drivers while adding style. For car owners who want dramatic audio improvement without the complexity of component speaker systems. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Pioneer packaging, 1-year Pioneer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/pioneer-ts-a6970f.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Pioneer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

