VALUES ('rockford-fosgate-p300-12', 'Rockford Fosgate P300-12 — 12" Powered Subwoofer Enclosure, 300W', 'car-tech', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/rockford-fosgate-p300-12.webp', 'The Rockford Fosgate P300-12 is the all-in-one bass solution that adds thunder without complexity. The sealed 12-inch subwoofer with built-in 300W amplifier delivers deep, accurate bass from a single enclosure, eliminating the need to match separate subs and amps. The closed-loop design ensures optimal woofer-amp integration, and the thermal and overvoltage protection safeguards the system. The remote bass level control lets you adjust thump from the driver''s seat, and the quick-disconnect power and signal connections simplify installation and removal. For car owners who want impactful bass without the research and installation complexity of custom subwoofer builds. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Rockford Fosgate packaging, 1-year Rockford Fosgate warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/rockford-fosgate-p300-12.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

