VALUES ('scosche-magicmount-pro-charge', 'Scosche MagicMount Pro Charge — MagSafe Car Mount + Wireless Charger, Black', 'car-tech', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/scosche-magicmount-pro-charge.webp', 'The Scosche MagicMount Pro Charge is the MagSafe-compatible car mount that charges while you navigate. The powerful neodymium magnets align iPhone 12 and later models securely, while the 15W wireless charging keeps your battery topped during long drives. The adjustable viewing angle and 360-degree rotation provide optimal positioning for navigation and calls, and the stick-grip suction cup or vent mount options accommodate any dashboard configuration. The foreign object detection and temperature control ensure safe charging, and the included cable management keeps your dash tidy. For iPhone users who want seamless MagSafe mounting and charging in their vehicle. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Scosche packaging, 1-year Scosche warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/scosche-magicmount-pro-charge.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

