VALUES ('iottie-auto-sense', 'iOttie Auto Sense — Automatic Clamping Car Mount, Qi Wireless Charging, Black', 'car-tech', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/iottie-auto-sense.webp', 'The iOttie Auto Sense is the automatic car mount that senses and secures your phone. The infrared proximity sensors detect approaching phones and automatically clamp the side arms, while the Qi wireless charging delivers up to 10W to compatible devices. The telescopic arm extends from 12cm to 20cm and pivots 225 degrees for optimal viewing angles, and the suction cup with sticky gel pad adheres firmly to dashboards and windshields. The one-touch release button opens the arms for quick phone removal, and the adjustable bottom foot accommodates devices of any size. For drivers who want the convenience of automatic clamping and wireless charging in one sleek mount. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original iOttie packaging, 1-year iOttie warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/iottie-auto-sense.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

