VALUES ('bosch-icon-wiper-blade', 'Bosch ICON Wiper Blade — 26", Beam Design, WeatherShield, Black', 'car-tech', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/bosch-icon-wiper-blade.webp', 'The Bosch ICON Wiper Blade is the beam-style blade that maintains contact across curved windshields. The exclusive fx dual rubber compound resists heat and ozone deterioration for 40% longer life than conventional blades, while the asymmetrical wind spoiler design increases downforce at highway speeds. The bracketless design eliminates exposed metal components that corrode and freeze, and the precision-tensioned steel spring applies uniform pressure across the entire blade length. The easy installation with included adapter fits 95% of vehicles without tools, and the quiet operation eliminates the chatter of budget blades. For safety-conscious drivers who refuse to compromise on visibility during Nigerian rainstorms. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bosch packaging, 1-year Bosch warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/bosch-icon-wiper-blade.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

