VALUES ('noco-boost-plus-gb40', 'NOCO Boost Plus GB40 — 1000A UltraSafe Jump Starter, 12V, Black', 'car-tech', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/noco-boost-plus-gb40.webp', 'The NOCO Boost Plus GB40 is the pocket-sized jump starter that revives dead batteries without another car. The 1000-amp peak current starts gasoline engines up to 6 liters and diesel engines up to 3 liters, while the UltraSafe technology with spark-proof and reverse polarity protection prevents dangerous mistakes. The 12,000mAh power bank charges phones, tablets, and USB devices, and the 100-lumen LED flashlight with SOS mode provides emergency lighting. The compact design stores in glove compartments, and the IP65 water and dust resistance ensures reliability in any weather. For drivers who want independence from jumper cables and the security of emergency power anywhere. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original NOCO packaging, 1-year NOCO warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/noco-boost-plus-gb40.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

