VALUES ('70mai-a810', '70mai A810 — 4K Dash Cam, Sony STARVIS 2, ADAS, GPS, Black', 'car-tech', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 0.3, '/assets/products/70mai-a810.webp', 'The 70mai A810 is the 4K dash cam that delivers flagship features at a disruptive price. The Sony STARVIS 2 sensor captures 4K footage with exceptional night vision, while the ADAS features including lane departure and forward collision warnings enhance driving safety. The built-in GPS logs speed and location, and the 24-hour parking surveillance with time-lapse recording protects your vehicle when parked. The 5GHz WiFi enables fast smartphone downloads, and the voice control provides hands-free operation. The compact design hides behind rearview mirrors, and the app provides easy video management and sharing. For budget-conscious drivers who want 4K resolution, ADAS safety, and parking protection without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original 70mai packaging, 1-year 70mai warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/70mai-a810.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('gopro-hero12-black', 'GoPro HERO12 Black — 5.3K60, HyperSmooth 6.0, Waterproof 10m', 'cameras', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/gopro-hero12-black.webp', 'The GoPro HERO12 Black is the action camera that sets the standard for rugged video capture. The 5.3K60 video resolution with HDR delivers stunning detail and dynamic range, while the HyperSmooth 6.0 stabilization with 360-degree horizon lock creates gimbal-like footage without external hardware. The waterproof design to 10 meters handles surfing, snorkeling, and rain without a housing, and the 177-degree field of view with Max Lens Mod 2.0 captures immersive perspectives. The 1720mAh Enduro battery provides extended recording in cold and hot conditions, and the 10-bit color with GP-Log enables professional color grading. For action sports enthusiasts, vloggers, and creators who want the most versatile, durable camera for any environment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original GoPro packaging, 1-year GoPro warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/gopro-hero12-black.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'GoPro', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('gopro-hero11-black-mini', 'GoPro HERO11 Black Mini — Compact 5.3K, HyperSmooth 5.0, Black', 'cameras', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/gopro-hero11-black-mini.webp', 'The GoPro HERO11 Black Mini is the tiny action camera that sacrifices nothing but size. The same 5.3K60 image sensor as the full-size HERO11 captures stunning detail, while the HyperSmooth 5.0 stabilization creates incredibly smooth footage from the compact body. The dual mounting points enable endless rigging options on helmets, bikes, and gear, and the built-in Enduro battery handles extreme temperatures. The one-button simplicity starts recording instantly, and the rugged construction withstands impacts, dust, and water to 10 meters. For athletes and creators who want flagship GoPro quality in the smallest, most mountable form factor possible. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original GoPro packaging, 1-year GoPro warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/gopro-hero11-black-mini.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'GoPro', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dji-osmo-action-4', 'DJI Osmo Action 4 — 4K/120fps, 1/1.3" Sensor, 18min Waterproof, Black', 'cameras', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dji-osmo-action-4.webp', 'The DJI Osmo Action 4 is the low-light action camera that challenges GoPro dominance. The large 1/1.3-inch sensor with 2.4μm pixels captures stunning detail in dim conditions where smaller sensors struggle, while the 4K/120fps recording enables smooth slow-motion action. The 155-degree ultra-wide field of view with horizon balancing keeps footage level during extreme movement, and the 18-meter waterproof rating handles deep dives without a housing. The dual touchscreens with Gorilla Glass provide intuitive control from any angle, and the RockSteady 3.0 stabilization creates gimbal-smooth footage. For adventure creators who shoot at dawn, dusk, and underwater and need superior low-light performance. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/dji-osmo-action-4.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

