VALUES ('dji-osmo-action-3', 'DJI Osmo Action 3 — 4K HDR, HorizonSteady, 16m Waterproof, Black', 'cameras', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dji-osmo-action-3.webp', 'The DJI Osmo Action 3 is the value action camera that delivers flagship features at an accessible price. The 4K HDR video with 155-degree field of view captures vibrant, detailed footage, while the HorizonSteady stabilization keeps the horizon level even during 360-degree rotations. The 16-meter waterproof rating handles snorkeling and water sports without additional housing, and the dual touchscreens enable easy framing and control from any angle. The quick-release magnetic mounting system enables fast accessory changes, and the 160-minute battery life at 1080p supports extended recording sessions. For budget-conscious action creators who want DJI stabilization and dual screens without flagship pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/dji-osmo-action-3.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

