VALUES ('insta360-x4', 'Insta360 X4 — 8K 360° Action Camera, 72MP, Invisible Selfie Stick', 'cameras', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/insta360-x4.webp', 'The Insta360 X4 is the 8K 360-degree camera that captures everything and decides later. The dual 1/2-inch sensors record immersive 8K 360-degree video, enabling reframing to any angle in post-production — shoot first, point later. The 72MP 360-degree photos capture stunning detail, and the Invisible Selfie Stick effect removes the stick from footage for impossible drone-like angles. The FlowState stabilization creates gimbal-smooth footage during any activity, and the 135-minute battery life supports extended shoots. The AI-powered editing app reframes, tracks subjects, and creates cinematic edits automatically. For creators who want to capture every angle of their adventures and craft the story in editing rather than in the moment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Insta360 packaging, 1-year Insta360 warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/insta360-x4.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

