VALUES ('dji-rs-4-pro', 'DJI RS 4 Pro — Camera Gimbal, 4.5kg Payload, LiDAR Focus, Carbon Fiber', 'cameras', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dji-rs-4-pro.webp', 'The DJI RS 4 Pro is the professional camera gimbal that handles cinema cameras with ease. The 4.5kg payload capacity supports full-frame mirrorless cameras and cinema lenses, while the carbon fiber axis arms reduce weight without sacrificing strength. The LiDAR focusing system with ActiveTrack Pro maintains critical focus on moving subjects automatically, and the automated axis locks secure the gimbal during transport and power-on. The wireless shutter control, Bluetooth recording, and integrated controls for focus, ISO, and aperture eliminate cable clutter. For professional videographers and filmmakers who need a gimbal that matches the capability of their cinema cameras. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/dji-rs-4-pro.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

