VALUES ('dji-rs-4', 'DJI RS 4 — Camera Gimbal, 3kg Payload, Native Vertical, Black', 'cameras', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dji-rs-4.webp', 'The DJI RS 4 is the content creator gimbal that balances power and portability. The 3kg payload handles full-frame mirrorless cameras with standard zoom lenses, while the native vertical shooting mode enables seamless social media content creation without additional accessories. The 2nd-generation automated axis locks secure during transport and release on power-up, and the Bluetooth shutter control triggers recording wirelessly. The Teflon-coated axes reduce friction for smoother balancing, and the RSA port ecosystem supports handles, wheels, and accessories. For solo content creators and wedding videographers who need professional stabilization in a travel-friendly package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/dji-rs-4.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

