VALUES ('dji-rs-3-mini', 'DJI RS 3 Mini — Lightweight Gimbal, 2kg Payload, Native Vertical, Black', 'cameras', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dji-rs-3-mini.webp', 'The DJI RS 3 Mini is the compact gimbal that makes professional stabilization accessible. The 2kg payload supports mirrorless cameras with prime and light zoom lenses, while the integrated battery handle reduces setup complexity. The native vertical shooting mode creates social media content without rebalancing, and the Bluetooth shutter control enables wireless recording triggers. The automated axis locks secure during transport, and the lightweight 795g design enables extended handheld use without fatigue. For travel vloggers and beginner filmmakers who want DJI stabilization quality in the most compact, affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DJI packaging, 1-year DJI warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/dji-rs-3-mini.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'DJI', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

