VALUES ('zhiyun-crane-4', 'Zhiyun Crane 4 — Camera Gimbal, 6.5kg Payload, Wrist Rest, Black', 'cameras', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/zhiyun-crane-4.webp', 'The Zhiyun Crane 4 is the heavy-lifting gimbal that supports cinema cameras without breaking your back. The 6.5kg payload capacity handles large cinema cameras and heavy lenses, while the ergonomic wrist rest and sling grip distribute weight for comfortable extended operation. The Bluetooth shutter control and integrated focus/zoom wheel eliminate cable clutter, and the customizable buttons provide quick access to frequently used functions. The 12-hour battery life supports all-day shoots, and the quick-release plate with Manfrotto compatibility enables fast camera swaps. For professional filmmakers who need maximum payload capacity with ergonomic design for long production days. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Zhiyun packaging, 1-year Zhiyun warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/zhiyun-crane-4.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

