VALUES ('zhiyun-smooth-5s', 'Zhiyun Smooth 5S — Smartphone Gimbal, 3-Axis, Magnetic Fill Light, Gray', 'cameras', 32000, 32000, 26000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/zhiyun-smooth-5s.webp', 'The Zhiyun Smooth 5S is the smartphone gimbal that brings professional control to mobile filmmaking. The true 3-axis design with no motor obstructions enables 360-degree rotation and low-angle shots impossible on lesser gimbals, while the magnetic fill light brightens subjects in dim conditions. The ZY Cami app provides templates, editing tools, and smart tracking, and the control panel with focus wheel and zoom rocker enables cinematic movements. The 12-hour battery life supports extended creation, and the quick-release clamp accommodates phones with cases. For mobile filmmakers who want true 3-axis freedom and professional controls without the complexity of camera gimbals. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Zhiyun packaging, 1-year Zhiyun warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/zhiyun-smooth-5s.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

