VALUES ('hohem-isteady-m6', 'Hohem iSteady M6 — Smartphone Gimbal, AI Tracking, Magnetic Fill Light, Black', 'cameras', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/hohem-isteady-m6.webp', 'The Hohem iSteady M6 is the AI-tracking smartphone gimbal that follows you automatically. The magnetic AI vision sensor tracks subjects without app dependency, enabling face and body tracking in any camera app. The 3-axis stabilization creates smooth footage during movement, and the magnetic fill light with adjustable color temperature brightens subjects creatively. The 400g payload accommodates large phones with cases, and the 18-hour battery life supports marathon creation sessions. The Hohem Joy app provides templates, editing, and gesture control for hands-free operation. For solo content creators who need reliable subject tracking without being tied to specific apps. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Hohem packaging, 1-year Hohem warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/hohem-isteady-m6.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

