VALUES ('gopro-volta', 'GoPro Volta — Battery Grip, Tripod, Remote, Black', 'cameras', 38000, 38000, 31000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/gopro-volta.webp', 'The GoPro Volta is the versatile grip that triples battery life and expands mounting options. The integrated 4900mAh battery extends recording time by over 4 hours, while the built-in tripod legs enable stable time-lapses and group shots. The wireless remote controls camera functions from up to 30 meters away, and the ergonomic grip provides stable handheld footage. The 1/4-20 mounting threads attach to tripods and rigs, and the weather-resistant construction handles outdoor conditions. For GoPro users who want extended battery life, stable mounting, and remote control in one accessory. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original GoPro packaging, 1-year GoPro warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 31000, '/assets/products/gopro-volta.webp', 34000, 4.5, 0, 'GoPro', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

