VALUES ('gopro-media-mod', 'GoPro Media Mod — HERO12/11/10/9, Directional Mic, HDMI, Black', 'cameras', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/gopro-media-mod.webp', 'The GoPro Media Mod is the content creator accessory that transforms HERO cameras into production tools. The built-in directional microphone with wind suppression captures clearer audio than the camera''s internal mic, while the 3.5mm mic port enables external microphone connection for professional audio. The HDMI output enables live monitoring and playback on external displays, and the two cold shoe mounts attach lights and additional mics. The weather-resistant design protects the camera in light rain and splashes, and the flip-up screen remains accessible. For vloggers and interviewers who want improved audio and expanded connectivity from their GoPro. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original GoPro packaging, 1-year GoPro warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/gopro-media-mod.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'GoPro', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

