VALUES ('pgytech-action-camera-chest-strap', 'PGYTECH Action Camera Chest Strap — Universal Mount, Adjustable, Black', 'cameras', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/pgytech-action-camera-chest-strap.webp', 'The PGYTECH Chest Strap is the hands-free mount that captures immersive POV footage. The adjustable harness fits all body sizes comfortably, while the universal mounting point accommodates GoPro, DJI, and Insta360 cameras with standard adapters. The quick-release buckle enables fast attachment and removal, and the non-slip backing prevents shifting during movement. The breathable mesh material reduces sweating during active use, and the J-hook adapter enables multiple shooting angles. For cyclists, hikers, and skiers who want stable, immersive chest-level footage without holding a camera. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original PGYTECH packaging, 1-year PGYTECH warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/pgytech-action-camera-chest-strap.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

