VALUES ('telesin-dome-port', 'TELESIN Dome Port — GoPro HERO12/11/10/9, Waterproof 30m, Transparent', 'cameras', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/telesin-dome-port.webp', 'The TELESIN Dome Port is the underwater accessory that splits the sea and sky. The optical-grade acrylic dome pushes water away from the lens, enabling over-under shots that capture subjects above and below the waterline simultaneously. The waterproof housing to 30 meters protects the camera during dives and snorkeling, and the floating hand grip prevents loss if dropped. The trigger mechanism enables easy shutter control underwater, and the included accessories enable various mounting options. For underwater photographers and snorkelers who want creative split-level shots that standard waterproof housings cannot achieve. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original TELESIN packaging, 1-year TELESIN warranty. 👓 43. SMART GLASSES, WEARABLES & BLUETOOTH TRACKERS', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/telesin-dome-port.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

