VALUES ('razer-anzu', 'Razer Anzu — Smart Glasses, Blue Light + Sunglasses, Rectangle, Black', 'cameras', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/razer-anzu.webp', 'The Razer Anzu are the smart glasses that protect your eyes while delivering audio. The interchangeable blue light filtering and polarized sunglass lenses reduce eye strain during screen use and glare outdoors, while the built-in speakers and microphones enable hands-free calls and music. The 60ms low-latency Bluetooth connection ensures synchronized audio for gaming and video, and the touch-enabled temples control playback and calls with simple gestures. The 5-hour battery life supports workdays and commutes, and the IPX4 water resistance handles light rain and sweat. For gamers and remote workers who want eye protection and hands-free audio in one affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Razer packaging, 1-year Razer warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/razer-anzu.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Razer', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

