VALUES ('apple-airtag-1', 'Apple AirTag — 4-Pack, Precision Finding, White', 'cameras', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/apple-airtag-1.webp', 'The Apple AirTag 4-Pack is the item tracker ecosystem that finds your belongings with iPhone precision. The Precision Finding with Ultra Wideband technology guides you directly to your item with distance and direction, while the vast Find My network of millions of Apple devices helps locate tags anywhere in the world. The one-tap setup instantly pairs with your iPhone, and the replaceable CR2032 battery lasts over a year. The Lost Mode notifies you when your item is found, and the privacy-focused design prevents unwanted tracking. For Apple users who misplace keys, bags, wallets, and luggage and want the most precise, network-connected item tracker available. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/apple-airtag-1.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

