VALUES ('apple-airtag-2', 'Apple AirTag — Single Pack, Precision Finding, White', 'cameras', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/apple-airtag-2.webp', 'The Apple AirTag is the coin-sized tracker that leverages the world''s largest finding network. The Precision Finding with Ultra Wideband guides iPhone 11 and later users directly to their item with haptic, visual, and audio feedback, while the Find My network anonymously uses nearby Apple devices to locate items globally. The IP67 water and dust resistance survives accidental submersion, and the user-replaceable battery lasts over a year. The built-in speaker plays sounds to help locate nearby items, and the privacy features prevent unauthorized tracking. For iPhone users who want to track a single valuable item with Apple''s seamless ecosystem integration. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Apple packaging, 1-year Apple warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/apple-airtag-2.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

