VALUES ('samsung-galaxy-smarttag2', 'Samsung Galaxy SmartTag2 — Bluetooth Tracker, Compass View, Black', 'cameras', 9500, 9500, 7000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-smarttag2.webp', 'The Samsung Galaxy SmartTag2 is the item tracker with a compass that points the way. The Compass View feature with AR guidance shows direction and distance to your item on Galaxy phones, while the SmartThings Find network locates tags even when offline. The IP67 rating protects against water and dust, and the user-replaceable CR2032 battery lasts up to 700 days. The compact design with metal ring hole attaches to keys and bags easily, and the Lost Mode with NFC tap displays contact information when found. For Samsung Galaxy users who want precise, long-lasting item tracking within their ecosystem. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 7000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-smarttag2.webp', 8000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

