VALUES ('tile-mate-1', 'Tile Mate (2024) — Bluetooth Tracker, 250ft Range, White', 'cameras', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/tile-mate-1.webp', 'The Tile Mate 2024 is the versatile tracker that works with any smartphone. The 250-foot Bluetooth range helps find items around the house, while the Tile Network of millions of users helps locate lost items anywhere. The loud ring makes it easy to find keys under couch cushions, and the water-resistant design survives daily wear. The non-replaceable 3-year battery eliminates maintenance, and the reverse finding feature makes your phone ring even on silent. The QR code on the back enables good Samaritans to contact you without accessing your information. For cross-platform users who want reliable item tracking that works with iPhone and Android. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Tile packaging, 3-year Tile warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/tile-mate-1.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Tile', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

