VALUES ('garmin-instinct-2x-solar', 'Garmin Instinct 2X Solar — Tactical, LED Flashlight, Solar, Black', 'cameras', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/garmin-instinct-2x-solar.webp', 'The Garmin Instinct 2X Solar is the tactical solar watch built for extreme conditions. The solar charging provides unlimited battery life in smartwatch mode with sufficient sunlight, while the built-in LED flashlight with variable white and green intensities supports tactical and outdoor operations. The stealth mode stops storing and sharing GPS position, and the kill switch wipes the device of all user memory. The multi-band GPS navigation with TracBack routing guides you back to your starting point, and the 10ATM water resistance handles diving and swimming. The night vision compatibility preserves natural night vision, and the jumpmaster mode supports military operations. For military personnel, first responders, and outdoor adventurers who need tactical features and unlimited solar power. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Garmin packaging, 1-year Garmin warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/garmin-instinct-2x-solar.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Garmin', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

