VALUES ('withings-body', 'Withings Body+ — WiFi Smart Scale, Body Composition, White', 'cameras', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/withings-body.webp', 'The Withings Body+ is the WiFi scale that tracks your health automatically. The body composition analysis measures weight, body fat, water percentage, muscle mass, and bone mass, while the WiFi connectivity uploads data to the Health Mate app without phone pairing. The automatic user recognition identifies up to 8 users, and the pregnancy mode and baby mode accommodate changing family needs. The weather display provides daily context, and the trend analysis with goal setting motivates progress. The slim design with tempered glass and large display fits any bathroom, and the 18-month battery life minimizes maintenance. For health-conscious families who want effortless body composition tracking with automatic cloud sync. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Withings packaging, 2-year Withings warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/withings-body.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Withings', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

