VALUES ('withings-body-scan-1', 'Withings Body Scan — WiFi Scale, Segmental Body Composition, ECG, Black', 'cameras', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/withings-body-scan-1.webp', 'The Withings Body Scan is the advanced scale that provides a full health check in 90 seconds. The segmental body composition analysis measures fat and muscle distribution in torso, arms, and legs, while the embedded handle captures 6-lead ECG for heart rhythm assessment. The nerve health score assesses sweat gland activity, and the vascular age estimates arterial health compared to chronological age. The large color display shows results without app dependency, and the WiFi sync uploads comprehensive data to the Health Mate app. For health optimizers who want the most comprehensive bathroom-based health assessment available. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Withings packaging, 2-year Withings warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/withings-body-scan-1.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Withings', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

