VALUES ('philips-sonicare-9900-prestige', 'Philips Sonicare 9900 Prestige — Electric Toothbrush, SenseIQ, Champagne', 'cameras', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/philips-sonicare-9900-prestige.webp', 'The Philips Sonicare 9900 Prestige is the intelligent toothbrush that adapts to your technique. The SenseIQ technology senses pressure, motion, and coverage 100 times per second, automatically adjusting intensity to protect gums while maximizing cleaning. The premium All-in-One brush head cleans, whitens, and massages gums simultaneously, and the luxurious travel case with USB-C charging protects and powers on the go. The Philips Sonicare app provides personalized coaching and progress tracking, and the 31,000 brush strokes per minute remove up to 20x more plaque than manual brushing. For dental health enthusiasts who want the most advanced, adaptive oral care technology available. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Philips packaging, 2-year Philips warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/philips-sonicare-9900-prestige.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Philips', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

