VALUES ('anker-solix-f1200-1', 'Anker SOLIX F1200 — 1229Wh, 1800W Output, GaNPrime, Black', 'power', 325000, 325000, 266000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/anker-solix-f1200-1.webp', 'The Anker SOLIX F1200 is the GaNPrime power station that maximizes efficiency and minimizes size. The 1229Wh capacity with 1800W output and 2400W surge powers demanding appliances, while the GaNPrime technology reduces heat and improves conversion efficiency. The HyperFlash charging refills to 80% in 1.4 hours, and the 300W solar input supports off-grid charging. The 13 output ports including 100W USB-C and car socket handle diverse devices, and the unibody drop-proof design survives rough handling. The Anker app provides smart monitoring and control, and the 5-year warranty reflects exceptional confidence. For outdoor enthusiasts who want cutting-edge GaN technology in a durable, high-performance power station. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 5-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 266000, '/assets/products/anker-solix-f1200-1.webp', 295000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

