VALUES ('anker-521-portable-power-station-1', 'Anker 521 Portable Power Station — 256Wh, 200W Output, LiFePO4, 6-Year Lifespan', 'power', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/anker-521-portable-power-station-1.webp', 'The Anker 521 Portable Power Station is the long-lasting mini power station for everyday use. The 256Wh capacity with 200W output charges laptops, phones, and small devices, while the LiFePO4 battery maintains 80% capacity after 6 years of daily use. The compact 4kg design with built-in handle and flashlight travels easily, and the 6 output ports including 60W USB-C PD handle modern devices. The 65W solar input enables off-grid charging, and the quiet operation suits bedrooms and offices. For students, remote workers, and light campers who want a reliable, long-lasting power station for daily device charging. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Anker packaging, 5-year Anker warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/anker-521-portable-power-station-1.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Anker', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

