VALUES ('ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel-1', 'EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel — Foldable, IP68, MC4 Connector', 'power', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel-1.webp', 'The EcoFlow 400W Portable Solar Panel is the foldable array that captures maximum sun. The monocrystalline silicon cells with 23% efficiency convert more sunlight to power than conventional panels, while the foldable design with kickstand adjusts to optimal angles. The IP68 waterproof rating handles rain and dust, and the MC4 connector ensures compatibility with most power stations. The 400W output charges the DELTA 2 in 3-6 hours of direct sun, and the compact folded size stores in vehicle trunks and RV compartments. The durable ETFE coating protects cells from scratches and UV damage, and the carry case with handle enables easy transport. For off-grid enthusiasts who want high-efficiency solar charging in a portable, durable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original EcoFlow packaging, 2-year EcoFlow warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/ecoflow-400w-portable-solar-panel-1.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'EcoFlow', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

