VALUES ('jackery-solarsaga-100w', 'Jackery SolarSaga 100W — Portable Solar Panel, Foldable, ETFE, Black', 'power', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/jackery-solarsaga-100w.webp', 'The Jackery SolarSaga 100W is the portable solar panel that pairs perfectly with Jackery power stations. The monocrystalline cells with 23% efficiency deliver reliable charging in varying light conditions, while the foldable design with magnetic closure and built-in handle travels easily. The ETFE coating provides durability and light transmission, and the integrated USB ports enable direct device charging without a power station. The kickstand adjusts to optimal sun angles, and the 100W output charges the Explorer 300 in 5 hours of direct sun. For campers and emergency preppers who want reliable, portable solar charging for their Jackery ecosystem. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Jackery packaging, 2-year Jackery warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/jackery-solarsaga-100w.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Jackery', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

