VALUES ('bluetti-pv200', 'Bluetti PV200 — 200W Foldable Solar Panel, Monocrystalline, ETFE, Black', 'power', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/bluetti-pv200.webp', 'The Bluetti PV200 is the foldable solar panel that maximizes off-grid charging. The 200W monocrystalline output with 23.4% efficiency charges power stations rapidly, while the ETFE coating and IP54 rating ensure durability in outdoor conditions. The foldable design with kickstand and carry handle transports easily, and the MC4 connector ensures broad compatibility with power stations. The integrated junction box with bypass diodes maintains performance in partial shade, and the lightweight 7.3kg design enables solo setup. For van-lifers and off-grid homeowners who want reliable, efficient solar charging in a manageable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bluetti packaging, 2-year Bluetti warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/bluetti-pv200.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Bluetti', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

