VALUES ('renogy-100w-12v-monocrystalline-solar-panel', 'Renogy 100W 12V Monocrystalline Solar Panel — Off-Grid, High Efficiency, Black', 'power', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/renogy-100w-12v-monocrystalline-solar-panel.webp', 'The Renogy 100W Monocrystalline Solar Panel is the off-grid standard for RVs, cabins, and backup systems. The high-efficiency monocrystalline cells deliver consistent power in varying light conditions, while the corrosion-resistant aluminum frame and tempered glass withstand decades of outdoor exposure. The bypass diodes minimize power drop from shade, and the MC4 connectors enable easy series and parallel wiring. The 100W output charges 12V batteries for lighting, pumps, and small appliances, and the compact size installs on RV roofs and cabin walls. For off-grid builders and RV owners who want proven, durable solar panels at an accessible price per watt. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Renogy packaging, 5-year Renogy warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/renogy-100w-12v-monocrystalline-solar-panel.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('renogy-rover-40a-mppt-charge-controller', 'Renogy Rover 40A MPPT Charge Controller — 12V/24V, LCD Display, Black', 'power', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/renogy-rover-40a-mppt-charge-controller.webp', 'The Renogy Rover 40A MPPT Charge Controller is the intelligent brain of off-grid solar systems. The Maximum Power Point Tracking technology extracts up to 30% more power from solar panels than PWM controllers, while the 40A capacity handles up to 520W of solar at 12V or 1040W at 24V. The LCD display shows real-time voltage, current, and system status, and the RS232 port enables PC monitoring and firmware updates. The multiple electronic protections including overcharging, over-discharging, and short-circuit ensure system safety, and the die-cast aluminum heat sink maintains optimal operating temperature. For DIY solar builders who want maximum energy harvest and system protection in a reliable charge controller. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Renogy packaging, 1-year Renogy warranty. 🔬 46. 3D PRINTING, MAKERS & STEM', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/renogy-rover-40a-mppt-charge-controller.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('creality-ender-3-v3', 'Creality Ender 3 V3 — CoreXZ, 600mm/s, Auto Leveling, Black', 'power', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/creality-ender-3-v3.webp', 'The Creality Ender 3 V3 is the CoreXZ printer that brings speed and precision to the masses. The innovative CoreXZ motion system with linear rails on all axes delivers 600mm/s print speeds with exceptional accuracy, while the auto bed leveling with strain gauge sensor eliminates manual calibration. The all-metal hotend reaches 300°C for engineering materials, and the 32-bit silent motherboard with TMC2209 drivers operates quietly. The PEI flexible build plate enables easy part removal, and the 220x220x250mm build volume handles most projects. For makers and hobbyists who want high-speed printing and modern features without the premium price of flagship printers. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Creality packaging, 1-year Creality warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/creality-ender-3-v3.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('creality-k1-max', 'Creality K1 Max — CoreXY, 600mm/s, AI Camera, 300x300x300mm, Black', 'power', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/creality-k1-max.webp', 'The Creality K1 Max is the large-format speed printer with AI monitoring. The CoreXY motion system with 600mm/s print speeds and 20000mm/s² acceleration produces parts in minutes rather than hours, while the 300x300x300mm build volume handles large projects and batch production. The AI camera with spaghetti detection pauses failed prints automatically, saving filament and time. The enclosed chamber with active carbon and HEPA filtration enables ABS and ASA printing safely, and the auto bed leveling with LiDAR ensures perfect first layers. For small businesses and serious makers who need large-volume, high-speed production with intelligent failure detection. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Creality packaging, 1-year Creality warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/creality-k1-max.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('bambu-lab-a1-mini', 'Bambu Lab A1 Mini — CoreXY, 500mm/s, Auto Leveling, AMS Lite, White', 'power', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-a1-mini.webp', 'The Bambu Lab A1 Mini is the compact speed printer that makes multi-color accessible. The CoreXY motion system with 500mm/s print speeds delivers flagship performance in a desktop-friendly 180x180x180mm build volume, while the AMS Lite enables up to 4-color printing without manual filament changes. The active flow rate compensation ensures dimensional accuracy at high speeds, and the full-auto calibration levels the bed and calibrates flow without user intervention. The vibration compensation and pressure advance produce smooth surface finishes, and the Bambu Studio software provides intuitive slicing with one-click print. For hobbyists and educators who want multi-color capability and high-speed printing in the most compact, user-friendly package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bambu Lab packaging, 1-year Bambu Lab warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-a1-mini.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('bambu-lab-p1s', 'Bambu Lab P1S — CoreXY, 500mm/s, Enclosed, AMS, Black', 'power', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-p1s.webp', 'The Bambu Lab P1S is the enclosed speed workhorse for engineering materials. The fully enclosed chamber with active carbon filtration enables ABS, ASA, PA, and PC printing without warping or fumes, while the CoreXY system with 500mm/s speeds produces parts rapidly. The AMS multi-material system enables up to 16-color printing with four AMS units, and the full-auto calibration ensures perfect prints without manual tuning. The vibration compensation and pressure advance maintain quality at speed, and the Bambu Studio with cloud printing enables remote job submission. For engineers and product designers who need enclosed printing for engineering materials with multi-color capability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bambu Lab packaging, 1-year Bambu Lab warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-p1s.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('bambu-lab-x1-carbon', 'Bambu Lab X1 Carbon — CoreXY, 500mm/s, LiDAR, AI, Carbon Fiber', 'power', 485000, 485000, 397000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-x1-carbon.webp', 'The Bambu Lab X1 Carbon is the flagship printer that redefined consumer 3D printing. The CoreXY system with 500mm/s speeds and 20m/s² acceleration produces production-quality parts, while the micro-LiDAR performs flow calibration and first-layer inspection automatically. The AI camera with spaghetti detection and time-lapse recording monitors prints remotely, and the active vibration compensation and pressure advance deliver exceptional surface quality. The enclosed chamber with HEPA and carbon filtration handles engineering materials safely, and the AMS enables 16-color printing. For professionals and makers who want the most advanced, reliable consumer 3D printer with intelligent monitoring and multi-material capability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bambu Lab packaging, 1-year Bambu Lab warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 397000, '/assets/products/bambu-lab-x1-carbon.webp', 441000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('prusa-mk4', 'Prusa MK4 — FDM 3D Printer, Input Shaper, Nextruder, Orange/Black', 'power', 325000, 325000, 266000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/prusa-mk4.webp', 'The Prusa MK4 is the open-source legend refined for the modern era. The Nextruder with load cell sensor and automatic nozzle cleaning delivers precise extrusion, while the Input Shaper and Pressure Advance enable 2x faster printing than the MK3S+ without quality loss. The removable PEI spring steel sheet enables easy part removal, and the 250x210x220mm build volume handles most projects. The open-source philosophy ensures community support and upgradeability, and the PrusaSlicer provides optimized profiles for flawless prints. The Ethernet and WiFi connectivity enable remote monitoring, and the 3.5-inch color LCD provides intuitive control. For makers who value open-source philosophy, community support, and rock-solid reliability over raw speed. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Prusa packaging, 1-year Prusa warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 266000, '/assets/products/prusa-mk4.webp', 295000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('prusa-mini', 'Prusa Mini+ — Compact FDM, 180mm³, Auto Mesh Bed Leveling, Orange', 'power', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/prusa-mini.webp', 'The Prusa Mini+ is the compact open-source printer that delivers Prusa quality in a smaller footprint. The 180x180x180mm build volume handles most hobby projects, while the auto mesh bed leveling ensures perfect first layers without manual adjustment. The removable spring steel sheet with PEI coating enables easy part removal, and the silent stepper drivers operate quietly for home and office use. The PrusaSlicer integration provides one-click printing with optimized profiles, and the open-source design encourages community modifications and upgrades. For beginners and space-constrained makers who want Prusa reliability and support in a compact, affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Prusa packaging, 1-year Prusa warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/prusa-mini.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

