VALUES ('flashforge-adventurer-5m', 'FlashForge Adventurer 5M — 600mm/s, CoreXY, Auto Leveling, White', 'power', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/flashforge-adventurer-5m.webp', 'The FlashForge Adventurer 5M is the beginner-friendly speed printer that just works. The CoreXY system with 600mm/s print speeds and 20000mm/s² acceleration produces parts rapidly, while the auto bed leveling with strain gauge eliminates manual calibration. The quick-detach nozzle enables fast nozzle changes for different materials, and the 220x220x220mm build volume handles most projects. The 3.5-inch touchscreen with intuitive interface simplifies operation, and the filament runout sensor prevents failed prints. The quiet operation suits home and office use, and the FlashPrint slicing software provides optimized profiles. For beginners who want high-speed printing with minimal setup and reliable operation. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original FlashForge packaging, 1-year FlashForge warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/flashforge-adventurer-5m.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('raspberry-pi-5', 'Raspberry Pi 5 — 8GB RAM, 2.4GHz Quad-Core, Dual 4K, Made in UK', 'power', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-5.webp', 'The Raspberry Pi 5 is the credit-card computer that redefined affordable computing. The 2.4GHz quad-core ARM Cortex-A76 delivers 2-3x the performance of Pi 4, while the 8GB LPDDR4X RAM handles desktop multitasking, media centers, and light servers. The dual 4K60 HDMI outputs enable productive dual-monitor setups, and the PCIe 2.0 x1 interface supports high-speed peripherals including NVMe SSDs. The dedicated power button, real-time clock, and fan connector add conveniences previously missing, and the 40-pin GPIO header maintains compatibility with thousands of HATs and accessories. For makers, students, and hobbyists who want the most capable, versatile single-board computer for projects and learning. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Raspberry Pi packaging, 1-year Raspberry Pi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-5.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('raspberry-pi-5-1', 'Raspberry Pi 5 — 4GB RAM, 2.4GHz Quad-Core, Dual 4K, Made in UK', 'power', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-5-1.webp', 'The Raspberry Pi 5 4GB is the accessible entry point to the latest Pi platform. The same 2.4GHz quad-core ARM Cortex-A76 processor delivers exceptional performance for the price, while the 4GB RAM handles most desktop, media center, and IoT applications comfortably. The dual 4K60 HDMI, PCIe 2.0, and improved USB 3.0 bandwidth provide modern connectivity, and the 40-pin GPIO maintains accessory compatibility. The dedicated power button and real-time clock add everyday conveniences, and the active cooler compatibility enables sustained performance without throttling. For students, makers, and budget-conscious builders who want modern Pi 5 performance with sufficient RAM for most projects. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Raspberry Pi packaging, 1-year Raspberry Pi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-5-1.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('raspberry-pi-4-model-b', 'Raspberry Pi 4 Model B — 8GB RAM, 1.5GHz, Dual 4K, Made in UK', 'power', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-4-model-b.webp', 'The Raspberry Pi 4 Model B 8GB is the proven platform with maximum memory. The 1.5GHz quad-core processor with 8GB LPDDR4 handles demanding applications including desktop replacement, NAS servers, and Kubernetes clusters, while the dual 4K display support enables productive workstations. The Gigabit Ethernet and USB 3.0 provide fast networking and storage, and the 40-pin GPIO supports thousands of accessories and HATs. The extensive software ecosystem and community support make troubleshooting easy, and the proven reliability ensures project stability. For builders who want maximum RAM on the mature, well-supported Pi 4 platform for server and desktop applications. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Raspberry Pi packaging, 1-year Raspberry Pi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-4-model-b.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('raspberry-pi-zero-2-w', 'Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W — 512MB, Wireless, 1GHz Quad-Core, Made in UK', 'power', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-zero-2-w.webp', 'The Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W is the tiny wireless computer that fits anywhere. The 1GHz quad-core processor with 512MB RAM handles IoT projects, cameras, and retro gaming in a 65mm x 30mm form factor, while the built-in WiFi and Bluetooth eliminate the need for USB dongles. The 40-pin GPIO header maintains compatibility with most HATs, and the mini HDMI and micro USB OTG provide connectivity. The low power consumption enables battery-powered projects, and the H.264 video encoding supports camera applications. For makers who need wireless connectivity and Pi compatibility in the smallest possible form factor for embedded and IoT projects. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Raspberry Pi packaging, 1-year Raspberry Pi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/raspberry-pi-zero-2-w.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('arduino-uno-r4-wifi', 'Arduino Uno R4 WiFi — 32-bit ARM, WiFi, Bluetooth, LED Matrix, Made in Italy', 'power', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/arduino-uno-r4-wifi.webp', 'The Arduino Uno R4 WiFi is the legendary board modernized for the connected era. The 32-bit ARM Cortex-M4 processor with 256KB flash and 32KB RAM delivers 16x the performance of the classic Uno, while the built-in ESP32-S3 module provides WiFi and Bluetooth connectivity without shields. The 12x8 LED matrix enables visual feedback without external displays, and the 5V pin with expanded current drive powers more peripherals. The classic Uno form factor maintains shield compatibility, and the Arduino ecosystem provides thousands of libraries and tutorials. For educators and makers who want the familiarity of Uno with modern performance and wireless connectivity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Arduino packaging, 1-year Arduino warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/arduino-uno-r4-wifi.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('arduino-nano-esp32', 'Arduino Nano ESP32 — WiFi, Bluetooth, USB-C, Made in Italy', 'power', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/arduino-nano-esp32.webp', 'The Arduino Nano ESP32 is the tiny board with massive connectivity. The ESP32-S3 processor with WiFi and Bluetooth handles IoT projects in a compact Nano form factor, while the USB-C connectivity modernizes programming and power. The 8MB PSRAM and 16MB flash accommodate complex applications and OTA updates, and the u-blox NORA-W106 module provides reliable wireless performance. The Arduino IDE and Cloud integration simplify development, and the breadboard-friendly design enables rapid prototyping. For IoT developers and makers who want ESP32 power with Arduino simplicity in a compact, modern package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Arduino packaging, 1-year Arduino warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/arduino-nano-esp32.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('esp32-s3-devkitc-1', 'ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 — WiFi, Bluetooth 5, USB-OTG, AI Acceleration', 'power', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/esp32-s3-devkitc-1.webp', 'The ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 is the development board that brings AI to the edge. The ESP32-S3 with dual-core Xtensa LX7 processor includes vector instructions for AI acceleration, while the WiFi 4 and Bluetooth 5 connectivity handle IoT communication. The USB-OTG enables direct connection to USB devices, and the 8MB PSRAM accommodates complex applications. The onboard antenna and U.FL connector provide flexible RF options, and the extensive Espressif ecosystem provides mature development tools and libraries. For AIoT developers who want edge AI capability with proven wireless connectivity in an affordable development board. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Espressif packaging, 1-year Espressif warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/esp32-s3-devkitc-1.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nvidia-jetson-nano-developer-kit', 'NVIDIA Jetson Nano Developer Kit — 4GB, AI Computing, 128 CUDA Cores', 'power', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/nvidia-jetson-nano-developer-kit.webp', 'The NVIDIA Jetson Nano Developer Kit is the AI computer that brings deep learning to makers. The 128-core Maxwell GPU with 4GB RAM runs multiple neural networks in parallel for image classification, object detection, and segmentation, while the quad-core ARM processor handles general computing. The 40-pin GPIO supports standard accessories, and the MIPI CSI-2 camera connector enables computer vision projects. The JetPack SDK provides CUDA, cuDNN, and TensorRT for optimized AI inference, and the extensive documentation accelerates project development. For AI students, researchers, and makers who want affordable GPU-accelerated machine learning in a compact, accessible platform. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original NVIDIA packaging, 1-year NVIDIA warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/nvidia-jetson-nano-developer-kit.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nvidia-jetson-orin-nano-developer-kit', 'NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit — 8GB, 40 TOPS AI, Ampere GPU', 'power', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/nvidia-jetson-orin-nano-developer-kit.webp', 'The NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit is the next-generation AI platform with 40 TOPS of inference performance. The Ampere GPU with 1024 CUDA cores and 32 Tensor Cores delivers 80x the performance of the original Jetson Nano, enabling complex multi-modal AI applications. The 8GB RAM supports large models and concurrent applications, and the 7-15W power envelope enables battery-powered edge deployment. The JetPack 6 with CUDA-X provides optimized libraries for robotics, vision AI, and generative AI at the edge. For robotics developers and AI engineers who need maximum inference performance in a compact, power-efficient platform. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original NVIDIA packaging, 1-year NVIDIA warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/nvidia-jetson-orin-nano-developer-kit.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('canakit-raspberry-pi-5-starter-kit', 'CanaKit Raspberry Pi 5 Starter Kit — 8GB, 128GB SD, Case, PSU, Fan, Black', 'power', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/canakit-raspberry-pi-5-starter-kit.webp', 'The CanaKit Raspberry Pi 5 Starter Kit is the complete package for immediate Pi projects. The 8GB Pi 5 board provides ample performance and memory, while the premium black case with built-in PWM fan keeps temperatures optimal under sustained loads. The 128GB SanDisk microSD card with pre-loaded Raspberry Pi OS enables instant booting, and the 27W USB-C power supply with PD support delivers full performance without throttling. The HDMI cable, heat sinks, and GPIO reference card complete the kit, and the included quick-start guide accelerates first projects. For beginners and gift-givers who want everything needed for a working Pi setup in one comprehensive package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original CanaKit packaging, 1-year CanaKit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/canakit-raspberry-pi-5-starter-kit.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pimoroni-nvme-base', 'Pimoroni NVMe Base — For Raspberry Pi 5, PCIe Gen 3, M.2 2230-2280, Black', 'power', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/pimoroni-nvme-base.webp', 'The Pimoroni NVMe Base is the storage upgrade that transforms Pi 5 performance. The PCIe Gen 3 x1 interface connects M.2 NVMe SSDs in 2230, 2242, 2260, and 2280 formats, providing storage speeds 10x faster than microSD cards. The compact design mounts under the Pi 5 with included standoffs, and the power delivery supports high-performance SSDs without external power. The full-height and low-profile mounting options accommodate different cases, and the passive cooling maintains optimal temperatures. For Pi 5 users who want desktop-class storage performance for databases, media servers, and development work. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Pimoroni packaging, 1-year Pimoroni warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/pimoroni-nvme-base.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('waveshare-79-dsi-capacitive-touchscreen', 'Waveshare 7.9" DSI Capacitive Touchscreen — For Raspberry Pi, 400x1280, IPS', 'power', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/waveshare-79-dsi-capacitive-touchscreen.webp', 'The Waveshare 7.9-inch DSI Touchscreen is the tall display perfect for Pi-based dashboards and info panels. The 400x1280 resolution with IPS technology provides wide viewing angles and vibrant colors, while the capacitive touch with 5-point multi-touch enables intuitive interaction. The DSI connection leaves HDMI ports free for additional displays, and the compact design with mounting holes enables panel installation. The driver-free operation with Raspberry Pi OS ensures plug-and-play compatibility, and the toughened glass cover protects against scratches. For makers building Pi-based control panels, digital signage, and information displays who want a tall, touch-capable screen. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Waveshare packaging, 1-year Waveshare warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/waveshare-79-dsi-capacitive-touchscreen.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('adafruit-feather-rp2040', 'Adafruit Feather RP2040 — USB-C, 8MB Flash, STEMMA QT, Purple', 'power', 5500, 5500, 4000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/adafruit-feather-rp2040.webp', 'The Adafruit Feather RP2040 is the tiny development board with big capabilities. The Raspberry Pi RP2040 dual-core processor with 8MB flash and 264KB RAM handles complex projects in a compact Feather form factor, while the USB-C connectivity modernizes programming and power. The STEMMA QT connector enables plug-and-play I2C sensor connection without soldering, and the LiPoly battery connector with charging enables portable projects. The 21 GPIO pins support PWM, I2C, SPI, and UART, and the CircuitPython and Arduino support provides flexible programming options. For makers and educators who want the RP2040 platform with Adafruit''s quality and STEMMA ecosystem in a compact, battery-ready format. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Adafruit packaging, 1-year Adafruit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/adafruit-feather-rp2040.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sparkfun-qwiic-phat-v2', 'SparkFun Qwiic pHAT v2 — For Raspberry Pi, I2C Bus, 4 Qwiic Connectors', 'power', 3500, 3500, 2000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/sparkfun-qwiic-phat-v2.webp', 'The SparkFun Qwiic pHAT v2 is the I2C expansion board that eliminates soldering for sensor projects. The four Qwiic connectors provide plug-and-play I2C connectivity for dozens of sensors and actuators, while the 5V and 3.3V compatibility ensures broad device support. The compact design fits neatly on Raspberry Pi GPIO headers without obstructing other connections, and the pass-through headers maintain access to unused pins. The SparkFun ecosystem provides compatible sensors for environmental monitoring, motion detection, and display control. For educators and rapid prototypers who want to build I2C sensor networks without breadboards and jumper wires. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SparkFun packaging, 1-year SparkFun warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000, '/assets/products/sparkfun-qwiic-phat-v2.webp', 3000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('microbit-v2', 'Micro:bit V2 — BBC, Bluetooth, Speaker, Microphone, Accelerometer, Blue', 'power', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/microbit-v2.webp', 'The BBC micro:bit V2 is the educational computer that teaches coding through creation. The Nordic nRF52833 processor with Bluetooth 5.1 enables wireless projects, while the built-in speaker, microphone, accelerometer, and compass provide immediate sensory capabilities without accessories. The 25 LED matrix display and two programmable buttons enable interactive projects, and the edge connector supports crocodile clips and expansion boards. The MakeCode block editor and MicroPython support accommodate beginners and advanced students, and the extensive educational resources accelerate learning. For schools, coding clubs, and parents who want a proven, engaging platform for teaching children computational thinking. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original BBC packaging, 1-year BBC warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/microbit-v2.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

