VALUES ('makeblock-mbot-neo', 'Makeblock mBot Neo — STEM Robot, Coding, AIoT, 10+ Sensors, Blue', 'power', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/makeblock-mbot-neo.webp', 'The Makeblock mBot Neo is the coding robot that grows with young learners. The 10+ electronic modules including ultrasonic sensor, line follower, and color sensor enable diverse projects, while the CyberPi controller with WiFi and Bluetooth supports block-based and Python coding. The AIoT functionality enables voice recognition, image recognition, and IoT projects, and the modular design supports expansion with additional Makeblock components. The mBlock software with curriculum-aligned courses teaches coding progressively, and the durable metal construction survives classroom use. For schools and parents who want a comprehensive STEM robot that teaches coding, AI, and robotics from elementary to high school. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Makeblock packaging, 1-year Makeblock warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/makeblock-mbot-neo.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

