VALUES ('lego-spike-prime-set', 'Lego Spike Prime Set — STEM Education, 528 Pieces, Python, Yellow', 'power', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 12.0, '/assets/products/lego-spike-prime-set.webp', 'The Lego Spike Prime Set is the educational robotics kit designed for classroom innovation. The 528 pieces including motors, sensors, and the Spike Prime hub enable creation of interactive models, while the Scratch and Python coding environments teach computational thinking progressively. The 6-axis gyro, force sensor, and color sensor provide rich data for programming, and the durable storage box with sorting trays organizes components. The curriculum-aligned lesson plans cover engineering, computer science, and design thinking, and the Bluetooth connectivity enables wireless programming. For schools and STEM educators who want a comprehensive, curriculum-supported robotics platform that engages students in hands-on learning. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lego packaging, 1-year Lego warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/lego-spike-prime-set.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

