VALUES ('amazon-smart-plug', 'Amazon Smart Plug — WiFi, 15A, Works with Alexa, White', 'gadgets', 5500, 5500, 4000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/amazon-smart-plug.webp', 'The Amazon Smart Plug is the simplest way to add Alexa control to any outlet. The compact design leaves adjacent outlets accessible, while the 15A rating handles most household devices. The setup requires only scanning a barcode in the Alexa app — no additional apps or hubs needed — and the scheduling and routines integrate seamlessly with other Alexa devices. The away mode turns lamps on and off randomly for security, and the energy monitoring tracks usage of connected devices. For Alexa households who want the most streamlined, integrated smart plug experience without third-party apps. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Amazon packaging, 1-year Amazon warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 4000, '/assets/products/amazon-smart-plug.webp', 5000, 4.5, 0, 'Amazon', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

