VALUES ('tp-link-kasa-smart-power-strip-hs300', 'TP-Link Kasa Smart Power Strip HS300 — 6 Outlets + 3 USB, WiFi, Surge Protection', 'gadgets', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/tp-link-kasa-smart-power-strip-hs300.webp', 'The TP-Link Kasa Smart Power Strip HS300 is the surge-protected smart strip that controls six devices individually. Each of the six AC outlets can be controlled and scheduled independently via the Kasa app, while the three USB ports charge devices without occupying outlets. The 15A circuit breaker and surge protection safeguard electronics, and the energy monitoring on each outlet tracks consumption. The voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant enables hands-free operation, and the 3-foot cord provides flexible placement. For home offices and entertainment centers where multiple devices need individual smart control and surge protection. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original TP-Link packaging, 2-year TP-Link warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/tp-link-kasa-smart-power-strip-hs300.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'TP-Link', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

