VALUES ('apc-surgearrest-performance', 'APC SurgeArrest Performance — 11-Outlet Surge Protector, 2880 Joules, Black', 'gadgets', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/apc-surgearrest-performance.webp', 'The APC SurgeArrest Performance is the professional surge protector that safeguards entire workstations. The 11 outlets with sliding safety covers protect against accidental contact, while the 2880 joule rating absorbs powerful surges from lightning and grid fluctuations. The telephone, coaxial, and Ethernet protection safeguard connected devices from line surges, and the fail-safe mode disconnects equipment when protection is compromised. The 6-foot cord with right-angle plug provides flexible placement, and the LED indicators confirm protection status. For home offices and entertainment centers with expensive electronics that need comprehensive surge protection. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original APC packaging, lifetime APC warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/apc-surgearrest-performance.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

