VALUES ('cyberpower-cp1500pfclcd', 'CyberPower CP1500PFCLCD — 1500VA Pure Sine Wave UPS, 10 Outlets, LCD', 'gadgets', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/cyberpower-cp1500pfclcd.webp', 'The CyberPower CP1500PFCLCD is the pure sine wave UPS that protects sensitive electronics during outages. The 1500VA/1000W capacity with pure sine wave output safely powers servers, networking equipment, and audio gear, while the 10 outlets including five with battery backup provide comprehensive protection. The multifunction LCD display shows power conditions, battery status, and load levels, and the PowerPanel software enables automatic shutdown and monitoring. The AVR corrects brownouts without draining battery, and the user-replaceable batteries extend service life. For home offices, NAS servers, and studios where clean, uninterrupted power prevents data loss and equipment damage. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original CyberPower packaging, 3-year CyberPower warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/cyberpower-cp1500pfclcd.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

