VALUES ('epson-perfection-v600', 'Epson Perfection V600 — Flatbed Photo Scanner, 6400dpi, Film Scanning, Black', 'gadgets', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/epson-perfection-v600.webp', 'The Epson Perfection V600 is the photo scanner that preserves memories with archival quality. The 6400dpi optical resolution with DIGITAL ICE technology removes dust and scratches from photos and film automatically, while the built-in transparency unit scans 35mm film, slides, and medium format negatives. The ReadyScan LED technology requires no warm-up time and produces consistent color, and the Epson Scan software provides automatic and professional modes. The high-rise lid accommodates books and thick originals, and the energy-efficient LED light source reduces power consumption. For photographers, genealogists, and archivists who want to digitize prints and film with professional restoration quality. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Epson packaging, 1-year Epson warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/epson-perfection-v600.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Epson', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

