VALUES ('brother-ql-820nwb', 'Brother QL-820NWB — Professional Label Printer, WiFi, Bluetooth, Black/Red', 'gadgets', 65000, 65000, 53000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/brother-ql-820nwb.webp', 'The Brother QL-820NWB is the professional label printer that connects any way you want. The wireless, Bluetooth, Ethernet, and USB connectivity enable printing from computers, phones, and tablets across any network, while the black and red printing creates attention-grabbing labels without color ink. The automatic cutter produces clean, precise labels, and the Brother iPrint&Label app enables mobile design and printing. The DK label rolls require no ink or toner, and the print speeds up to 110 labels per minute handle high-volume needs. For warehouses, retail stores, and offices that need flexible connectivity and professional two-color labeling. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Brother packaging, 1-year Brother warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/brother-ql-820nwb.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

