VALUES ('dymo-labelwriter-550', 'DYMO LabelWriter 550 — Direct Thermal, Auto Label Recognition, Black', 'gadgets', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dymo-labelwriter-550.webp', 'The DYMO LabelWriter 550 is the intelligent label printer that knows what you loaded. The automatic label recognition identifies inserted rolls and adjusts settings accordingly, eliminating manual configuration and waste. The direct thermal technology prints without ink or toner, and the 300dpi resolution produces crisp text and barcodes. The DYMO Connect software enables custom label design, and the compact design fits on any desk. The high-speed printing produces up to 90 labels per minute, and the compatibility with popular shipping platforms streamlines e-commerce fulfillment. For small businesses and home offices that ship packages and organize inventory with professional labels. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original DYMO packaging, 2-year DYMO warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/dymo-labelwriter-550.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

