VALUES ('segway-ninebot-f2-pro', 'Segway Ninebot F2 Pro — Electric Scooter, 43km/h, 55km Range, Black', 'gadgets', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/segway-ninebot-f2-pro.webp', 'The Segway Ninebot F2 Pro is the commuter scooter that balances speed and range. The 900W motor reaches 43km/h with a 55km range on a single charge, while the 10-inch self-sealing tires absorb potholes and debris. The dual braking system with front drum and rear electronic brake ensures safe stopping, and the front and rear suspension smooths rough roads. The Apple Find My integration helps locate your scooter if stolen, and the Segway-Ninebot app provides ride data and firmware updates. The foldable design with built-in front and indicators enables compact storage and legal road use. For urban commuters who want a fast, reliable electric scooter with suspension and safety features for daily transport. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Segway packaging, 1-year Segway warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/segway-ninebot-f2-pro.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

