VALUES ('xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-pro', 'Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro — 25km/h, 55km Range, 10" Tires, Black', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-pro.webp', 'The Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Pro is the refined commuter with dual suspension. The 55km range and 25km/h top speed provide efficient urban transport, while the dual suspension system with 35mm travel absorbs bumps and vibrations. The 10-inch self-sealing tires resist punctures, and the dual braking with disc and E-ABS ensures safe stopping in wet conditions. The aerospace-grade aluminum frame supports up to 120kg, and the foldable design with magnetic latch stores compactly. The Mi Home app provides ride data, firmware updates, and security features, and the integrated display shows speed and battery clearly. For urban commuters who want refined ride quality with dual suspension and proven reliability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-pro.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

