VALUES ('xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-lite', 'Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Lite — 25km/h, 25km Range, 8.5" Tires, Black', 'gadgets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-lite.webp', 'The Xiaomi Electric Scooter 4 Lite is the accessible entry point to electric commuting. The 25km range and 25km/h top speed handle short commutes and campus transport, while the 8.5-inch pneumatic tires provide basic shock absorption. The rear disc brake with E-ABS ensures safe stopping, and the aerospace-grade aluminum frame supports up to 100kg. The foldable design stores in car trunks and closets, and the integrated display shows speed and battery. The Mi Home app provides basic ride data and firmware updates, and the lightweight 16kg design enables carrying up stairs. For students and short-distance commuters who want affordable electric transport without premium features they do not need. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Xiaomi packaging, 1-year Xiaomi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-electric-scooter-4-lite.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

