VALUES ('ninebot-by-segway-zt3-pro', 'Ninebot by Segway ZT3 Pro — Electric Scooter, 29km/h, 40km Range, Black', 'gadgets', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/ninebot-by-segway-zt3-pro.webp', 'The Ninebot ZT3 Pro is the trail-rated scooter that handles rough terrain. The 29km/h top speed with 40km range provides adventure capability, while the 11-inch off-road tires with self-healing technology tackle gravel, grass, and uneven surfaces. The dual suspension with 80mm travel absorbs serious bumps, and the dual braking with disc and electronic systems ensures control on descents. The IPX5 water resistance handles puddles and rain, and the rugged frame supports off-road exploration. The Segway-Ninebot app provides ride data and custom settings, and the bright headlight and indicators enhance visibility. For adventure seekers who want a scooter capable of trails and rough urban terrain, not just smooth pavement. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Segway packaging, 1-year Segway warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/ninebot-by-segway-zt3-pro.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

