VALUES ('shokz-openrun-pro', 'Shokz OpenRun Pro — Bone Conduction Headphones, 10hr Battery, Black', 'gadgets', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/shokz-openrun-pro.webp', 'The Shokz OpenRun Pro is the bone conduction headset that keeps you aware while you train. The 9th-generation bone conduction technology delivers premium audio through your cheekbones, leaving ears open to traffic and conversation. The 10-hour battery life supports marathon training sessions, and the 5-minute quick charge provides 1.5 hours of playback. The IP55 water resistance handles sweat and rain, and the lightweight 29g design enables all-day comfort. The dual noise-canceling mics ensure clear calls, and the Shokz app provides custom EQ settings. For runners, cyclists, and outdoor athletes who refuse to sacrifice situational awareness for audio quality. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Shokz packaging, 2-year Shokz warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/shokz-openrun-pro.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

