VALUES ('sony-wf-sp800n', 'Sony WF-SP800N — True Wireless, ANC, IP55, Extra Bass, Black', 'gadgets', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/sony-wf-sp800n.webp', 'The Sony WF-SP800N is the noise-canceling sport earbud that blocks gym noise. The Active Noise Cancellation eliminates treadmill hum and weight clatter, while the IP55 dust and water resistance handles intense sweat and outdoor dust. The Extra Bass sound profile delivers energetic low-end for workout motivation, and the stable arc supporter design keeps earbuds secure during box jumps and sprints. The 9-hour battery with ANC and 18 additional hours from the case cover marathon training weeks, and the Quick Attention mode enables conversation without removing earbuds. For gym-goers who want to eliminate distractions and focus on their workout with powerful bass. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/sony-wf-sp800n.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

