VALUES ('garmin-edge-1040-solar', 'Garmin Edge 1040 Solar — GPS Bike Computer, Solar Charging, Black', 'gadgets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/garmin-edge-1040-solar.webp', 'The Garmin Edge 1040 Solar is the solar-powered bike computer that never needs charging on long rides. The Power Glass solar charging extends battery life to unlimited in power saver mode, while the multi-band GNSS provides precise tracking in challenging environments. The ride type-specific maps and navigation guide road, mountain, and gravel routes, and the ClimbPro feature previews upcoming ascents. The stamina insights suggest pacing strategies, and the power guide recommends power targets throughout rides. The Garmin Connect integration syncs rides and training plans, and the incident detection provides safety alerts. For endurance cyclists and bikepackers who want comprehensive navigation and training data without battery anxiety. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Garmin packaging, 1-year Garmin warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/garmin-edge-1040-solar.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Garmin', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

