VALUES ('topeak-joeblow-sport-iii', 'Topeak JoeBlow Sport III — Floor Pump, TwinHead, 160psi, Yellow', 'gadgets', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/topeak-joeblow-sport-iii.webp', 'The Topeak JoeBlow Sport III is the floor pump that inflates any tire with ease. The TwinHead dual valve design fits Presta and Schrader valves without adapters, while the large 3-inch gauge provides clear pressure readings. The steel barrel with padded handle delivers smooth, efficient pumping to 160psi, handling road bike tires with precision. The wide base provides stability during pumping, and the hose dock keeps the workspace tidy. For cyclists who want a reliable, versatile floor pump that handles everything from mountain bike tires to high-pressure road tires without fumbling with adapters. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Topeak packaging, 1-year Topeak warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/topeak-joeblow-sport-iii.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

