VALUES ('lezyne-digital-pressure-over-drive', 'Lezyne Digital Pressure Over Drive — Floor Pump, Digital Gauge, 220psi, Black', 'gadgets', 15000, 15000, 12000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/lezyne-digital-pressure-over-drive.webp', 'The Lezyne Digital Pressure Over Drive is the high-pressure floor pump with digital precision. The 220psi maximum pressure handles tubeless tire seating and high-pressure road tires, while the digital gauge provides accurate readings to 0.5psi. The ABS-1 Pro chuck with bleed button releases excess pressure for precise inflation, and the large volume barrel inflates tires rapidly. The CNC-machined aluminum construction ensures durability and stability, and the extra-long hose reaches valves in any position. For tubeless mountain bikers and road cyclists who need high-pressure capability with digital accuracy for precise tire pressure tuning. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Lezyne packaging, 2-year Lezyne warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 12000, '/assets/products/lezyne-digital-pressure-over-drive.webp', 13000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

