VALUES ('crankbrothers-m19-multi-tool', 'Crankbrothers M19 Multi-Tool — 19 Functions, Stainless Steel, Black/Red', 'gadgets', 8500, 8500, 6000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/crankbrothers-m19-multi-tool.webp', 'The Crankbrothers M19 is the trail-side repair tool that handles most mechanical issues. The 19 functions including hex keys, Torx, screwdrivers, chain tool, and spoke wrenches address common trail repairs, while the stainless steel construction with aluminum side plates ensures durability without excessive weight. The compact design with carrying case fits in saddle bags and jersey pockets, and the precise machining ensures tools fit fasteners properly without rounding. For mountain bikers and gravel riders who want comprehensive trail repair capability in a compact, quality tool. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Crankbrothers packaging, 5-year Crankbrothers warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 6000, '/assets/products/crankbrothers-m19-multi-tool.webp', 7000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

