VALUES ('topeak-alien-ii', 'Topeak Alien II — 26-Function Multi-Tool, Stainless Steel, Black', 'gadgets', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/topeak-alien-ii.webp', 'The Topeak Alien II is the workshop-in-your-pocket with 26 functions for any bike repair. The unique break-apart design separates into two ergonomic handles for leverage, while the comprehensive tool selection includes hex keys, Torx, screwdrivers, chain tool, spoke wrenches, and tire levers. The hardened steel construction ensures longevity, and the compact folded size fits in any saddle bag. The chain tool with spare link storage enables emergency chain repairs, and the integrated bottle opener celebrates post-ride refreshments. For bikepackers and tourers who need comprehensive repair capability far from bike shops. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Topeak packaging, 1-year Topeak warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/topeak-alien-ii.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

