VALUES ('park-tool-pcs-103', 'Park Tool PCS-10.3 — Home Mechanic Repair Stand, Steel, Blue', 'gadgets', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/park-tool-pcs-103.webp', 'The Park Tool PCS-10.3 is the home repair stand that transforms any space into a bike workshop. The sturdy steel construction with 45kg capacity handles road bikes, mountain bikes, and e-bikes securely, while the 360-degree clamp rotation enables access to any part of the bike. The adjustable height accommodates riders of any stature, and the folding base stores compactly when not in use. The composite cam clamp secures frames without damage, and the integrated tool tray keeps parts organized during repairs. For home mechanics who perform their own maintenance and want professional-grade stability and adjustability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Park Tool packaging, lifetime Park Tool warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/park-tool-pcs-103.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

