VALUES ('feedback-sports-pro-elite', 'Feedback Sports Pro Elite — Repair Stand, Clamp, Tripod Base, Red', 'gadgets', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/feedback-sports-pro-elite.webp', 'The Feedback Sports Pro Elite is the portable repair stand that professionals choose. The tripod base with rubber feet provides stability on any surface, while the 360-degree rotating clamp with micro-adjustment secures any frame tube without damage. The quick-release height adjustment accommodates any bike size, and the 16kg weight supports heavy e-bikes and downhill rigs. The compact folded size transports to races and events, and the anodized aluminum construction ensures years of reliable service. For mobile mechanics and serious home wrenchers who want professional stability with portable convenience. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Feedback Sports packaging, 3-year Feedback Sports warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/feedback-sports-pro-elite.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

