VALUES ('continental-grand-prix-5000-s-tr', 'Continental Grand Prix 5000 S TR — Tubeless Road Tire, 700x28c, Black', 'gadgets', 18500, 18500, 15000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/continental-grand-prix-5000-s-tr.webp', 'The Continental Grand Prix 5000 S TR is the tubeless road tire that balances speed, grip, and puncture protection. The BlackChili compound delivers exceptional grip and low rolling resistance, while the tubeless design enables lower pressures for improved comfort and reduced punctures. The Lazer Grip shoulder tread enhances cornering confidence, and the 180 TPI casing provides supple road feel. The TR technology ensures reliable tubeless sealing, and the wear indicators show when replacement is needed. For road cyclists who want the benchmark tire for racing and fast training with tubeless convenience. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Continental packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 15000, '/assets/products/continental-grand-prix-5000-s-tr.webp', 16000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

