VALUES ('schwalbe-marathon-plus', 'Schwalbe Marathon Plus — Touring Tire, 700x32c, SmartGuard, Black', 'gadgets', 12000, 12000, 9000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/schwalbe-marathon-plus.webp', 'The Schwalbe Marathon Plus is the puncture-proof tire that commuters and tourers trust worldwide. The 5mm SmartGuard layer provides near-immunity to punctures from glass, thorns, and debris, while the Endurance compound delivers long tread life and reliable grip. The reflective sidewall enhances nighttime visibility, and the E-Bike Ready 50 rating supports e-bike speeds. The wire bead provides secure mounting, and the 700x32c size balances speed and comfort on rough roads. For commuters and tourers who refuse to deal with flats and want the most puncture-resistant tire available. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Schwalbe packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 9000, '/assets/products/schwalbe-marathon-plus.webp', 10000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

