VALUES ('maxxis-minion-dhf', 'Maxxis Minion DHF — MTB Tire, 29x2.5", 3C MaxxTerra, EXO, Black', 'gadgets', 15000, 15000, 12000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/maxxis-minion-dhf.webp', 'The Maxxis Minion DHF is the downhill tire that dominates enduro and trail riding. The aggressive tread pattern with ramped leading edges rolls efficiently while the channelled side knobs bite in corners, and the 3C MaxxTerra compound balances grip, rolling resistance, and longevity. The EXO sidewall protection resists cuts and abrasions, and the wide trail casing optimizes tire profile on 30-35mm rims. The tubeless-ready design enables lower pressures for improved traction and comfort. For aggressive trail riders and enduro racers who want the tire that has won more World Cup downhill races than any other. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Maxxis packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 12000, '/assets/products/maxxis-minion-dhf.webp', 13000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

