VALUES ('thule-t2-pro-xtr', 'Thule T2 Pro XTR — Hitch Bike Rack, 2 Bikes, Tool-Free, Black', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/thule-t2-pro-xtr.webp', 'The Thule T2 Pro XTR is the premium hitch rack that carries bikes without frame contact. The wheel-only mounting system secures bikes by the wheels, protecting carbon frames and custom paint, while the 60lb per bike capacity handles e-bikes and downhill rigs. The tool-free AutoAttach system enables quick rack installation and removal, and the integrated cable locks secure bikes to the rack. The HitchSwitch lever tilts the rack down for trunk access and folds flat for storage, and the integrated ramp enables easy e-bike loading. For cyclists with expensive bikes who want secure, frame-friendly transport with premium convenience features. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Thule packaging, lifetime Thule warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/thule-t2-pro-xtr.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

