VALUES ('sonos-era-300', 'Sonos Era 300 — Spatial Audio, Dolby Atmos, WiFi, Black', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/sonos-era-300.webp', 'The Sonos Era 300 is the spatial audio speaker that fills rooms with immersive sound. The six-driver array with waveguides projects music in every direction, creating a dome of sound that places instruments and vocals around you. The Dolby Atmos Music support enables true three-dimensional audio from supported services, and the Trueplay tuning adapts output to your room''s acoustics. The WiFi, Bluetooth, and USB-C line-in provide flexible connectivity, and the voice control with privacy switch enables hands-free operation. For audiophiles who want to experience spatial audio and Dolby Atmos Music without a complex multi-speaker setup. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sonos packaging, 1-year Sonos warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/sonos-era-300.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Sonos', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

