VALUES ('bose-smart-soundbar-600', 'Bose Smart Soundbar 600 — Dolby Atmos, TrueSpace, WiFi, Black', 'gadgets', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/bose-smart-soundbar-600.webp', 'The Bose Smart Soundbar 600 is the compact Atmos bar with Bose spatial audio. The TrueSpace technology upmixes stereo and 5.1 content to create immersive height effects from a compact design, while the Dolby Atmos decoding handles native Atmos content. The WiFi and Bluetooth connectivity stream music from any source, and the Bose Music app provides simple setup and control. The voice4video technology expands Alexa voice control to your TV and cable box, and the ADAPTiQ audio calibration optimizes sound for your room. For Bose fans who want compact Atmos immersion with the simplicity and sound signature they trust. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bose packaging, 1-year Bose warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/bose-smart-soundbar-600.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Bose', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

