VALUES ('samsung-hw-q990d', 'Samsung HW-Q990D — 11.1.4ch Soundbar, Dolby Atmos, Wireless Rear, Black', 'gadgets', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/samsung-hw-q990d.webp', 'The Samsung HW-Q990D is the flagship soundbar system with true 11.1.4 channels. The main bar, wireless subwoofer, and wireless rear speakers with up-firing drivers create a complete Dolby Atmos and DTS:X surround system without speaker wires. The SpaceFit Sound Pro calibrates audio to your room automatically, and the Q-Symphony synchronizes soundbar with Samsung TV speakers for expanded soundstage. The HDMI 2.1 with 4K120 pass-through supports next-gen gaming, and the built-in Alexa and AirPlay 2 enable voice control and streaming. For Samsung TV owners who want the most immersive, complete soundbar system with wireless rear speakers and gaming support. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Samsung packaging, 1-year Samsung warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/samsung-hw-q990d.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'Samsung', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

