VALUES ('lg-s95qr', 'LG S95QR — 9.1.5ch Soundbar, Center Up-Firing, Wireless Rear, Black', 'gadgets', 385000, 385000, 315000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/lg-s95qr.webp', 'The LG S95QR is the unique soundbar with a center up-firing speaker for clear dialogue. The 9.1.5 channel configuration includes a dedicated center up-firing driver that enhances dialogue clarity in Atmos content, while the wireless subwoofer and rear speakers create immersive surround sound. The AI Sound Pro upmixes stereo content to multi-channel, and the Meridian Audio tuning ensures balanced, detailed sound. The HDMI 2.1 with 4K120 and VRR pass-through supports next-gen gaming, and the built-in Google Assistant enables voice control. For LG TV owners who want enhanced dialogue clarity and comprehensive surround sound with gaming support. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original LG packaging, 1-year LG warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 315000, '/assets/products/lg-s95qr.webp', 350000, 4.5, 0, 'LG', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

