VALUES ('audioengine-a5-wireless', 'Audioengine A5+ Wireless — Active Bookshelf Speakers, Bluetooth aptX HD, Black', 'gadgets', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/audioengine-a5-wireless.webp', 'The Audioengine A5+ Wireless is the powered speaker system that brings HiFi to desktops and small rooms. The custom Kevlar woofers and silk dome tweeters deliver detailed, balanced sound with surprising bass extension, while the Bluetooth 5.0 with aptX HD provides high-quality wireless streaming. The RCA, 3.5mm, and USB inputs accommodate any source, and the subwoofer output enables bass expansion. The hand-built cabinets with furniture-grade finishes look as good as they sound, and the 150W total power fills rooms up to 30 square meters. For music lovers who want genuine HiFi sound with wireless convenience in a desktop-friendly size. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Audioengine packaging, 3-year Audioengine warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/audioengine-a5-wireless.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

