VALUES ('vanatoo-transparent-one-encore', 'Vanatoo Transparent One Encore — Active Speakers, 200W, Bluetooth, Black', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/vanatoo-transparent-one-encore.webp', 'The Vanatoo Transparent One Encore is the transparent speaker system that reveals every detail. The 200W total system power with dedicated amplifiers for each driver delivers dynamic, uncompressed sound, while the aluminum cone woofers and soft dome tweeters provide accurate frequency response. The Bluetooth 4.0 with aptX, optical, USB, and analog inputs provide versatile connectivity, and the subwoofer output enables bass expansion. The transparent mode reveals internal components through the front panel, and the compact design fits desktops and bookshelves. For audiophiles who want accurate, detailed sound with unique transparent aesthetics and versatile connectivity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Vanatoo packaging, 3-year Vanatoo warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/vanatoo-transparent-one-encore.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

