VALUES ('svs-sb-1000-pro', 'SVS SB-1000 Pro — 12" Sealed Subwoofer, 325W RMS, DSP, Black Ash', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/svs-sb-1000-pro.webp', 'The SVS SB-1000 Pro is the sealed subwoofer that delivers deep, accurate bass from a compact cabinet. The 12-inch high-excursion driver with 325W RMS and 820W peak power produces subsonic frequencies with precision, while the sealed design provides tight, musical bass without boom. The DSP control via SVS app enables custom EQ, room gain compensation, and preset modes, and the Bluetooth connectivity provides convenient adjustment from your listening position. The compact 13-inch cube fits in small rooms and tight spaces, and the piano gloss black and black ash finishes complement any decor. For music lovers and home theater enthusiasts who want accurate, room-filling bass without massive cabinet size. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SVS packaging, 5-year SVS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/svs-sb-1000-pro.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('svs-pb-1000-pro', 'SVS PB-1000 Pro — 12" Ported Subwoofer, 325W RMS, Port Tuning, Black Ash', 'gadgets', 245000, 245000, 200000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/svs-pb-1000-pro.webp', 'The SVS PB-1000 Pro is the ported subwoofer that maximizes output and extension. The 12-inch high-excursion driver with 325W RMS and 820W peak power delivers room-shaking output down to 17Hz, while the dual port design with tuning options optimizes response for music or movies. The DSP control via SVS app provides parametric EQ, room gain compensation, and port tuning selection, and the Bluetooth connectivity enables convenient adjustment. The compact ported cabinet fits most rooms, and the durable finish withstands daily use. For home theater enthusiasts who want maximum low-frequency impact and extension for explosive movie soundtracks. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original SVS packaging, 5-year SVS warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 200000, '/assets/products/svs-pb-1000-pro.webp', 222000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('rel-t5x', 'REL T/5x — 8" Subwoofer, 125W, High-Level Input, Black', 'gadgets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/rel-t5x.webp', 'The REL T/5x is the musical subwoofer that integrates seamlessly with stereo systems. The 8-inch long-throw driver with 125W Class A/B amplifier delivers fast, articulate bass that complements rather than overwhelms main speakers, while the unique high-level Neutrik input connects to amplifier speaker terminals for perfect tonal matching. The compact sealed design with downward-firing driver places discreetly in rooms, and the .1/LFE input handles home theater duty. The Arrow wireless compatibility enables cable-free placement, and the beautiful furniture-grade finish complements living spaces. For stereo music lovers who want to extend bass response without sacrificing musical coherence and room aesthetics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original REL packaging, 3-year REL warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/rel-t5x.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('klipsch-the-fives', 'Klipsch The Fives — Active Speakers, HDMI-ARC, Phono Preamp, Walnut', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/klipsch-the-fives.webp', 'The Klipsch The Fives are the active speakers that connect to everything including turntables. The HDMI-ARC input connects directly to TVs for enhanced sound, while the built-in phono preamp enables direct turntable connection without external boxes. The Tractrix horn-loaded tweeters and copper-spun woofers deliver the dynamic Klipsch sound signature, and the 160W total system power fills medium rooms. The Bluetooth 5.0, USB-B, optical, and analog inputs accommodate any source, and the subwoofer output enables bass expansion. The mid-century modern design with real wood veneer adds warmth to any room. For vinyl enthusiasts and TV viewers who want versatile connectivity and classic Klipsch sound in a beautiful, self-powered package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Klipsch packaging, 1-year Klipsch warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/klipsch-the-fives.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('fluance-ai81', 'Fluance Ai81 — Powered Tower Speakers, 280W, Bluetooth 5.0, Black Ash', 'gadgets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/fluance-ai81.webp', 'The Fluance Ai81 are the powered tower speakers that eliminate the need for separate components. The 280W total system power with dedicated amplifiers for each driver delivers room-filling sound from floor-standing cabinets, while the Bluetooth 5.0, optical, RCA, and USB inputs accommodate any source. The silk dome tweeters and woven glass fiber woofers provide detailed, balanced sound, and the bass reflex design with rear ports extends low frequencies without subwoofer need. The beautiful wood grain finishes with removable grilles complement living spaces, and the tower design eliminates the need for speaker stands. For music lovers who want full-range sound without the complexity of receivers, amplifiers, and multiple components. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Fluance packaging, 2-year Fluance warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/fluance-ai81.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('q-acoustics-3020i', 'Q Acoustics 3020i — Bookshelf Speakers, 25mm Tweeter, 125mm Woofer, White', 'gadgets', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/q-acoustics-3020i.webp', 'The Q Acoustics 3020i is the award-winning bookshelf speaker that punches above its price. The 25mm decoupled tweeter with wide dispersion creates detailed, spacious highs, while the 125mm precision driver with point-to-point bracing delivers tight, controlled bass. The increased cabinet size over the 3020 extends bass response and reduces distortion, and the beautiful finishes with chrome bezels complement modern interiors. The 6-ohm impedance and 88dB sensitivity make them easy to drive with modest amplifiers, and the magnetic grilles maintain clean aesthetics. For budget audiophiles who want refined, musical sound with British engineering and beautiful design. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Q Acoustics packaging, 4-year Q Acoustics warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/q-acoustics-3020i.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

