VALUES ('wharfedale-diamond-122', 'Wharfedale Diamond 12.2 — Bookshelf Speakers, Klarity Cone, 2-Way, Walnut', 'gadgets', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/wharfedale-diamond-122.webp', 'The Wharfedale Diamond 12.2 is the latest evolution of the legendary budget audiophile speaker. The Klarity cone woofer with precision-engineered cone profile delivers accurate, dynamic midrange and bass, while the woven polyester tweeter with front plate dispersion provides detailed, smooth highs. The slot-loaded port reduces turbulence and enables flexible placement near walls, and the beautiful wood grain finishes with magnetic grilles complement traditional and modern decor. The 88dB sensitivity and 8-ohm impedance ensure compatibility with most amplifiers. For music lovers who want the latest Wharfedale Diamond technology with refined sound and classic aesthetics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Wharfedale packaging, 2-year Wharfedale warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/wharfedale-diamond-122.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('elac-debut-20-b62', 'Elac Debut 2.0 B6.2 — Bookshelf Speakers, Aramid-Fiber Woofer, Black', 'gadgets', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/elac-debut-20-b62.webp', 'The Elac Debut 2.0 B6.2 is the Andrew Jones-designed speaker that redefined affordable HiFi. The 6.5-inch aramid-fiber woofer with oversized magnet and vented pole piece delivers tight, extended bass, while the 1-inch silk dome tweeter with wide-roll surround provides smooth, detailed highs. The thick MDF cabinet with internal bracing reduces resonance and coloration, and the front-firing port enables bookshelf placement without bass boom. The 87dB sensitivity and 6-ohm impedance work with quality amplifiers, and the clean black ash finish suits any room. For audiophiles on a budget who want engineered sound quality from a legendary speaker designer. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Elac packaging, 1-year Elac warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/elac-debut-20-b62.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('dali-oberon-3', 'Dali Oberon 3 — Bookshelf Speakers, SMC Magnet, 7" Woofer, Black Ash', 'gadgets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/dali-oberon-3.webp', 'The Dali Oberon 3 is the Danish bookshelf speaker with patented SMC technology. The 7-inch wood fiber woofer with Soft Magnetic Compound magnet reduces distortion and mechanical loss for cleaner, more dynamic bass, while the 29mm ultra-light soft dome tweeter delivers detailed, airy highs. The large cabinet volume extends bass response into subwoofer territory, and the wide dispersion pattern creates spacious soundstaging. The beautiful Scandinavian design with matte finishes and magnetic grilles adds understated elegance, and the 87dB sensitivity ensures amplifier compatibility. For music lovers who want Danish engineering, low distortion, and room-filling sound from compact cabinets. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Dali packaging, 5-year Dali warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/dali-oberon-3.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('bowers-wilkins-606-s3', 'Bowers & Wilkins 606 S3 — Bookshelf Speakers, Continuum Cone, 2-Way, Oak', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/bowers-wilkins-606-s3.webp', 'The Bowers & Wilkins 606 S3 is the entry to the legendary 600 Series with Continuum cone technology. The 6.5-inch Continuum cone mid/bass driver, derived from the 800 Series Diamond, delivers transparent, uncolored midrange, while the 25mm Decoupled Double Dome tweeter provides detailed, extended highs. The improved crossover and cabinet bracing reduce coloration and improve imaging, and the beautiful oak finish with magnetic grilles complements refined interiors. The 88dB sensitivity and 8-ohm nominal impedance work with quality amplifiers, and the rear-firing Flowport extends bass cleanly. For audiophiles entering the B&W ecosystem who want Continuum cone technology and British refinement at an accessible price. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Bowers & Wilkins packaging, 2-year B&W warranty. Focal Chora 806 — Bookshelf Speakers, Slatefiber Cone, 2-Way', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/bowers-wilkins-606-s3.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('focal-chora-806', 'Focal Chora 806 — Bookshelf Speakers, Slatefiber Cone, 2-Way, Dark Wood', 'gadgets', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/focal-chora-806.webp', 'The Focal Chora 806 is the French-crafted bookshelf speaker with innovative Slatefiber cone technology. The 6.5-inch Slatefiber woofer, made from recycled carbon fiber and thermoplastic polymer, delivers dynamic, detailed bass and midrange with low coloration, while the 1-inch aluminum/magnesium TNF tweeter provides smooth, extended highs. The ported cabinet with front-firing vent enables flexible placement, and the modern design with angled stands optimizes time alignment. The 89dB sensitivity and 8-ohm impedance ensure broad amplifier compatibility, and the beautiful dark wood finish adds European sophistication. For music lovers who want French artisanal craftsmanship with modern driver technology and striking aesthetics. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Focal packaging, 5-year Focal warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/focal-chora-806.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('kef-q350', 'KEF Q350 — Bookshelf Speakers, Uni-Q Driver, 2-Way, White', 'gadgets', 145000, 145000, 118000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/kef-q350.webp', 'The KEF Q350 is the award-winning bookshelf speaker with signature Uni-Q coaxial driver. The 6.5-inch Uni-Q array places the tweeter in the acoustic center of the mid/bass cone, creating point-source dispersion that eliminates sweet spot limitations, while the improved cabinet damping and crossover reduce resonance. The detailed, spacious soundstaging reveals nuances in recordings, and the 87dB sensitivity works with quality amplifiers. The clean modern design with magnetic grilles and color-matched finishes suits contemporary interiors, and the rear port includes foam insert for placement flexibility. For audiophiles who want KEF''s renowned Uni-Q technology with wide dispersion and precise imaging in an affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original KEF packaging, 5-year KEF warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 118000, '/assets/products/kef-q350.webp', 131000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('cambridge-audio-axa35', 'Cambridge Audio AXA35 — Integrated Amplifier, 35W, MM Phono, Black', 'gadgets', 85000, 85000, 69000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/cambridge-audio-axa35.webp', 'The Cambridge Audio AXA35 is the integrated amplifier that brings vinyl and digital sources to life. The 35 watts per channel of Class AB power drives most bookshelf speakers with authority, while the built-in MM phono stage connects turntables without external preamps. The four RCA inputs accommodate CD players, streamers, and other sources, and the 3.5mm front input enables convenient phone connection. The toroidal transformer and separate preamp/power amp circuit boards minimize crosstalk and noise, and the full-size remote control provides convenient adjustment. For vinyl enthusiasts and budget audiophiles who want a clean, musical amplifier with built-in phono stage and classic British sound. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Cambridge Audio packaging, 2-year Cambridge Audio warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69000, '/assets/products/cambridge-audio-axa35.webp', 77000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('marantz-pm6007', 'Marantz PM6007 — Integrated Amplifier, 45W, DAC, MM Phono, Black', 'gadgets', 185000, 185000, 151000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/marantz-pm6007.webp', 'The Marantz PM6007 is the refined integrated amplifier with digital connectivity. The 45 watts per channel of current feedback power delivers dynamic, detailed sound, while the built-in AK4490 DAC with optical and coaxial inputs enables direct digital source connection. The MM phono stage with Marantz Musical Phono EQ preserves vinyl warmth, and the Source Direct mode bypasses tone controls for pure signal path. The toroidal transformer and HDAM-SA3 modules ensure low noise and wide dynamic range, and the remote control operates Marantz CD players for unified system control. For audiophiles who want a versatile amplifier that handles analog vinyl and digital sources with Marantz''s signature musicality. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Marantz packaging, 2-year Marantz warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 151000, '/assets/products/marantz-pm6007.webp', 168000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('nad-c-316bee-v2', 'NAD C 316BEE V2 — Integrated Amplifier, 40W, MM Phono, Graphite', 'gadgets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/nad-c-316bee-v2.webp', 'The NAD C 316BEE V2 is the budget amplifier that punches above its weight with PowerDrive technology. The 40 watts per channel with PowerDrive deliver dynamic peaks that rival higher-wattage amplifiers, while the low distortion and wide bandwidth preserve musical detail. The MM phono input accommodates turntables, and the five line-level inputs handle multiple sources. The toroidal power transformer and discrete circuitry ensure reliability and sound quality, and the full-size chassis with graphite finish exudes understated quality. For budget audiophiles who want NAD''s renowned PowerDrive dynamics and musical honesty without premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original NAD packaging, 2-year NAD warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/nad-c-316bee-v2.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('rega-planar-1-plus', 'Rega Planar 1 Plus — Turntable, Built-in Phono Preamp, White', 'gadgets', 225000, 225000, 184000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/rega-planar-1-plus.webp', 'The Rega Planar 1 Plus is the plug-and-play turntable that eliminates phono preamp shopping. The same acclaimed RB110 tonearm and Carbon cartridge as the standard Planar 1 deliver detailed, musical vinyl playback, while the built-in Rega phono stage enables direct connection to any line input. The 24v low-noise motor with phenolic resin platter provides stable, accurate speed, and the minimalist design with no switches or adjustments simplifies operation. The high-gloss acrylic laminate finish looks stunning, and the lifetime warranty on the main bearing reflects Rega confidence. For vinyl newcomers who want acclaimed Rega sound without the complexity of external phono stages. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Rega packaging, lifetime Rega warranty on bearing.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 184000, '/assets/products/rega-planar-1-plus.webp', 204000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('pro-ject-debut-carbon-evo', 'Pro-Ject Debut Carbon EVO — Turntable, Carbon Tonearm, 8.6", Satin White', 'gadgets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/pro-ject-debut-carbon-evo.webp', 'The Pro-Ject Debut Carbon EVO is the evolved classic that set the standard for affordable audiophile turntables. The one-piece carbon fiber tonearm reduces resonance and tracking error, while the Sumiko Rainier cartridge delivers detailed, musical playback. The electronic speed change switches between 33 and 45 RPM without belt adjustment, and the heavy steel platter with TPE damping reduces wow and flutter. The adjustable feet and heavy chassis minimize external vibration, and the beautiful satin finishes with metal platter add visual elegance. For vinyl enthusiasts who want a fully featured, beautifully finished turntable with carbon tonearm and quality cartridge. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Pro-Ject packaging, 2-year Pro-Ject warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/pro-ject-debut-carbon-evo.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('audio-technica-at-lp120xusb', 'Audio-Technica AT-LP120XUSB — Direct Drive Turntable, USB, S-Shape Arm, Black', 'gadgets', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/audio-technica-at-lp120xusb.webp', 'The Audio-Technica AT-LP120XUSB is the direct drive turntable that bridges DJ and audiophile worlds. The quartz-controlled direct drive motor provides stable, accurate speed with high torque for quick start-up, while the S-shaped tonearm with adjustable tracking force and anti-skate accommodates cartridges from DJ to audiophile grades. The USB output digitizes vinyl collections for computer archiving, and the built-in phono preamp enables connection to any system. The stroboscopic platter with pitch adjustment supports DJ use, and the die-cast aluminum platter reduces resonance. For DJs and vinyl collectors who want versatile, reliable direct drive performance with digital archiving capability. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Audio-Technica packaging, 2-year Audio-Technica warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/audio-technica-at-lp120xusb.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Audio-Technica', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('sony-ps-lx310bt', 'Sony PS-LX310BT — Belt Drive Turntable, Bluetooth, USB, Black', 'gadgets', 55000, 55000, 45000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/sony-ps-lx310bt.webp', 'The Sony PS-LX310BT is the Bluetooth turntable that wirelessly streams vinyl to speakers and headphones. The belt drive system with aluminum die-cast platter provides stable playback, while the built-in phono preamp and Bluetooth transmitter enable wireless connection to any Bluetooth speaker or headphone. The USB output digitizes records to computer, and the one-step auto play starts and stops records automatically. The fully automatic tonearm with moving magnet cartridge requires no manual cueing, and the dust cover protects records during playback. For casual vinyl listeners who want wireless convenience and automatic operation without audiophile complexity. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Sony packaging, 1-year Sony warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 45000, '/assets/products/sony-ps-lx310bt.webp', 50000, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('cambridge-audio-alva-tt-v2', 'Cambridge Audio Alva TT V2 — Direct Drive Turntable, aptX HD Bluetooth, Black', 'gadgets', 685000, 685000, 561000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/cambridge-audio-alva-tt-v2.webp', 'The Cambridge Audio Alva TT V2 is the high-end turntable with wireless streaming built in. The direct drive motor with polyoxymethylene platter provides stable, accurate speed, while the integrated Alva MC cartridge delivers exceptional detail and dynamics. The aptX HD Bluetooth transmits high-resolution audio wirelessly to compatible speakers and headphones, and the switchable phono stage enables traditional wired connection. The high-mass chassis with constrained layer damping minimizes resonance, and the beautiful design with smoked dust cover adds sophistication. For audiophiles who want premium vinyl playback with the convenience of wireless streaming to modern audio systems. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Cambridge Audio packaging, 2-year Cambridge Audio warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 561000, '/assets/products/cambridge-audio-alva-tt-v2.webp', 623000, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('chord-mojo-2', 'Chord Mojo 2 — Portable DAC/AMP, FPGA, 3.5mm + 3.5mm, Black', 'gadgets', 285000, 285000, 233000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/chord-mojo-2.webp', 'The Chord Mojo 2 is the British-engineered portable DAC that reveals hidden detail in your music. The custom FPGA DAC with Xilinx Artix 7 processor delivers reference-grade conversion without off-the-shelf chip limitations, while the two 3.5mm headphone outputs enable shared listening. The four-function button matrix provides intuitive control of volume, input, and DSP filtering, and the micro USB and USB-C inputs accommodate any digital source. The CNC-milled aircraft-grade aluminum chassis provides shielding and durability, and the 8-hour battery life supports extended listening sessions. For headphone enthusiasts who want Chord''s renowned FPGA technology in a pocket-sized package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Chord packaging, 1-year Chord warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 233000, '/assets/products/chord-mojo-2.webp', 259000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ifi-go-bar', 'iFi GO bar — Portable DAC/AMP, 4.4mm Balanced, MQA, Black', 'gadgets', 125000, 125000, 102000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/ifi-go-bar.webp', 'The iFi GO bar is the ultraportable DAC/amp that fits on your keychain. The ESS Sabre HiFi DAC with 4.4mm balanced and 3.5mm S-Balanced outputs drives demanding headphones from a device smaller than a USB drive. The MQA rendering, DSD256, and PCM 384kHz support handle any high-resolution format, and the XBass+ and XSpace modes enhance bass and soundstage. The aluminum chassis with LED indicators provides durability and status visibility, and the USB-C connectivity works with phones, tablets, and computers. For audiophiles who want reference-grade portable audio that disappears in a pocket. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original iFi packaging, 1-year iFi warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 102000, '/assets/products/ifi-go-bar.webp', 113000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('audioengine-d1', 'Audioengine D1 — Desktop DAC/AMP, 24-bit/96kHz, USB/Optical, Silver', 'gadgets', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/audioengine-d1.webp', 'The Audioengine D1 is the desktop DAC that improves any computer''s audio output. The AK4396 DAC with 24-bit/96kHz capability delivers clearer, more detailed sound than built-in audio, while the headphone amplifier drives most headphones with authority. The USB and optical inputs accommodate computers and digital sources, and the RCA outputs connect to powered speakers or amplifiers. The compact aluminum design fits under monitors and travels easily, and the plug-and-play operation requires no drivers on Mac or PC. For desktop users who want improved audio quality for music production, gaming, and critical listening without complex setups. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Audioengine packaging, 3-year Audioengine warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/audioengine-d1.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('schiit-modi-3', 'Schiit Modi 3+ — DAC, AK4493, USB/Optical/Coaxial, Made in USA, Black', 'gadgets', 38000, 38000, 31000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/schiit-modi-3.webp', 'The Schiit Modi 3+ is the affordable DAC that proves American-made audio does not require luxury pricing. The AK4493 DAC chip with three input options — USB, optical, and coaxial — handles any digital source, while the Unison USB interface provides excellent jitter rejection. The DC-coupled output with no capacitors in the signal path ensures transparent sound, and the made-in-California construction reflects Schiit''s commitment to domestic manufacturing. The compact design stacks perfectly with Schiit amps, and the plug-and-play USB requires no drivers. For budget audiophiles who want quality DAC performance with American manufacturing and no-nonsense design. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Schiit packaging, 2-year Schiit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 31000, '/assets/products/schiit-modi-3.webp', 34000, 4.5, 0, 'Schiit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('schiit-magni-3', 'Schiit Magni 3+ — Headphone Amplifier, Made in USA, Silver', 'gadgets', 38000, 38000, 31000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/schiit-magni-3.webp', 'The Schiit Magni 3+ is the headphone amp that powers any headphone with clean, transparent sound. The fully discrete, current-feedback design delivers over 2W per channel into 32 ohms — enough for the most demanding planar magnetic headphones — while the DC-coupled signal path preserves musical detail. The made-in-California construction with aluminum chassis ensures durability and shielding, and the compact size stacks with Schiit DACs for a minimal desktop setup. The gain switch accommodates sensitive IEMs and demanding full-size cans, and the RCA preamp outputs enable connection to powered speakers. For headphone enthusiasts who want clean, powerful amplification without coloration or premium pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Schiit packaging, 2-year Schiit warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 31000, '/assets/products/schiit-magni-3.webp', 34000, 4.5, 0, 'Schiit', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('jds-labs-atom-amp-2', 'JDS Labs Atom Amp 2 — Headphone Amplifier, 2.7W, RCA Loop, Black', 'gadgets', 42000, 42000, 34000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/jds-labs-atom-amp-2.webp', 'The JDS Labs Atom Amp 2 is the measurement-perfect headphone amp with exceptional power. The 2.7 watts per channel into 32 ohms drives any headphone with headroom to spare, while the vanishingly low distortion and noise preserve every detail of the recording. The RCA loop output enables connection to speakers without splitter cables, and the compact design fits any desk. The gain switch accommodates sensitive and demanding headphones, and the made-in-Illinois construction ensures quality. For objective audiophiles who want transparent, powerful amplification that measures as well as anything on the market. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original JDS Labs packaging, 2-year JDS Labs warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 34000, '/assets/products/jds-labs-atom-amp-2.webp', 38000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('topping-l30-ii', 'Topping L30 II — Headphone Amplifier, NFCA, 3.5W, 6.35mm, Black', 'gadgets', 32000, 32000, 26000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/topping-l30-ii.webp', 'The Topping L30 II is the compact headphone amp with flagship power. The NFCA module delivers 3.5W into 32 ohms and drives sensitive IEMs to demanding planars with ultra-low noise, while the single-ended 6.35mm output provides broad compatibility. The three gain settings accommodate any headphone sensitivity, and the compact design stacks with Topping DACs for a minimal footprint. The included 6.35mm to 3.5mm adapter enables IEM use, and the precision volume control provides fine adjustment. For headphone enthusiasts who want maximum power and minimal noise in a compact, affordable package. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Topping packaging, 1-year Topping warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 26000, '/assets/products/topping-l30-ii.webp', 29000, 4.5, 0, 'Topping', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('topping-e30-ii', 'Topping E30 II — DAC, AK4493S, USB/Optical/Coaxial, Remote, Black', 'gadgets', 28000, 28000, 22000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/topping-e30-ii.webp', 'The Topping E30 II is the affordable DAC that measures like equipment costing 10x more. The dual AK4493S DAC chips with XMOS XU208 USB interface support PCM 768kHz and DSD512, while the ultra-low distortion and noise reveal details hidden by lesser DACs. The remote control enables convenient input switching and volume adjustment, and the compact design fits anywhere. The preamp mode enables direct connection to powered speakers, and the auto-on/wake feature powers up with source detection. For objective audiophiles and budget-conscious listeners who want reference-grade measurements and transparent sound at an unbeatable price. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Topping packaging, 1-year Topping warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22000, '/assets/products/topping-e30-ii.webp', 25000, 4.5, 0, 'Topping', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('topping-dx1', 'Topping DX1 — DAC/Headphone Amp, AK4493S, USB-B, 6.35mm, Black', 'gadgets', 22000, 22000, 18000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/topping-dx1.webp', 'The Topping DX1 is the entry-level DAC/amp that introduces audiophiles to Topping''s measurement-first philosophy. The AK4493S DAC with built-in headphone amplifier delivers clean, detailed sound for headphones and IEMs, while the compact design occupies minimal desk space. The USB-B input connects to computers, and the 6.35mm headphone output with included 3.5mm adapter accommodates most headphones. The plug-and-play operation requires no drivers, and the precision volume control enables fine level adjustment. For students and first-time audiophiles who want to experience the difference a quality DAC/amp makes without significant investment. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Topping packaging, 1-year Topping warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 18000, '/assets/products/topping-dx1.webp', 20000, 4.5, 0, 'Topping', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('hifiman-sundara', 'Hifiman Sundara — Planar Magnetic Headphones, Open-Back, Black', 'gadgets', 95000, 95000, 77000, 10, 1.0, '/assets/products/hifiman-sundara.webp', 'The Hifiman Sundara is the planar magnetic headphone that redefined the mid-range. The ultra-thin planar driver with NEO supernan diaphragm delivers exceptional detail, speed, and soundstage at a price previously reserved for dynamic drivers. The open-back design creates spacious, natural imaging, and the lightweight headband with hybrid ear pads enables comfortable extended listening. The 94dB sensitivity and 37-ohm impedance make them drivable from portable devices, though they scale with better amplification. For audiophiles entering planar magnetic headphones who want reference-grade detail and soundstage without flagship pricing. Condition: Brand new, sealed, original Hifiman packaging, 1-year Hifiman warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 77000, '/assets/products/hifiman-sundara.webp', 86000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

